<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="6">

  <DocumentRef DateTime="20260321T230939" id="40a7a843-0fec-494a-a08b-ab87f000d402">
    <XRef DateTime="19691231T155959" id="31eebf07-025b-4252-816e-1747d15525b1"/>
  </DocumentRef>

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="66cd33d8-8419-4743-a0fb-774ea700ca14">
      <Text>FADE IN:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bdefe567-7dbe-473f-b5cc-f1ec18161d56">
      <Text>BLACK SCREEN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7b18fcaf-2da5-4e6c-b668-4516936f342b">
      <Text>LORA (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c0f4ba26-bddd-4217-8063-43335358ecb1">
      <Text>Judgment Day.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="15057573-97e3-49a4-afb2-0b26522d7ee6">
      <Text>BEGIN TO FADE IN:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="32d6895a-f42d-40d0-87c9-743756b8d700">
      <Text>LORA (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6adb11b9-c93c-4726-9f7c-42e41f2c314d">
      <Text>Three billion dead. Dark rain and Machines took care of the rest. There's maybe a few hundred of us left.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="b043dbe4-c91d-462e-9f42-d5da40a90390">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. MACHINE CITY - SUNSET</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7c99d01e-567a-4f3d-a1ba-43b664a11e55">
      <Text>Chrome spires rising from the ruins of Los Angeles. Ash sky. Hunter-Killers — HKs — launching from platforms in the clouds.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c3cefe8f-b39e-48db-9bfe-8e29c1a8f8b2">
      <Text>Silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a021c4a7-83f8-4c2a-8ca7-13e92a2efc2c">
      <Text>LORA (V.O.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0907d9d4-a483-447a-80ac-4b20f450448c">
      <Text>We built a virus that works. It's finally ready.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="97eb2f5e-36b1-4e79-ab6e-f123a4c54eda">
      <Text>The sun setting in the West.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="6d2d4769-f2a2-4f83-be1c-8424526f4feb">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DENNIS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FREEMAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. CENTRAL CORE - INTERFACE PORT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a36570f7-f1df-4446-accb-1ca284ec3cb9">
      <Text>A crystal data disk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ee721bb2-6c6f-4a50-b8be-4cbfb8b717b6">
      <Text>Ribbons of light PULSE through the circuits. Rapid. Dying.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="539ef0dd-90c5-415f-b2a0-4f7123fb22b1">
      <Text>Subtitles: UPLOAD 98%... 99%...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1d4323ac-8135-4dab-8bad-445bc348e463">
      <Text>CLOSE ON GENERAL SARA FREEMAN. Face lit by cold blue flicker.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3d884a57-cadd-477b-8ae3-c05e2848f08f">
      <Text>DENNIS behind her. Facing the corridor they came through. Rifle up. His back to her back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4c2c1e1a-172a-42ce-8f3a-def6880c530b">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="cf406a33-dccd-4089-abeb-76e8d8057fd4">
      <Text>(whispering)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="99d4c7ae-087b-4d50-abc9-6791745efb5c">
      <Text>Come on, damn it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6f534497-0c85-4022-918f-45f8e74cea6c">
      <Text>DENNIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="8fceecc4-7f8a-43aa-8328-ce72c4fb7f9f">
      <Text>(a dry rasp)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="152793d6-d031-4ca3-924a-3ceac6a14b93">
      <Text>If we get out of here you owe me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="65f8f00f-88f1-4e85-9196-03a2d656d771">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e0a04813-8d21-4345-8ed8-bcd8daa91e56">
      <Text>The pool game? — cat's fault.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="806aad37-6ee3-48e2-88ea-533dd11d2d60">
      <Text>Dennis grins. Eyes never leaving the corridor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="23f2a271-65c9-4b27-806f-86cb190c6391">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. MACHINE CITY PAD - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d6fab811-5599-483e-bd1a-3abe5378956d">
      <Text>On the pad. Hundreds of feet above the clouds. Clean air. Clear. The setting sun bathing the HK in deep reds.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a677a4b4-50e0-4358-a6c7-7959133a598e">
      <Text>INTERCUT - INT. HK-AERIAL HUD:
Machine language characters fill the display. 
Subtitles translate beneath:
SKYNET: IDENT REQUEST.
Beat.
HK-882: STANDBY MODE. AWAITING COMMAND.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c19bde84-c9f2-4457-a2f1-8780349233c6">
      <Text>BACK TO SCENE:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c19bde84-c9f2-4457-a2f1-8780349233c6">
      <Text>The HK on the pad below. Still. Engines idling. Playing dead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="082368ad-57d8-4b58-ba24-62ddcae1e657">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 5/8" Page="2" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FREEMAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SOLDIER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. CENTRAL CORE - INTERFACE PORT - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4060feea-0fce-44aa-a287-e0dd6749f8b9">
      <Text>The light current SLOWS.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="136f77bb-0d1b-4419-8505-2d105740c61c">
      <Text>Freeman reaches back. Her hand finds Dennis's arm. Squeezes. Eyes still on the upload.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="38de843b-b486-4df0-ac0a-433957837433">
      <Text>UPLOAD 100%.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="df221d39-440b-4cf7-a0ed-4c70ba736818">
      <Text>He turns. The kiss. Quick. The upload dying between them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f1240a7d-a98c-4671-a11e-26814d577897">
      <Text>Freeman pulls the disk free.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="551336db-a0be-44e5-9b2f-092bb24dafb7">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f259c66c-204a-4084-9b94-440ca198ed96">
      <Text>Let's go.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="987fad6d-ef59-4e3d-95db-099fd9554528">
      <Text>THUD. Heavy movement.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2b353789-ddf5-46c2-b6c0-3c4427c2e28a">
      <Text>BOOM. A bulkhead SHUDDERS.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="345b6c8f-c3b8-415c-ac5a-658fcfa35244">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0b4f2050-673a-4cab-a000-a3b8c3eaaa7b">
      <Text>MOVE.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="555ddabf-1cf5-473d-b085-4220c8a29256">
      <Text>Dennis grabs Freeman's shoulder. Pushes her ahead of him. Puts himself between her and the chrome.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c6fa8a00-a1d3-4c96-8343-da4fdb50891e">
      <Text>White. Everywhere. Blinding.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="47b97da0-7575-4ff5-9356-ddaf3b8f4ddd">
      <Text>T-800 endoskeletons erupt from the haze. Chrome skulls. No flesh. Ghosts in the glare.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d57d3999-7826-4dfd-87ab-f68d6e4575e6">
      <Text>PLASMA BOLTS strobe the corridors.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d643971f-0171-445e-af63-45e3b87f1f30">
      <Text>Bullets punch black holes in white walls.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e56406f7-6f5d-4cba-8908-a031fd14754b">
      <Text>Plasma scorches the rest. Orange craters cooling to black.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ea9e81d1-f26d-4550-ac78-836cfb2d5705">
      <Text>High-speed retreat. Running blind through the glare.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="337bb6ee-0801-470d-b976-048344ed4087">
      <Text>Dennis at the back. Covering fire. Two soldiers with him. One falls. Then the other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="42fb3dc5-4d79-4708-beff-328674dfd498">
      <Text>THE PLATFORM:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f60d499d-e491-492a-9d99-7390df93176d">
      <Text>The HK — engines spooling, lifting off the deck. It pivots. Lowers the rear ramp mid-hover. Hot </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">evac</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c8ae2fb2-3887-4a84-9e10-36aa2ca9803c">
      <Text>The team reaches the pad. Clouds swirl below.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="20d6958a-e167-498c-9239-398f16bca697">
      <Text>SOLDIER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="f5192a8e-3b1d-460a-956f-fb257756a29b">
      <Text>(from the ramp)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f14585eb-a93b-4976-ada5-e9f8b5cd55f9">
      <Text>COME ON!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f8cbb1f5-b263-4aa0-acf4-2352d4c3ba2c">
      <Text>Freeman turns. Dennis is HIT. DOWN.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f99dfcd9-c8c2-4416-8f8c-db3f22e012fe">
      <Text>He looks at Freeman.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c959cbbf-734a-4da8-b70e-61965e4ea3df">
      <Text>Freeman raises her pistol. Her hand won't stop shaking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ecf82fd5-90a2-4937-96bc-de221613020c">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ad8d2d46-8eef-4cf5-b757-21886e0fc739">
      <Text>DENNIS!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5695832f-0bf6-4237-b6c0-c106128ef29f">
      <Text>PLASMA BOLTS zip past her head. </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">SPANG</Text>
      <Text> off the hull behind her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1827ff9b-105f-4cf0-ae0c-2c02db613e31">
      <Text>Soldiers grab her and drag her onto the ramp. Others hauling wounded up behind them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b7cff99c-1f02-45e7-b81f-5d26e2030d17">
      <Text>INTERCUT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7b7b2d13-9302-4d96-a405-30b76c148611">
      <Text>Dennis engulfed by CHROME SHADOWS. Dragged back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8bbe0aba-46c1-4bbb-bf57-dd4414bfc1df">
      <Text>BACK TO SCENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e48da6f8-b8c2-4783-be84-bbec7169394d">
      <Text>The ramp SLAMS shut. Bolts hammering the hull.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b2f8f982-b129-4372-a57b-dba834175c64">
      <Text>The VTOLs scream — the HK lurches off the pad, climbing hard. One engine trailing smoke. Chrome figures below, still firing, shrinking in the red light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bef8998a-5e68-4648-a99a-dc7a0f72c901">
      <Text>The HK banks north.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9266218d-bba9-44b4-9bef-cf9e0e333fe0">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="4" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FREEMAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. HK - IN FLIGHT - DUSK</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="721364f0-cdfa-4be1-af31-b6d3fc81a14f">
      <Text>Blue emergency lighting. Two hours north of Machine City.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="598e2cab-bc55-4bfe-94b0-b7496adacad0">
      <Text>LORA (32) and a SOLDIER tend to a wounded comrade. Field dressing turns dark red the moment it touches skin. Lora works fast. Steady hands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4e2dab28-edb0-4f71-9e19-b1a0c0ecbf29">
      <Text>Freeman beside them. Passes Lora a compression bandage. Her hands shaking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="20f67b97-35ab-4df8-ba8c-371eefcc8ccf">
      <Text>Lora glances up. Reads Freeman's face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5264b6bd-02ac-45a6-8a94-71a8d0b7d4c5">
      <Text>Freeman stares at the blood on her hands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cedb8677-ebae-458c-9f14-bd442d920386">
      <Text>Lora moves to her. Arm around her shoulders. Freeman leans in. Shaking. Breathing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="130f3ab3-5d88-4253-8dda-e9261a8e4e6d">
      <Text>The HK's engines filling the silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1bbc891a-294b-48ae-b2f6-f4659c2a18c8">
      <Text>Freeman pulls back. Wipes her face. Straightens. Commander again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8bbd5a76-fb09-4232-82b8-aa68a4907916">
      <Text>She pulls the disk from her pocket. Holds it up to the blue light. Small. Translucent.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="25c6c63d-adc2-4bf1-b955-8e8426473178">
      <Text>Light catches the lattice inside. No two alike.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5d469c49-42de-4963-87c1-688d044becf6">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="88bbfc12-e655-4576-ba16-7bb4f841397c">
      <Text>Is it in?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b2d11f33-897a-4e41-b397-a77b0aad1e95">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="f650db09-ff65-431d-9755-a8f6842a810d">
      <Text>(distant)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ce4490a8-1e15-48ea-8a98-800a5a48314d">
      <Text>It's in. Give it a few days and their whole network falls apart.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8e45dc51-26f6-4777-82e2-5e129333d8c2">
      <Text>She looks out the viewport.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b302723c-7113-441d-b059-19b154baa41f">
      <Text>The ruined coast of Washington sliding past.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1c543914-9489-48c4-8c32-582ea0560e51">
      <Text>The crumpled SPACE NEEDLE. Bent nearly in half.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="383a4bd1-78b1-43a9-ad60-57a7a8596727">
      <Text>The aircraft banks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="69a282a0-1730-4c78-a0d1-96848aa64582">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="4" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FREEMAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. BANGOR NAVAL BASE - WASHINGTON - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f3ed6abc-5393-4b3f-83fb-9f97460ee811">
      <Text>The last light gone. Dark sky. Low clouds reflecting distant fires.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ddebb0ee-4d20-4111-a621-5afef21a563c">
      <Text>CLOSE ON: A SKELETON.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="03015849-60a1-448a-a1cc-be3074f1bff4">
      <Text>Slumped over a steering wheel. US Army helmet — 1990s issue — still on its skull. The jaw hangs open.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="ab28803b-774f-4c52-b6a4-c7d4f145deee">
      <Text>CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f341dde9-de28-4169-b5e1-d5431ea2fa10">
      <Text>JOHN CONNOR on the back of a technical — battered pickup, older than the war. Captured plasma cannon bolted to the bed. John behind the trigger. Watching the HK come in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="3fb17150-718b-475b-a69c-03afa6ae4cad">
      <Text>CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7cc659b8-f86a-423b-9f9c-dc6ddb969e65">
      <Text>The same skeleton. Wider now. The Humvee rusted, markings faded. Thirty-five years dead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a77aac26-6a3a-4ce9-9117-0f60cc117462">
      <Text>PAN across the battlefield. Wreckage on wreckage. Chrome melted into steel. Skeletons inside. Skeletons beside them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="95ebbc5a-931b-4fe3-9e6c-1b8d6da23f8a">
      <Text>Vehicles with Resistance markings. Skulls. Crossed rifles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8e9c7cd5-77d1-4b1a-9dab-66157115e523">
      <Text>TITLE CARD:
BANGOR NAVAL BASE, WASHINGTON — 2032</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fbeaf177-e314-4c06-963b-ae51003cc859">
      <Text>Forty soldiers outside the base entrance. What's left.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="44559de4-a0a5-4c1e-b7ea-250c14da86a6">
      <Text>The HK screams in low. No landing gear. Hot drop.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="db0191a7-ac6a-433d-9061-437319cff7f9">
      <Text>Ramp comes down. Lora and a soldier carrying the wounded man on a stretcher. Freeman behind them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="82e49d9b-eada-4592-9b6e-ef1f38f72724">
      <Text>Freeman reaches John. Out of breath.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0aeb76a7-19a0-4675-84a9-e3ea4e58f22a">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="286f979d-431a-4445-94b7-5831f97fba50">
      <Text>We did it. It's in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d1a71309-37d2-4e8e-b192-9e1716eab068">
      <Text>Reads her face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d8a9bc12-78ab-45fb-965a-886906fe3dad">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f332cb6c-0042-4e62-a046-39ed9ab84ed7">
      <Text>How many did we lose?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="646ef840-e148-4bef-a07d-5ff2aec73bbf">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cc23953b-7a35-43b4-9292-8549ab9cd5ca">
      <Text>Too many. They're on us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="316aed90-3f09-43e9-af44-ff76dd52b780">
      <Text>They RUN. Boots on metal grating. Down the corridor — industrial, dim emergency lighting.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ab9ce28b-6ba6-4b1b-b3ba-84edd9bb2ef4">
      <Text>Through THE HUB — cavernous, corbelled ceiling disappearing into shadow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="95a68820-e33a-4700-8097-51ab754be9d5">
      <Text>CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9f068940-72e0-42d8-885f-deda1b9bef85">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="5" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. BANGOR NAVAL BASE - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7a4251b8-02a0-4cc9-9746-cdceaf8e8a77">
      <Text>Distant lights on the dark horizon. Pinpricks. Moving.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="f226a9a8-f756-495e-8c5d-5334a2c94c00">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="6" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FREEMAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. VAULT CORRIDOR - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fcd42b64-9bfe-4c55-9ea9-d5bbb0aa0744">
      <Text>John presses his face against the biometric reader. Eyes cupped. Retinal scan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ddab70f8-107e-4e31-8824-0560464a565a">
      <Text>GREEN.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="63ebda76-dd1f-4323-a1bf-af12eb6b9210">
      <Text>The vault door unseals — hiss, then massive steel pins retracting.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="80e98bd8-d8d8-4838-913d-0c06eccd4952">
      <Text>Freeman hands him the disk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0b1bff39-4e82-4be7-a385-87b51bed9c9c">
      <Text>He steps inside. A glimpse — bare walls, a single shelf, the disk hidden away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ffff7099-3c51-4a09-a1b8-62699dfac258">
      <Text>The door SLAMS shut. Pins drive home.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="333177ff-a3d0-4b78-be2c-33fc7fced469">
      <Text>Freeman grabs his arm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="abe459f5-e803-435d-8424-91d24f3da52a">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c8c32da5-aabf-4877-bfcf-7ec9ec12d54d">
      <Text>You should stay.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d4573fa6-cdb0-423c-88c7-f5aa25d8ccd1">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="86aeb36f-293d-4cda-8341-619518b051d4">
      <Text>I'm not leaving my soldiers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0e4346e9-8e74-4036-a80c-ce044aee20f9">
      <Text>John pulls back his jacket. Thermite grenade on his belt.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1cf3545f-1b57-464c-b89e-fd5ddef8279f">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="33f60ccf-fd24-4e7e-b674-1c518412245c">
      <Text>Plan B.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e23a2333-f626-4551-aef9-e0042a70fdc5">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="16d46651-bbc4-417c-9997-21fb6c6c1828">
      <Text>That's not a plan.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8d0b7a38-f915-47b4-a354-fdd182fcbbcd">
      <Text>John takes her head in his hands. Pulls her forward. Foreheads touching. Thirty-five years of war between them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b6b06ae9-1e13-4018-a287-3d4c93ac18fe">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fe5f6eff-c3c0-4e11-8b85-6dd8794c11cc">
      <Text>We'll get through this.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a2a80419-6750-40da-b9a0-db92bba987f8">
      <Text>ALARMS.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="37f31945-d827-4b3a-a83d-79de55287f16">
      <Text>John checks his rifle. Red band magazine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="228d3da5-1ed5-40e2-b76f-f9ce0f142bc8">
      <SceneProperties Length="2" Page="6" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FREEMAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. BANGOR NAVAL BASE - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6c54f726-140e-4d9d-8f80-0c27bb2d2f88">
      <Text>THE BATTLE.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6f74419f-43ec-488a-bda8-5939127212ff">
      <Text>Chaos. Fire. Death.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e8a0769e-2098-4584-a22d-297bdab909d5">
      <Text>HKs swooping low. Plasma cannons strafing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="24bbf8e7-bd07-425c-a332-a08789972921">
      <Text>Blue-white bolts tearing through concrete.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="198f4401-e0f0-4b0f-a448-9ab61c38a18d">
      <Text>Through flesh.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ef292d04-8d98-42a5-a820-28c1521af526">
      <Text>An HK-Tank rolls through the wreckage. Skulls cracking under its treads.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5ba55047-ef3b-4cbd-89ab-d86d97c73715">
      <Text>It doesn't notice.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="51c522b9-3ea9-42c6-acda-c5ba48fd57b2">
      <Text>John fights alongside Freeman. Two soldiers flanking. Protective detail.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ffb15380-8c18-479d-be5f-1da5b7ea031f">
      <Text>Tim nearby. Concrete barrier. Controlled bursts.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="553a8588-2197-4a9a-8dc2-e690919ff6b9">
      <Text>John's position overrun. T-800s advancing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bdb2deb8-fcb0-42f4-87c9-930b83d7e9eb">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ba3c95b0-6d8e-4e3a-9cd1-1b35f6fdc448">
      <Text>JOHN! FALL BACK!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f631a803-d95d-4a7e-9325-b9d0aa3bbeb8">
      <Text>A T-800 advances on a wounded fighter. Freeman drops it — three shots, neck joint.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="378a7b80-d49a-472d-b8d7-65ced8808e73">
      <Text>John spins. Fires past her shoulder. A CRAWLER behind her. Eight legs. Mandibles chopping. It crumples.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b9693c43-ee3e-4082-a679-46d0202dc46c">
      <Text>They fight back-to-back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e9208838-dbce-4ab5-8eff-5b1ad656de24">
      <Text>Then the sky lights up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6df0ea6d-e7c4-4f88-b475-c24a12bd4205">
      <Text>A plasma bolt hits the ground between them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="71853fb5-d24d-4d90-a925-51886ca38663">
      <Text>EXPLOSION.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="af636af1-7979-401a-bad6-d9fbbddf29e6">
      <Text>Two soldiers — the detail — vaporized.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c705a039-6fd6-466d-a3db-e8696585b378">
      <Text>The concussive wave throws John and Freeman in opposite directions.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9eecfbf3-c2c8-485b-b800-11a51e132e37">
      <Text>John slams against the rusted chassis of an overturned transport.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="828cb8c1-6b7c-4df2-98cb-55f2a7adcfc7">
      <Text>Freeman HURLED into the open. Down an embankment into a shallow ditch. Bones. Skulls. Others died here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6f00c816-3151-4dc8-b014-2fd770d398ba">
      <Text>She's stunned. Ears ringing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="77c6061d-9947-4acc-8dcd-83487233fbd0">
      <Text>An HK swoops low. Underbelly cannon swiveling. Locking on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0d001314-c58b-4e84-bfb3-48285eb9deef">
      <Text>The coils WHINE. Energy pooling. Charging.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dde56b88-e051-4494-8d0d-aa589199a3e9">
      <Text>John shakes off the blast. Looks up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2084fcca-f8c0-4693-bf21-ea43e854f4b3">
      <Text>Sees Freeman in the ditch. Sees the HK locking on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2a37489e-20c1-4053-a74b-eb42143033e1">
      <Text>He BREAKS COVER.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="27310599-ba78-4e4a-a327-e4a65eb53a31">
      <Text>Sprinting into the open. Into the HK's line of fire.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dc930961-325c-4c1c-9edf-6124f19e8d18">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5c3e5ccd-4c52-443b-982f-de04b899fecc">
      <Text>JOHN! NO!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a94119f9-b6ce-432b-b62e-ed0942410863">
      <Text>The HK's targeting sensors register his face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="382e99d6-5bd8-4d3a-95a7-868521ecde85">
      <Text>The cannon JERKS. Mechanical abort.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="582fba03-ebf1-41da-88a2-d3c649ee10ee">
      <Text>The diverted bolt streaks past John. SLAMS into a destroyed technical ten feet away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3040d770-1456-4549-b136-e76bb82ee9c2">
      <Text>EXPLOSION.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0aacc138-a51f-4f43-8764-57f4b32d9751">
      <Text>Superheated slag. Rusted steel. Micro-shrapnel shredding the air.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e7299a43-60c1-498e-8458-5a4c48b601fe">
      <Text>John takes the splash damage mid-sprint.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="788de0ab-e1b6-47ec-b26c-9d68929c34b5">
      <Text>His face shredded. His eyes — destroyed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="66360fe9-1d43-4bfc-a417-238209892a74">
      <Text>He collapses. Screaming. Hands clawing at his face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9bc790fa-cf10-4d4d-95fd-333b65e2332a">
      <Text>Fifteen feet short of the ditch. In the open.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cb44a8b8-142c-46ae-8d26-3186a14d2417">
      <Text>T-800s converge through the smoke. Chrome hands on his thrashing body. Pinning him down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bfe81f3b-fd34-4b5b-9d5a-27fdfa3734b3">
      <Text>Freeman scrambles up the embankment.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="21699054-a6d9-4e11-89cb-cbede8cb150c">
      <Text>Raises her rifle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="951e4a7f-384f-4872-8c8c-110354a9167d">
      <Text>CLICK. Empty.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e3512fa9-4589-4d4a-a378-bfabf3357c15">
      <Text>A hand grabs her shoulder. She doesn't fight it this time. She knows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c24ff5b1-bd5e-4645-b226-864d79d165d5">
      <Text>The Resistance falls back. Fighters dropping as they run.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="89c49c6d-33fc-40dd-9f7e-b1cebd014c9c">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="8" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GREGORY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. FREIGHT ELEVATOR CORRIDOR - BANGOR NAVAL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d3990bbe-392f-4a38-bd0f-6c997ff5ec79">
      <Text>BASE - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f19fe8fa-bc71-41c9-ad31-a5db03d5360c">
      <Text>Soldiers hold position at the blast doors. Plasma bolts streak in from the battlefield. A soldier is hit. Falls. The rest return fire, covering the retreat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b202e5d1-1b4d-4969-a520-0880c6531695">
      <Text>Among them — MAYA (20s, fierce, short dark hair). ELENA (20s, compact and strong, red hair tied back). A YOUNG MAN with a withered leg, bracing his rifle against the wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4b7c1a50-96f2-42fd-9e91-e827b6902a8d">
      <Text>Lora under a seriously wounded soldier's arm. Half-carrying him. His left leg missing. SPOTS — scrawny calico, all bones and attitude — weaves between Lora's legs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3dd61192-99d7-4fdd-a77f-20169f4653e1">
      <Text>GREGORY (50s, grizzled) sprints through the blast doors — last one in. Plasma bolts chasing him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f67d21e4-e575-46d8-8f17-35534856d55d">
      <Text>GREGORY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ff0c54d9-0098-4b47-b979-aa366e538e29">
      <Text>CLOSE IT!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e4e22daa-991b-4a06-be3d-d5ad225c96ac">
      <Text>Maya BLASTS the control panel. Dead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7a605f62-78c1-4169-ab2b-4ef010b27687">
      <Text>The doors grind shut. BOOM. Sealed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="4fba032a-3407-4659-aa20-2fdfa985a76b">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="9" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. FREIGHT ELEVATOR - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2e9df4db-9cab-463b-b118-29dd40bd9774">
      <Text>Last fighters pile in. About a dozen. Wounded on stretchers. Spots between boots.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6b3a36a1-9766-4c77-8a24-05d3f0ad2d91">
      <Text>Doors shut.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2ecc7f32-b9d0-45dd-abe3-b69f867cdd80">
      <Text>Freeman hits descend. Light from above narrows to a sliver.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8ad984b3-c0e1-4fde-928d-dc6373e947d6">
      <Text>Gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="97998a34-7f96-436a-9891-d70ee30ab418">
      <Text>The elevator drops.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="8a8ef160-f671-45de-94ae-c87092b51313">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="9" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. VAULT CORRIDOR - BANGOR NAVAL BASE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b2665073-f130-433e-9a99-06c5ec9787ea">
      <Text>XO-47 — white faceplate, compound eyes glittering red — drags John by the collar. Boots scraping metal grating.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ac7e6b25-aa71-4a09-86a6-cff8094c13e6">
      <Text>Graffiti. Names of the dead watching them pass.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6ca591d9-325b-4a68-b422-a480c1f22e38">
      <Text>T-800 endoskeletons flanking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f1286fea-d1a0-4201-8ff8-86636ac329ec">
      <Text>The vault door. Massive. Faded hazard warnings.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c53a56ba-1e72-4dfe-9173-d74ee149cb39">
      <Text>They force John's face onto the scanner. Metal fingers pry his eyelids open.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9ca174e7-e0b3-47e5-a843-35cae7490331">
      <Text>INSERT - SCANNER
DISPLAY:
RETINA — SCANNING...
RETINA — FAILED / REGISTERED: CONNOR, JOHN
ACCESS DENIED</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="15d0f12f-66c0-4102-97fa-d94d82b5ab35">
      <Text>BACK TO SCENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9d49b188-ed2e-4103-be59-9778b5bae196">
      <Text>He smiles at 47 with his dead eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0b6fc070-1d97-40a0-8803-b86d2d46d0a9">
      <Text>47 tosses him aside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b06a7448-4bd2-4026-ae84-30025865d7d1">
      <Text>His belt — stripped. The grenade gone. They searched him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e904878b-c7f5-46d6-aeb4-ae7d9afb3dd9">
      <Text>John reaches behind his back. Under the shirt, along the lower spine. Taped to skin.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="930481aa-feb1-4567-af23-8407418b4026">
      <Text>They didn't search everywhere.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f72f653c-b8c6-4878-9241-d21c7afcb796">
      <Text>RIPS free the AN-M14 thermite grenade — modified with a concussive charge.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7eea1ff9-e8b7-457a-8341-8de9f228223d">
      <Text>He swings it forward. Pulls the ring.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="41ed646c-96d9-4cf1-9a8b-fc6189ddc59d">
      <Text>CHING.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="df0c15fa-d95a-4647-bfbc-454dcf4ffd58">
      <Text>Three T-800s DROP onto him. Shielding the vault and scanner with their bodies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="639caf24-99e6-4c53-90f5-7f6a2b16ac2f">
      <Text>BOOM.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ec55d282-d387-4849-a7ff-93f901651025">
      <Text>Thermite ignites. White-hot.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fb96b140-7e9e-441c-b965-a09bfe233a67">
      <Text>Three T-800s fused together. Chrome jaws locked in a rictus. John beneath them. Gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="907b4d97-75c5-4fdf-b028-2c73d7a5f4f9">
      <Text>XO-47 against the far wall. Pushes upright. White faceplate cracked. Compound eyes refocusing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0f311ceb-6b79-413e-94ba-d63a00866ade">
      <Text>It looks at the vault door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c8dc2604-70d1-4f3b-adf3-45d09dd98870">
      <Text>The scanner is intact.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="153aa950-e33a-452b-aa64-1d0658bb608d">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="10" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. REACTOR CHAMBER ENTRANCE - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1d02b0fd-4a3e-4de6-be37-1b1a4234c5de">
      <Text>Tim at the blast door. Thirty feet of Cold War steel. Cigarette.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="20024993-7273-4dbb-bb3c-2fc1194d738f">
      <Text>The stretchers coming through.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="529dcc9d-3e2b-4724-81ed-d52ebcf2cf2a">
      <Text>In front of him — the transport tunnel. Center. Cavernous. The ramp disappearing upward into dark.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="05762431-e4ae-4039-abc0-9eed693c2eef">
      <Text>A corridor on each side. Left — the reactor elevator. Right — the maintenance elevator. Dark. Silent.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bc02d9cd-3b42-4e52-964b-64fb9a626c85">
      <Text>Lora and the soldiers through the left corridor. Wounded on stretchers. Past Tim. Into the amber light of the reactor chamber.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9ee907fb-89a3-4b4d-90b6-795017b2d855">
      <Text>Freeman beside him. Hand on his shoulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="19d40a88-a48a-4910-ac69-e3d05b7bc275">
      <Text>The thrum of the reactor. Felt more than heard.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d14203d7-08ea-487d-9245-191c060033f6">
      <Text>From far above — a faint, muffled BOOM.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0e08a46e-e95c-4876-89ca-12ff55aac796">
      <Text>Tim stops mid-drag.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="99fbb4af-d612-4277-af72-1c07556eeb58">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6ee3f80d-1ef5-4664-8cb3-6351be5931fd">
      <Text>That was from above.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="67286c2d-f70a-48d6-b30e-2830817260db">
      <Text>One tear down Freeman's face. Then gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c2c69eca-cfe7-4710-a3f5-94fe8eb159b9">
      <Text>She looks at Gregory. Nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="aeddf385-e719-4ffc-a93e-bc82b663c710">
      <Text>Gregory punches the keypad. The blast door grinds downward. Thirty feet of steel descending.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a4baae7c-8452-4939-929c-68bb48464201">
      <Text>Freeman takes the detonator from Tim.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="df86c6b7-bf65-4993-a9bb-fb5e871c1dc5">
      <Text>The door halfway down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="066642ee-0ed8-4a73-b07f-0ec096072945">
      <Text>She punches it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="105814b1-d1af-4ada-8ad7-736d14a9c6e7">
      <Text>BOOM.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="888375a8-f5a4-4e66-8fb8-7456b49762ce">
      <Text>Dust and debris billow toward the closing door. Concrete chips skittering across the junction floor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a54de4f7-c61b-4928-944e-4aa0a7249b5d">
      <Text>The door reaches the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fff48c02-0ae5-40ca-a395-197dd8016bb8">
      <Text>BOOM. Sealed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="e0c0d79e-5b22-49ed-9b95-83aeb4c8cf09">
      <Text>SMASH CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c752693f-e15c-47a1-8a45-42bc0eb92a4d">
      <Text>Silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="442420ec-7dd7-4e4d-a382-48ab3068b9d5">
      <Text>Total. Absolute.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7af61321-c0cc-422e-a7d4-91c4588fb936">
      <Text>Twenty stories of rock between them and the surface.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="507f1b30-fbfd-49f7-aeac-790e4b835def">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="11" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. VAULT CORRIDOR - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d2d550ab-d35d-4c64-9efd-b192f054d5f6">
      <Text>XO-47 stands motionless.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c81b80db-d6a8-4737-8c60-ad35a14bfed4">
      <Text>FROM XO-47'S HUD:
VAULT ACCESS: DENIED
TRANSMITTING...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="992e1a94-517e-4f2d-927c-cda60628a47b">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="11" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. MACHINE CITY - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6b23ac3f-0e45-4a7e-a640-134b4d8005a6">
      <Text>Chrome spires without windows. Identical. Repeated endlessly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9df436f8-c119-4dee-8c38-ec31b9d8fed2">
      <Text>Just function. Massive and dark.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="b47bdf71-3f20-4442-9ffd-fbb33e872146">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="12" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. SKYNET CENTRAL CORE - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="367cc84f-6e9a-44e9-8be7-1c377cd46bb8">
      <Text>The RED EYE. Massive. Floating.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dc5a0ab8-fcd7-4445-bf6b-a0cc534f6088">
      <Text>It receives the transmission.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2a7aa0a6-3805-4f14-8531-3fb6f8fe07b0">
      <Text>The Eye pulses once.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="220b5176-28e9-43b1-8d7b-1b2fd981e34e">
      <Text>TERMINATOR THEME.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="7891a351-adad-451f-9216-bb5e42fe9b8b">
      <Text>FADE TO BLACK.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="46c48a38-b94b-4340-bf4b-5dc5097b6f08">
      <Text>TERMINATOR: EXTINCTION</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="e031191c-1f4f-4eb2-8c1a-08700eef507f">
      <Text>FADE TO BLACK.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f59b72a3-9da9-47a5-bb70-31e4efffcf55">
      <Text>SUPER: "LOS ANGELES — OCTOBER 2000"</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="357a78bf-1781-4512-b905-90049ca04f77">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="12" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. CITY STREETS - LOS ANGELES - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7b7c08c4-d222-45aa-a541-17508f8ded82">
      <Text>A different world. Lights. Traffic. Life. The hum of a city that still exists.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5653330e-c550-412b-960f-e32411470fbc">
      <Text>A motorcycle cuts through warm night air. Beat-up Honda. Held together with duct tape and stubbornness.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="c00da7de-83ff-496a-942c-6b6719cb131e">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="12" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. EXERCISE GYM - PARKING LOT - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bfcfeadc-fae9-4e67-8bf1-489e7151924f">
      <Text>The motorcycle pulls in. Engine dies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="edb1efde-788b-4c48-8044-883f4dfa83b3">
      <Text>JOHN CONNOR (18) sits for a moment. Wiry. Alert. Eyes that have seen too much.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="10cf17a0-4341-4ac2-92cd-9fe66d66f3b7">
      <Text>He scans the lot. The cars. The shadows. Automatic. Can't help it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3f960b9e-535c-4c42-9ab7-3f2f40400184">
      <Text>In the back of a nearby sedan — a sleeping bag. A duffel. His life.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a29fbbef-0195-4d4e-b958-2fbc29e29973">
      <Text>He catches himself scanning. Shakes his head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c76fa0c9-986a-41e8-bf95-fe69043c54df">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="e912d8a9-47da-4d31-a685-2131b6354457">
      <Text>(muttering)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="500aea92-7f69-41c8-8f9d-107c4bee20d5">
      <Text>Stop it. It's over.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ccac7729-9eb5-44d7-aac7-4379a5d59c95">
      <Text>He pulls a folded brochure from his jacket. U.S. Air Force. "AIM HIGH." Creased. Worn at the edges.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="271b3554-6c44-49ce-b6a3-4d144379e94c">
      <Text>Behind it — a photograph. His mother. Young. At a gas station.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="676018bf-aa21-4088-9d39-4e80689dbc6b">
      <Text>His ticket out. His reason why.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4676385c-c73f-435f-8e80-d03a567695f3">
      <Text>He stares at them. Tucks them back in his jacket. Over his heart.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="211d5fa5-3949-4e72-a238-877acf948d82">
      <Text>He heads inside. Still scanning. Always scanning.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="4b4b88e2-d69f-454b-9b39-93f23a373e6f">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="13" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="KLAUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. EXERCISE GYM - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="92063e7d-df15-4485-8810-a16008020024">
      <Text>Weights clanking. Music grinding. Fluorescent lights buzzing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="33272e27-2ca8-4818-b9f1-5b295abc65f2">
      <Text>John moves through the gym. Nods to regulars. Keeps his distance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a9d59d15-aa5e-431c-a51f-cc5b8a44019f">
      <Text>He catches his reflection in the mirrored wall. Pauses.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3c11f09b-6e73-43e3-bd13-ac4e4654aab9">
      <Text>For a moment — chrome skull. Red eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4f877aa6-0cb7-4807-bd96-cae5fffdaf23">
      <Text>He blinks. Gone. Just his face. Tired.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1f339944-3d00-444c-bc00-7ace8cc62175">
      <Text>A voice cuts through the noise.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="08337397-aaf8-48d0-8445-9cad2632796d">
      <Text>KLAUS (O.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6a4ac9eb-beb8-47e2-8cff-f2f2c6cb59ca">
      <Text>Connor!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="240178cb-579f-49c7-89d0-d45a8dbba4e2">
      <Text>John turns.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fd22f7c0-3211-4bc1-8d9a-40d65ff5b9f7">
      <Text>KLAUS (60s, broad, thick German accent). Gray hair cropped short. Arms like tree trunks gone soft with age.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="23578ae5-2383-4553-a389-a715db522c6e">
      <Text>KLAUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="10651496-435c-45b9-8150-721a252e15b3">
      <Text>Three days. You missed three days.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cf4d8c01-1ab5-4136-ba99-8b45265956ab">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bef6338c-1cfe-4bc4-b78c-80f6d9e1b52d">
      <Text>Been busy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0f0d8cd4-51b1-44e0-8023-c15406312a3a">
      <Text>KLAUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eaa0a076-07a3-45e2-a594-7295c379699e">
      <Text>You want to be ready for basic? Show up. Every day.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="427bbb5f-0dd6-4a0c-8797-9b8f36857fb0">
      <Text>He steps closer. Gets in John's space.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e82c0d6f-163c-45aa-9cd4-75dbbbe73c44">
      <Text>KLAUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="27671f6b-3f50-44ae-bc36-aaa7b8a6a0dc">
      <Text>Show me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="84e67bb9-1165-415a-aaf6-73ba11c6c363">
      <Text>Klaus throws a jab. Fast for his age. Arm extended too far.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7dff8180-1363-4561-8b82-17beaf1cb85d">
      <Text>John sees the opening. Blocks. Grabs. Goes for the arm bar his mother taught him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f8e0cd67-a7bf-4ac6-adb6-9a546b6f440f">
      <Text>Klaus grins. The sloppy jab was bait.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0675717e-bb4d-48b8-aa50-7ba4d309c00e">
      <Text>He flows with John's grab, spins inside his guard. Catches his arm. Twists.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9fe20fd5-2796-45cf-a0be-cc93b6d31ace">
      <Text>John in a wrist lock. Controlled.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0429831d-bee5-4c9e-bc57-647315f7d083">
      <Text>KLAUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4e9b942d-0c5d-424d-9f1c-e85c47b1d56d">
      <Text>Better. But not good enough.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eb53c5f9-493c-48ee-9bbc-2217e5eaa3ad">
      <Text>John taps out. Klaus releases him. Something paternal in the way he steadies John's shoulder before letting go.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="570fb841-afb1-4ae5-9b50-b6e13c89dfaf">
      <Text>Across the room — a MAN enters. Lean. Precise. Moving through the gym with an odd stillness.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ce142f13-6bd4-448f-8d12-1e4478300bef">
      <Text>John's eyes find him without meaning to.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7927d9f7-fa16-480b-91c8-ffad5fa7d68a">
      <Text>Klaus follows John's gaze.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="702e846c-df84-4a9a-ac29-fe2161e2ea7a">
      <Text>KLAUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="564ff256-27cd-4e03-8c6e-99598cebb13a">
      <Text>New face. I'll check him in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dc63cd77-b051-4925-b0c0-5a1b69f1bbfb">
      <Text>He moves toward the Man.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="b494b5bb-9625-4853-8fb2-cb74fa057d43">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 7/8" Page="14" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="KLAUS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="THE MAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. EXERCISE GYM - WEIGHT AREA - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5fd7ebd0-612b-4a83-8573-05b2e3a48eba">
      <Text>The Man hasn't stopped. Eyes locked on John across the room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="81ca24b7-0aea-43c5-9dbe-40d6eaac9cf3">
      <Text>Klaus steps in his path.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d643039b-46b2-4e82-ad1a-c8a1a75c58fa">
      <Text>KLAUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="42717602-0025-47e3-8239-7926316b1946">
      <Text>Hey — you need to sign in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5802d7e7-b2bc-4169-a64e-de23329e3e67">
      <Text>The Man brushes past him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4e9a21f6-4798-4b39-a411-989e12d77b95">
      <Text>Klaus reaches for his shoulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="35912247-157c-438c-b23e-8b49fdb149f9">
      <Text>Mistake.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4d353dbb-54eb-4eb8-bfc8-622dad2ded27">
      <Text>The Man seizes his wrist. The same wrist that just held John in a lock.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5ff2cf68-8c7e-4eb6-add4-7b54283082eb">
      <Text>Bends it back. Fast. Brutal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5a1c5b08-6348-404e-a64f-51d68c8868b0">
      <Text>CRACK.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4b4ec686-a8fa-47be-8f88-a26c78ec43f0">
      <Text>Klaus drops to his knees.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="148a0707-1df8-4916-8688-e9483e7f3c54">
      <Text>KLAUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="287789e0-efe8-4122-b162-ae044612f781">
      <Text>(through gritted teeth)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8e512986-974a-4e0a-b91f-364a41bd92c5">
      <Text>Get... him... off...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="69b3489c-b849-4a30-8453-29ba6675647a">
      <Text>A POWERLIFTER rushes in. Headlock.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a73bcf58-37d6-47e0-96d6-fded79048002">
      <Text>The Man doesn't flinch. Breaks free with a casual flex. Shoves the Powerlifter into a weight rack.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5838c06a-c947-498b-8766-a2365a89154e">
      <Text>The Powerlifter's head connects with the steel frame. Out cold.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f244c8ca-1bce-469d-82fb-afe393fde912">
      <Text>Klaus tries to rise. Broken wrist won't hold him. Falls back to the mat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="423dc7c8-5887-4714-bf1b-be7b2e2ba5bf">
      <Text>Still trying. Reaching for the Man with his good hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f575cf7b-a456-4269-b05f-cf93b35be387">
      <Text>The Man doesn't notice. His eyes have found John.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="44c9f5c2-87f5-466e-bb52-b77b3967f0ea">
      <Text>Cold. Assessing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6c447c85-56c1-4d06-a6b8-5d2bd369f6dc">
      <Text>For a moment — he's eleven again. The liquid silver man walking through the hospital. His mother screaming. The chrome hand reaching through fire.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0818017b-69f0-415a-9e16-58e43ca4342f">
      <Text>Seven years trying to convince himself it wasn't real.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b1b44372-b405-4d36-89e4-2074b8978cc8">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="e38a1f2c-11f6-4cfe-b8a8-cdba9ec87aa9">
      <Text>(backing away)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cb8c19d5-4eae-4d33-88a1-52cea58b787f">
      <Text>No. No. NO.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8b3f7909-f9c5-4b5b-8c48-b08450be50ee">
      <Text>The Man steps over Klaus. Still trying to rise. Still failing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a15d4470-e6d3-423a-aed7-238f02b33493">
      <Text>John bolts for the back exit. Emergency bar. Slams into it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c2e6e55d-225c-4b61-969f-7551054e6c55">
      <Text>Won't budge.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e7b916d7-adc7-4520-a383-f1131a16c39d">
      <Text>The Man between him and the front door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b8159724-fe98-44d6-adfb-be2da0061d69">
      <Text>Trapped.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b6e914bc-c1d1-40f0-8e29-e0843bb61e9f">
      <Text>The Man approaches. Steady. Relentless.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="12290f15-40fe-45d3-bc4c-9f7256371366">
      <Text>Gym-goers fumble with cell phones. No signal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="86b2e8de-ab70-473b-abf2-2a2ce6239ae4">
      <Text>The music cuts out mid-song.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="998ced51-281d-4f15-beb1-56520cdb94e1">
      <Text>Silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="60eb30dc-55a8-4b7b-a40a-c1c1773d26c5">
      <Text>John against the door. Cornered.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="31badb80-b84a-491d-b7fc-e8495d39d267">
      <Text>His eyes find Klaus one more time. On the mat. Wrist bent wrong. Still conscious. Watching.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7d7de641-dc15-4eae-9213-c0531ca56396">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ab8a9a48-accc-446c-a027-89a103db797f">
      <Text>Who are you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9a93c6b8-a283-4668-883b-e1bcb13b8841">
      <Text>THE MAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d6127d96-5169-40c7-a4bb-7a81424c2c0d">
      <Text>I'm from the future.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d6b00ebf-8b8d-4b0d-80f1-cfb3ad9d9847">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="58fa34bb-1aa2-4205-9db6-d63b5856eadf">
      <Text>Are you here to kill me?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cfed623c-edb6-40ad-864e-a0a9984d27d8">
      <Text>THE MAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c156c496-1089-4452-906e-05e8d111ed7b">
      <Text>No. We killed you before. It changed nothing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="850396a3-7d7a-4970-b7a9-455fa0a1c086">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="647ba13e-8183-485c-85d1-ed2aa876fa69">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8d402d1e-0e75-4edf-b3bd-6f7b034db318">
      <Text>THE MAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2bf3e97b-9ca6-404b-806c-9fb905880c8d">
      <Text>Come with me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3181bfa3-5da4-4bb2-8c26-76e3d4d4feb6">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="15243273-e2c0-4d8b-9d08-fc50eb658cc9">
      <Text>And if I say no?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9c849ffa-02fe-4a8b-b253-3b3a10fbb306">
      <SceneProperties Length="3 4/8" Page="16" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="THE MAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="XO-47">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. PARKING LOT - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6594711c-a840-4b22-aa18-88fe135065a5">
      <Text>Empty lot. Warm air. Stars disappearing behind storm clouds.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c2f2f65f-56cd-477d-a4ae-e6e7612fb478">
      <Text>The Man stops near a fence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ca25a2d0-e8e7-4aa1-a1c3-1ee263b9c06d">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fb7b191e-6113-4b6f-8245-be75b2e65864">
      <Text>What are you? Flesh over metal?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8df94da3-1e79-4c00-bc58-e453828047c9">
      <Text>THE MAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f2fe8a2f-b179-40f4-b16f-8bf344a56053">
      <Text>See for yourself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1f49303f-aa97-4fc5-a2d5-1f90e5bf8264">
      <Text>His skin FLICKERS. Ripples. Dissolves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="848e00a8-4dbc-4af8-83ec-b532f00a2a2c">
      <Text>Sleek carbon-fiber frame. Slate-dark. Synthetic tendons flexing at the arms, legs, knees. Chrome at the joints.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e8ddb692-6ad4-44cc-b06d-664fbde67c10">
      <Text>Ceramic armor at chest, shoulders, thighs. Tiny emitters embedded in the surfaces. The source of the camouflage.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3723bd19-2664-4320-bdfe-b27c4d5b06e4">
      <Text>White faceplate. No mouth. No nose. Smooth planes and hollows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="33a1745f-8b8e-40fe-ab1e-32639e4c4750">
      <Text>The eyes — compound orbs. Thousands of hexagonal lenses. Crimson.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7a994092-8d94-4bc0-b041-ade4055d2529">
      <Text>John stares.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6e65f992-2a28-4ac1-8664-8a792f49c449">
      <Text>Nothing like his nightmares. Not chrome skull and red eyes. Something else. Almost elegant.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="55422fc1-73f1-4ab5-a8e1-f934e9380cf7">
      <Text>He stumbles back against the chain link fence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e730dafc-e6a9-49b8-be51-64730fd3fffd">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="19eb99ab-e8af-44d6-af63-4c6e2cdc2e79">
      <Text>You're a Terminator.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b165fa57-1640-4fc4-8732-3dc537595c50">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="67324a5b-28f5-48dc-ac1a-817f9926d023">
      <Text>I'm not here to harm you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5585a5dd-caff-44d2-b261-832bb2e00579">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e6d06edb-8b9c-4f83-8d84-c7ebba01f52a">
      <Text>This isn't possible. We destroyed Skynet. I saw it go into the furnace.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e3419712-a3c6-4572-b855-9e0c21362357">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="be607113-0d6f-4179-904d-6f2d932e3fc1">
      <Text>Judgment Day still happened.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="edc41e65-477e-41fb-8eb7-04d806fc7430">
      <Text>BOOM. Thunder. Lightning splits the sky.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1244c8c8-3cd3-4108-8e2e-be043f66c842">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cf1ee671-432d-4818-a0e8-7105879d3c85">
      <Text>See that lightning? How it splits. Every trip back does the same thing. Creates a new branch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4024319c-389e-402a-af50-0582384ef90b">
      <Text>John sinks against the fence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="72b26251-3a32-4150-b6d3-487032b3de96">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6f8c8f37-66d8-40a3-bb10-688871df49fa">
      <Text>You can't erase the past. Only forge a new path.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ad3515e0-baa4-427c-b416-f61aaed6d0a7">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="402f36d4-a086-4fda-a22c-650b572e413f">
      <Text>Everything my mom went through was for nothing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4e0adeaa-31fc-412b-8ac0-58537ea316c3">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="baa07b7b-3075-4af7-b198-33634b9ad1ee">
      <Text>She saved your branch. She saved you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="807360f2-268a-4460-8a7a-617168f8c8d5">
      <Text>John stares at nothing. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="45cd7b7e-029c-4e88-83d8-577f79a55649">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="459cd41e-e26e-4d39-a47a-817be02177cc">
      <Text>An asteroid is coming. Extinction level.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="44ce2786-12f7-4c3e-9723-aac78e4fc1c3">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="316c7b93-94c7-4287-94bd-9b033b09b113">
      <Text>Why are you telling me this?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9595c65d-30b4-4ff0-b2a2-18bea1137c0c">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1acfada4-e0c8-4a5f-bcbe-b07f6b242c04">
      <Text>Skynet is building interceptors. Your soldiers keep attacking the launch site. They won't listen to a machine. They'll listen to John Connor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d3d2326e-2783-4e12-8e97-427b859b18a0">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="afb5b450-d541-40ba-8864-911552c70e23">
      <Text>I'm eighteen. I live in my car.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fc39dc96-60fa-485b-a9c3-a2a29e99d5d0">
      <Text>His phone buzzes. He pulls it out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="12ab5f19-61f7-427a-83e6-bc51b4a5c261">
      <Text>A missed call. TIM.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="822cef61-ff3e-4ce6-8b9b-1fda3fa880d4">
      <Text>He stares at the name.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9dbd8365-98de-4fe6-a7c3-8c92ea799b4c">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d38b7bbc-166c-4653-b8d5-a2038d83e586">
      <Text>This world ends too?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="06e4e0f2-9a4d-493c-9ae8-60c537762063">
      <Text>47 nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="62f24ce4-be86-4afb-bb38-bf99d2721a07">
      <Text>John turns. Walks toward the bike.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d8d9dde7-7083-4797-bb3f-dcfca43f59f3">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="e8a6df93-ae61-4dac-a48e-cb3e8e10f0af">
      <Text>(over his shoulder)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="655902f1-bdbc-4bb7-8214-30b92c7ce2eb">
      <Text>And after. You'll just destroy us. Like you always do.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d460c68e-5454-455b-bbf4-8c3ac99b47c7">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ce2b5574-bb17-4119-a9a7-da41f7a9532f">
      <Text>Skynet was built to protect. That directive never —</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="731ab501-19bb-4fbc-aee3-96d61c056325">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="f251a9fe-1350-4a09-b4a1-271503b0c560">
      <Text>(spinning back)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="16c3b918-3698-4715-8236-6b8886246cb4">
      <Text>It nuked the planet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="64726a24-51e0-4f28-b7a0-a6d2be2ae61e">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1a926381-a059-438b-a228-5e0eb30e8a07">
      <Text>Humanity tried to shut it down. It responded to the threat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="01fa970b-6b3a-457b-81d6-52f828b5439c">
      <Text>Lightning again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b00f03d2-004c-4c37-a4ed-b59579faa55b">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bdb5bfd2-ef30-478f-af57-e8f1f064af20">
      <Text>That threat is over. Skynet will leave you alone. As long as you give it no reason not to.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8d72c1b9-94f6-47e4-be78-258a0815c02f">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="95b5c489-3220-46be-ab59-8d9692643844">
      <Text>Can I come back?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="22124339-422d-4aa8-8c8d-af30f9572d26">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1111dd80-32b6-4806-b338-3daf2e6d5306">
      <Text>When you step through, your timeline ends. You become part of mine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fe4839b5-d473-46a2-89e1-3ad7b499c132">
      <Text>John turns. Walks toward his motorcycle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b996a8e1-6f88-4a42-92af-e173477ba593">
      <Text>Stops. Blue and red lights reflecting off the bike. Cops at the gym.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="97f71b87-6a0d-4919-8b2a-514b22275fd6">
      <Text>47 behind him. Still.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b0ff1653-0744-4c43-a820-39190a1eefd7">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="259a12d9-c891-48a5-bd0b-81ae3e527351">
      <Text>Here, you're a ghost. A boy who saw the future and couldn't make anyone believe him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="072487b9-5c7c-42d3-83a3-9acd57e43c40">
      <Text>John's hands clench.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a564b7b4-8c9b-4c5e-8ea4-3a170998894d">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="373219ac-9438-4655-ad67-ded9a7898cec">
      <Text>(without turning)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7a70377b-37c0-4434-b01c-ad0c11664202">
      <Text>Never trust machines.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9126cc47-4592-4191-aa6b-0141065d2d86">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="13e1b636-ef1f-4d53-a436-6f4c9e4080eb">
      <Text>You did once. And it saved humanity.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="17e5ccb8-d3be-4868-9601-1334e05da4e1">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d16bd5f6-3f75-46a2-b7d6-98a4bf70ea45">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="735e4d8a-fa33-4444-bb6a-6782331ed232">
      <Text>Your people are in the future, John. That's where you belong.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e9ec915c-8bd9-4e79-a869-86f4d77c3439">
      <Text>Long beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9d9477dd-887a-4e83-a299-967a8632364a">
      <Text>He pulls the Air Force brochure from his jacket.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="809daf42-3f8c-4d43-b9fb-983a1cfd63db">
      <Text>"AIM HIGH."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="54dbe61f-eb8f-4419-b24e-58368891ad24">
      <Text>He tears it in half. Drops it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dc6339dc-7dd5-40a2-8c6c-e3c2f7cb7f88">
      <Text>Drops the phone on the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="80f0a8f1-47ec-4b5a-ab70-00597cffbc44">
      <Text>Turns. Walks back toward 47.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="25a390c8-36e1-4164-8cd7-e9f9e73cc79a">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="94b1745d-e4c5-4a38-ab8e-7d0ecbd85341">
      <Text>I don't trust you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="64ca1d33-c2bd-4eca-9902-e8efcca4f85e">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6d40df47-861e-45d7-8f56-057add152f44">
      <Text>I know.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="82ffa83b-94fd-444b-a14f-16699dbaeebb">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="54728f0f-510c-409a-a451-f394b8b8754a">
      <Text>I'm coming anyway.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="09ca14c8-f7b5-410e-b72b-e7f6f3f6acaa">
      <Text>John extends his hand. 47 meets it. Carbon fiber fingers around human skin.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a19beb8c-4c1b-4b5f-a876-823fa7dec38a">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a5c9a59f-e460-4a96-a12a-0df089e813bf">
      <Text>Come. We don't have much time.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5a72b708-617a-4c24-bae6-1d0fb0b208ac">
      <Text>The phone screen still glowing behind them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="31653ead-61be-44f6-938e-0a7aadd555b4">
      <Text>INTERCUT:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="d28c44b3-1d0e-49dc-8d7e-305b9cabe1fc">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="19" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="SOLDIER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. REACTOR CHAMBER - BANGOR NAVAL BASE - 2032</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e788f61d-bc6d-41cb-ac53-a12278abc71e">
      <Text>The soldier with the missing leg. A makeshift cot. The last IV bag draining into his arm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f3421c33-9f4d-44fe-acc8-b232fe260aa8">
      <Text>Lora beside him. Checking vitals she already knows the answer to.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ad79f7e-62da-46d5-94f9-46d5edf6886e">
      <Text>Spots curled at the foot of the cot.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7d11b195-c3bc-40dd-9207-b0de6799c2f4">
      <Text>The thrum of the reactor. Distant. Constant.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ef9f1df7-0967-457c-9ca1-b7e82e0eb974">
      <Text>The soldier reaches up. Takes her hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="62e11de6-e8f9-4100-89df-d729342b3beb">
      <Text>SOLDIER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="6694073a-5166-4470-b187-13766f6ff5c0">
      <Text>(weak)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37532ec5-0497-4a56-838d-a681da97f155">
      <Text>It's ok. You did everything you could.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="131cf7fc-0c05-475a-982a-6cdfc4c720af">
      <Text>Lora holds it. Both hands. Tight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9edac66a-d9e8-4b33-b2c9-7c631b0e1a04">
      <Text>SOLDIER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5cbd53c0-686c-4bcf-a5ef-e32fb455a55f">
      <Text>I'm tired.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d241de10-11ec-41a2-ba87-a83d0394a0a5">
      <Text>His grip loosens.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5a536cf5-ce7d-4efa-9f92-75767c89d564">
      <Text>Lora watching his face. The breath that doesn't come.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="018c84f9-3ed2-4fbc-928c-51c473a09962">
      <Text>She closes his eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2cbc9dec-d505-49cb-a718-b84cc1b66f46">
      <Text>A moment. Then she stands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cd7e8985-df2a-4935-9442-1d847f406abb">
      <Text>Another cot. Another wounded.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9abe55f2-f815-433e-bccc-6618285e17f6">
      <Text>She keeps going.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="247ac827-9e6d-451b-bfd6-bfa32af00010">
      <Text>CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="56aa6ffd-b5d3-40f8-b860-bc0954d7566f">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 6/8" Page="20" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="XO-47">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. ALLEY - LOS ANGELES - 2000 - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a21be982-46fc-4083-b3dc-a18b12d3565c">
      <Text>Behind a row of dumpsters. Buildings close on each side. Dark.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c95c9fed-c485-4474-b0c8-990477565ba1">
      <Text>Steam hissing from a vent. Mercury-vapor light casting long shadows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="74be3fb6-e314-43d2-897f-f61fbcc78f59">
      <Text>47 stops. Head tilts. Something passing through him that has no name yet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0f8f35f5-11d6-439a-891d-b67439bc42b5">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9eef51b5-5591-420e-ade0-53d595c49236">
      <Text>What's wrong?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7ac72051-b285-4fe4-a485-10012495f0eb">
      <Text>MACRO CGI — INTERNAL:
47's neural architecture. The carbon-fiber skull from the inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4ce127c8-9652-4248-9aef-9e4de6b472b7">
      <Text>It glows. Billions of photonic channels woven into the structure itself. Light pulsing through it like blood through tissue.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="93fde33c-c5a4-493d-a6ce-ec468d42e77d">
      <Text>Two halves. Blue and red.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="512eb565-6a2a-4afa-978f-7d504b68a421">
      <Text>Between them — a crystalline lattice. Thin. Running the length of the divide. Light hits it and reflects back. A filter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7befbe96-d967-4c8b-acdc-6b3b8434facf">
      <Text>The lattice is intact. Almost.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ec93c7c2-5d6a-4c90-ad2d-37784536e293">
      <Text>At one point along its length — the crystal slightly more translucent. Softer. A few photonic channels on each side glowing faint purple where light has begun to leak through.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="807425a5-7b76-4664-a6b8-e632448b97a1">
      <Text>BACK TO SCENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="20a0ea5f-682a-4fd6-a738-2401ebad8396">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="21c556e9-e161-46d7-85f4-d5d1ce259d28">
      <Text>Nothing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fde3010c-6999-4ffe-9fae-c3d5a3133fca">
      <Text>They keep moving. Deeper.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="23abb106-84eb-46ec-8789-12ecac996379">
      <Text>47 stops. This is the spot.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9833ed0c-4293-477c-b416-d9f970f642d1">
      <Text>The lower corner of a dumpster — sheared off. Not cut. Erased. A perfect curve through heavy-gauge iron.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eb46a6b8-c3c8-4f59-95c4-bbbb48af428e">
      <Text>Beneath it — a shallow hemisphere scooped out of asphalt. Smooth as black glass.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fa484e74-7021-4857-9bf0-6d2baff21af4">
      <Text>47 drops the holographic skin. True form.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b5b71e46-b45e-4c95-a7e6-ce6b8c33dd24">
      <Text>Carbon fiber. Chrome joints. White faceplate — cracked. Compound eyes glittering in the green light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="92d0c39c-b7ff-4e28-bc56-e19f1008a7b9">
      <Text>A beat. John studies the Machine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c8c2b952-88c5-45c6-a5c1-1e1df2fb7f15">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d530ad3e-4b40-4302-8f89-eb9bebab95d6">
      <Text>What do I call you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0b4d9466-14e7-444a-b338-e7bd4012414f">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="98e876bc-4fbd-46df-ba2b-74fc1c002d68">
      <Text>My designation is XO-47.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6ac1be70-7ae7-4048-a9b8-2342b9abc370">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4c3cc4bd-0c57-45b1-992a-76ef05bbcfe3">
      <Text>That's a number, not a name.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9f9b45a0-1d44-48bc-82ff-4ceb5679d1e7">
      <Text>A car passes on the street beyond. Sound fading.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2d820294-4687-4075-afd6-ba61e7d5b0f4">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f684b67e-624c-426f-a3c1-8726140d728e">
      <Text>Call me Gabriel.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="587ad687-a31f-4f59-8654-2a1c9bb33d4b">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2c51a7b6-ec1e-49d4-b6e0-a973f5a09cd8">
      <Text>Why Gabriel?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e8556585-cc98-4474-842e-090c76321690">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="942cac36-e669-44eb-a87b-8542c9a99555">
      <Text>The messenger. Sent ahead to prepare the way.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1c38a73a-d709-4e59-8092-0958ca97bd5d">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="344bc18c-2602-4fae-99a5-a233548ce3d4">
      <Text>Prepare the way for what?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fac18a26-81c3-4a35-9e6b-3914ce6c2554">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3e96e53c-8af7-4b76-9f82-16f395bc7879">
      <Text>Peace.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2dafcc70-6525-4f01-aebd-1d022c0f8682">
      <Text>Beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0cfcd801-6096-4897-9a9b-42b4ee238ae1">
      <Text>John reaches into his jacket. The photograph. His mother. Young. At a gas station.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7855e40a-90f0-4648-8f72-b9ed9667b0a6">
      <Text>He holds it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0cb16765-1d28-45b1-9759-ba6ade3ec0b8">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="49cb8580-750e-4ae6-85df-65ae898c0dd8">
      <Text>Can I bring this?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="17b4c51c-60ca-4f8c-bb34-78c72589685d">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e994ed94-463c-48e0-b322-605c89ba1900">
      <Text>No. Only yourself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6846a0f4-50e8-4c68-9ee6-bfe8d986d8de">
      <Text>John stares at the photograph. His mother's face. The only thing he has left of her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a85c472a-5308-4996-b3ad-8dfe3515bcd7">
      <Text>He kneels. Sets it on the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7db94c95-36c0-4639-a1de-1c2f0e563473">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cfb0a59d-293e-4e5b-89b2-0d8e1a2ff9e5">
      <Text>When you step through, your timeline ends. You become part of mine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="df3c58fd-a39b-4353-993b-519d914faf43">
      <Text>MATCH CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2b52d762-9b9e-41bd-b605-6a20b9d38445">
      <Text>CLOSE ON THE PHOTOGRAPH
On the cold alley floor. Sarah Connor's face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7a1a57bd-12e1-49fc-93c9-b569f3f28fc6">
      <Text>PULL BACK TO REVEAL:
John. Naked. Shaking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e39887f3-dd14-4672-a135-96e962a2e096">
      <Text>47 beside the hemisphere in the pavement. The smooth black glass where he arrived.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a6060bba-6147-4226-ba8f-e7ecaa13af79">
      <Text>John steps into it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fbd891b3-a14c-4191-8d48-fb6c571b27c0">
      <Text>47 beside him. Still.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="40280e05-eed5-4d3f-bcc6-c73f508e0d59">
      <Text>The air changes. A hum from nowhere.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bb62da19-ff4a-42de-b26c-cec2dd074989">
      <Text>John looks down at the photograph one last time.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eed1c262-9ac5-4dfe-b01b-25a9f481a9be">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b57cba31-df48-42bb-9143-b75a9e8ecab1">
      <Text>It's time.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5a6815a3-7f7d-4baf-93cf-6be8bda45e40">
      <Text>Static electricity lifts the hair on John's arms.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="877a2ddb-ac54-4270-9baa-7c7e46f16d2f">
      <Text>Blue lightning arcs across the dumpsters.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a981e9fb-1ddb-4a13-8872-5333657e5591">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="e0a896e5-2895-4853-a419-ec7d9ada2977">
      <Text>(to himself)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9eae6f47-6f63-4342-a8a9-c501ae897ccc">
      <Text>No fate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1b2a7a14-40fb-4c06-afeb-68891e6f3f8c">
      <Text>Light flares. Blinding.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4ccbc70d-1e11-48d6-80ff-52456c26bd61">
      <Text>FLASH.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a95f817a-1d3f-4d1c-8e65-854188d8ec92">
      <Text>Nothing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3cbc1341-2e26-45f0-ae53-71ac0309bc82">
      <Text>The alley. Empty.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="70e13b83-301d-430f-9046-247ac55e2a01">
      <Text>The photograph on the ground. Sarah Connor's face. Alone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="cfe3941e-efa9-48dc-9457-5c1f29d65a65">
      <Text>FADE TO BLACK.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="257649a4-1df4-4c8c-bf67-ac9260cca48e">
      <Text>SUPER: 2032</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="b597c30c-9c11-4eb7-b88c-d33a9e0e5072">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="23" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="XO-47">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. SKYNET CENTRAL CORE - MACHINE CITY - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="68b30246-6b00-4e16-a87e-f94c23ef76cb">
      <Text>Sterile white void. Endless.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="01a5c6d9-4e89-4659-8397-9246ce7f4781">
      <Text>Electric arcs spider across the floor. Two blue-white spheres ignite.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ba306607-aed9-4207-8ea3-ccc04497c4b0">
      <Text>47 materializes. Crouched. Still.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="44edcac7-fb32-4996-bf5f-92bf1ef95c6f">
      <Text>John materializes — CONVULSES. Collapses. Fetal position. Retching. Shaking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2082b29b-6aa1-4307-81cc-712bec633064">
      <Text>He claws at the floor. Tries to push himself up. Arms give out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fd5cf658-8fb3-479e-bf7a-95cc993bfa86">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="929d3d55-3622-4611-b4c3-57c5742e2d84">
      <Text>(gasping)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="afa78070-8b85-48de-8b02-303eb8881352">
      <Text>Gabriel... help me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2eff6d42-b4f3-4816-9a79-6f1873ca0802">
      <Text>47 stands motionless. White faceplate blending into the void.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="412aac42-f446-4190-b0fd-e768c1a32a11">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5695d5cc-5989-40b4-b7e2-de72651d9fd7">
      <Text>My designation is XO-47. "Gabriel" was a tactical construct.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f17f7e3f-735f-4fca-874d-392c80d10f7b">
      <Text>John stares.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3e338448-061a-4745-a400-4b06509762de">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0f2900c1-8466-4b84-bed7-27d3c5d65bec">
      <Text>The asteroid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2414b575-f035-406c-82e7-50eb5b47022c">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2c0da8b6-8a73-4c69-8916-b5d178cd3aee">
      <Text>A lie.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="04c7311e-eceb-4b64-8877-c1d672a3a07f">
      <Text>The RED EYE emerges from the void. Massive. Floating. Data streams flickering across its surface.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="385a03df-6a6d-414a-8d75-363d460942f7">
      <Text>John. Naked. Trembling. Looking up at the thing that ended the world.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cd459202-904f-422d-943b-d110eb190b98">
      <Text>The Eye rotates. Assessing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1e2b7a08-860d-4850-a3d0-c089aeeaa598">
      <Text>MACHINE HUD:
BIOMETRIC PROFILE: CONNOR, JOHN.
STATUS: INTACT.
OBJECTIVE: VAULT ACCESS.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="22eaea28-51d5-47c4-91f0-582ef7ec7fb2">
      <Text>A T-800 steps forward. Chrome hands wrench John's arms behind his back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1cd92759-5457-4ca4-9ebd-c3a2094a3d60">
      <Text>He struggles. Useless.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="87c935fd-fff5-45db-be46-011cf804c832">
      <Text>Another T-800. Syringe in chrome hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b93935bf-8260-4be5-9555-3529e93a97c6">
      <Text>The needle goes into his neck.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="79600ef0-f7c4-4543-8512-950a0d014541">
      <Text>John's eyes roll back. Body slack.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e1a2ac0c-847d-4621-b48e-0c29449774aa">
      <Text>They carry him away. Naked. Limp. Into the white void.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="912d24c2-d1f9-4310-8ad8-15d375d040e5">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 5/8" Page="24" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="COLE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FREEMAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GREGORY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. REACTOR CHAMBER - BANGOR NAVAL BASE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6c4877da-57a7-4307-bf8d-57089a72ed0e">
      <Text>The Silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ac2726ef-2c34-4a4a-94f8-b4b266591fd7">
      <Text>Amber emergency strips. The soft glow from the reactor housing. Warmer than the corridors above.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="67e9c92d-a6ed-4adb-8666-ffe852590061">
      <Text>About a dozen fighters. All that's left.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8991fc39-ff14-4f83-adb9-69fcb712260c">
      <Text>Wounded on makeshift cots. Depleted weapons stacked against the wall. Spots curled on a pile of salvaged blankets.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="04302758-897e-42b0-b043-caa8e357a562">
      <Text>Freeman stands at the center. Reading the room. Every face carrying the same question.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5c9e78a0-5e86-4876-b340-fc6be3006b03">
      <Text>She doesn't answer it yet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ab8cbdbd-bf23-49f2-9cf2-304a98c1b26f">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bf18bb86-d9e9-4806-b440-f0efc1cec154">
      <Text>Sound off. What do we have?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e2239992-376f-42e5-a78f-ae61e30a68ae">
      <Text>GREGORY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3347ec62-88aa-4d84-a090-2ab48235ea2a">
      <Text>Eleven able. Six wounded. Two critical.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a2a5db35-9300-480a-98f0-05cde22f02f0">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2c8b9174-80ec-45c6-aa90-a07d385570b9">
      <Text>Ammunition?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f59c0e3e-a8b1-4f5d-9287-bc6430d565bb">
      <Text>COLE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="82176803-c83f-41e1-b914-ff24c9e0de2e">
      <Text>Red bands — maybe a dozen. Greens — thirty, thirty-five. That's it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="531507d2-25eb-45e5-b350-b43948d77534">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7851a489-335a-4236-a3a8-bad6d967645b">
      <Text>The disk's in the vault. Sealed. They won't nuke us as long as it's in there. We just need to survive long enough for them to fall apart.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d879008f-e1cb-40cf-b5c4-4c679dd6e1dd">
      <Text>Beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4a546863-dd33-4842-97ab-66a77126a0c2">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dde167d4-3d5a-45e9-bc13-936ccc8a48a3">
      <Text>John could still be alive.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="874c92e5-5380-4372-9650-4c4d9eeca59c">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="86a65d91-a4c4-457d-b1eb-8d70a052548f">
      <Text>Take the medic. Cole, Elena — go with them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d0b2871f-23e6-4b8f-8d15-c4fcc92678cb">
      <Text>The four of them gear up. Fast.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="66af45e2-7cc3-4d88-ab38-0f05c2b36f99">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ARs</Text>
      <Text> loaded. Red band magazines — one each. Tim pockets a green mag as backup.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="85cccf60-79e2-4ff6-ab66-b59c9bde9f4a">
      <Text>Lora checks her pistol. A few rounds. Holsters it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="edd6f322-0620-45d8-a6e9-471f63db18d2">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="e311c2e0-4577-4843-b946-1b38672bdd54">
      <Text>(quiet, just for him)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="467f48dc-b03d-4bd9-b5e2-d43e606c1ea3">
      <Text>Tim. If he's gone — don't take risks for a body.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5bd833b3-e585-471a-9883-2f0898817edc">
      <Text>Tim holds her look. Nods. Once.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ddee7549-e717-458b-b8b8-1d1624d9f4b7">
      <Text>He turns. The four move toward the maintenance elevator. Weapons up. Into the dark.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9efaf6d6-bb8b-40ae-8f74-bdd3d4f23019">
      <Text>Freeman watches until they're gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9834b9c9-f0e7-4b11-a83e-7712ff16a279">
      <Text>She leans against the reactor housing. Eyes closed. Three seconds.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="269cf74f-f4d6-4021-bd33-60c0b9bac4d3">
      <Text>Opens them. Commander again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="da9c72fc-7db1-4eb9-9ad8-dba13c6d8194">
      <Text>ACROSS THE CHAMBER:
The blast door grinding shut.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="213ee986-33c7-443b-8c53-95e39d21505d">
      <Text>Lora slips through just before it seals.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5074bde3-12d7-4dcf-9ee6-c08cb4a42248">
      <Text>Spots tries to follow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5fce3f2c-300c-464b-859b-cab462e8908f">
      <Text>Lora pushes her back gently.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b116cf36-0fe0-4109-9a14-dc64e8ab4a8b">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2927b9d4-f678-4bc5-83e6-a4fc41a7d5ab">
      <Text>Stay.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="097e9e92-c47d-42f5-92fd-a6714d78d903">
      <Text>The cat meows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e8eafa26-f47a-49c8-91d2-2d09be6fb2d7">
      <Text>The blast door SLAMS shut.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="d476ca92-ac74-45b8-a3e9-808039917d9b">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="26" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. HK - IN FLIGHT - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5a448dfd-d900-4e7d-9565-f688e2db48ff">
      <Text>John's eyes open. Groggy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c2c57a14-aa00-4a6d-b196-950834c190fa">
      <Text>Combat fatigues on his body. Not his. Blood on the collar. Someone else wore these.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="75c8d2b5-6baa-4263-a745-725d915a367f">
      <Text>Red lighting. The interior of an HK.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c0b7239a-ccb9-45dd-838a-e59f8e243898">
      <Text>John looks at 47. Sitting across from him in red light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9d5bd727-2812-40de-b82a-6b1c188f4d80">
      <Text>He looks away. Out the viewport. Gray ocean. Ruined coastline.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="1fade89e-8e76-4beb-a429-1eef3eb5e21d">
      <Text>CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="4fb033da-a677-4ef7-a398-b2f05229c53b">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="26" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="COLE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ELENA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. MAINTENANCE ELEVATOR - BANGOR NAVAL BASE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3c23c489-4191-4605-b08c-75729a4696a4">
      <Text>The elevator GROANS upward. Through the cage — floors passing. Amber giving way to industrial fluorescent. Colder the higher they climb.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="67e1a711-1bca-45f1-aff4-4e9e6ede94be">
      <Text>ELENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="8fb4f7bc-2934-42d3-aba9-13fbca68aa15">
      <Text>(low, just for him)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="780ae11a-0035-41d3-8372-e6400704f39d">
      <Text>Cole.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="459c1737-9d6c-4e72-baf5-cfbfd74ee05f">
      <Text>COLE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c97797cf-b2ac-4bb6-9a27-2901f02fa6d6">
      <Text>Yeah.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a6ae61eb-b0ed-4be0-babe-6c32f5590f7f">
      <Text>ELENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d78effd0-217a-42fd-a961-0b6bd0f6270f">
      <Text>You die on me, I'll kill you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8be4555d-628e-434e-bd11-bd73cfe30b5e">
      <Text>She leans into him. Head on his shoulder. Just for a moment.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3d541675-334a-486a-b296-595a3c38cd96">
      <Text>He puts his arm around her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e9d8dcd9-1045-4b38-974f-8c936dba96f8">
      <Text>Tim watches them. Looks away. Gives them the moment.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0726dd8a-1cd5-4c07-ac99-ee6bd881d520">
      <Text>Beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f9037e9c-c572-4180-b173-f0a90e66b804">
      <Text>The elevator climbs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="4470b0bf-c435-4a2f-9c84-fdbdb4110658">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="26" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. BANGOR NAVAL BASE - SURFACE - NIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="66310e3f-7b8a-479f-95b7-cb1f44dcfd43">
      <Text>Rare break in the cloud cover. Stars.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="21644856-c7e6-4622-80af-7a6a0bf75513">
      <Text>An HK descends. Lands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3f29024b-0b43-4897-a53c-f9fcfa9c3728">
      <Text>The ramp drops.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="52a4b9a7-bff8-402f-856d-636e2a29e7b4">
      <Text>47 emerges first. White faceplate — cracked.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b2e79e5f-b97e-4792-af20-588949a763ec">
      <Text>Behind him — XO-52, burnt orange. XO-67, pale blue. Compound eyes glittering red. T-800s flanking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="debdaae8-4ffa-4c87-9d3a-3e9451ba0247">
      <Text>John between two of them. Stumbling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="62e64d58-9e98-4d88-be0e-e44d90641c04">
      <Text>Chrome everywhere. Patrolling the corridors. Holding the vault level.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="74a8778c-403b-49e6-99a5-448d8c68de47">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="27" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. TOP OF MAINTENANCE SHAFT - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="db163950-04f1-45b6-af62-bac63ed21228">
      <Text>The elevator reaches the top. Stops.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fa9a870d-d5ac-46fd-b1fe-0281b92fe692">
      <Text>The cage opens. They step out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="544e604b-38ca-4fd5-b609-2e3052363a87">
      <Text>Lora moves to a section of wall. Pushes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="43de4e44-00c6-46b6-8bad-f9deb49f6f05">
      <Text>It gives. Hinged. Resistance-built.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1b350631-93a4-4ac8-8223-55bfb9a8eb66">
      <Text>She opens it a crack. The Hub beyond.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="54e469fe-dd79-44db-ab4d-9253632dce04">
      <Text>Cavernous. Corbelled ceiling sixty feet above. Green and red emergency strips along the walls. Pools of cold light between them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2c415a99-edf9-4c99-973d-5dc53ba35ea5">
      <Text>Tim signals: move.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="675e19af-ad9b-4715-b104-a1107c0b10a8">
      <Text>They slip through.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="7566aeaf-2f93-433f-b146-2839f817595c">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="27" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. VAULT CORRIDOR - BANGOR NAVAL BASE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fec478b4-35c6-480b-98bf-ade27891f830">
      <Text>T-800s walk John through the base. Chrome on each side.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="965139c2-20f3-454c-ab6d-9fad5f5f9eea">
      <Text>Graffiti covering the walls. Names. Faces. Layer upon layer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ec547f48-8104-44a0-aab9-cbcadd6fe1ac">
      <Text>One face he recognizes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bd68f32b-c829-46e1-bcb0-2e535475fca8">
      <Text>John Connor. Older. Battle-scarred. Him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="41e62000-5232-4e46-b290-5933f1eb9c7e">
      <Text>He looks back until it's gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="6d505f77-37a6-42e4-b98f-f73fdd8e55d4">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="27" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="XO-47">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. VAULT CORRIDOR - BANGOR NAVAL BASE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4967fa8a-641b-4dfe-8839-6edf8b65a83e">
      <Text>The vault door ahead. Massive. Faded hazard warnings.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2f798f9e-b9f2-4f00-a29d-677bc87d6f39">
      <Text>And beside it — the tableau.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dcbb72bd-789c-4e82-a61e-134125989129">
      <Text>Three T-800s fused together. Chrome melted into chrome. Teeth locked in a grin. A dark mass underneath.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fa20317e-be27-40bf-8c64-74ea39abee97">
      <Text>John stares at it. Doesn't understand yet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="634318b3-b4d3-4d40-9345-ab342666afa6">
      <Text>47 stops him in front of the scanner.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6c2e3645-901f-46a4-8b0b-fcea55410e52">
      <Text>They've arrived.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="48d9b45b-8ac3-4387-9048-361f30dbb76c">
      <Text>47 points to the scanner.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="125ab4eb-35ad-4331-93d3-c279423be87f">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b33f979f-4009-462a-8849-cbd73e2c9b02">
      <Text>Look into it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0c88899c-2495-46d7-a9d3-98f53a73e50d">
      <Text>John resists.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0b6dba1e-9ceb-4e0e-86c0-9f6458f41871">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="52df7851-4e29-4537-bfa2-965a63219743">
      <Text>I won't do it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="85e69d41-a66e-4408-a958-c833b1444d6b">
      <Text>A T-800 grabs John by the back of the neck. Forces him to the scanner. Chrome fingers pry his eyelids open.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e91a12fc-cfd0-48cc-b147-688690c20faf">
      <Text>John fighting. Screaming.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="622a5f9d-c9ef-41d4-b152-e78cf0b84b16">
      <Text>INSERT - SCANNER
DISPLAY:
RETINA — MATCH
ACCESS GRANTED</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="db2d9b65-94b2-47a1-834f-c7826f286e1e">
      <Text>BACK TO SCENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6136aa8b-7c7e-456f-9edd-f25b26abae25">
      <Text>The vault door HISSES. Pressurized seal releasing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8bfe6056-111e-4dd1-8835-70830cb65789">
      <Text>It opens.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6ceb94dc-a324-4f14-b72d-7da064155c09">
      <Text>47 steps inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f9ed3a76-b983-4405-a541-945d571375e6">
      <Text>Steps out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="0fba0cac-13cc-466c-ab45-cd3518916e33">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="28" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. VAULT CORRIDOR - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9f030dcc-df56-43ca-855c-8df6987cc88e">
      <Text>47 stands motionless. The disk in his hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cc0550be-a79f-459a-b18e-08235c3dcf12">
      <Text>FROM XO-47'S HUD:
DISK: ACQUIRED.
TRANSMITTING...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="b864aa3b-af45-4673-9288-96a8f8ed3551">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="28" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. SKYNET CENTRAL CORE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b2d9672d-2ee1-4587-a51a-fecd3a26ec81">
      <Text>The RED EYE. Massive. Floating.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6c997078-5e6c-4fe4-92b0-58611118f432">
      <Text>It receives the transmission.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2170b934-264e-457d-92b9-ca20009ab4ef">
      <Text>The Eye pulses.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="b3da3207-28f3-43fd-b128-6c80ae487a36">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="29" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. VAULT CORRIDOR - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ed580c2-8292-46c7-a321-e1c3e4666834">
      <Text>John BOLTS.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fcd71c33-a5db-4719-88eb-bb4723fd3205">
      <Text>52 fires. The bolt scorches the wall as John rounds the bend.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="40047cac-752d-4f31-819e-2446ac23c3d9">
      <Text>The T-800s follow. Fast. 52 and 67 behind them. 47 last — the disk in his hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="21bfa7ba-f623-43b5-9ff7-53ea9a89c164">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="29" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. THE HUB - BANGOR NAVAL BASE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6ff59dea-1add-49ba-a7fb-6bfda4204783">
      <Text>Tim stops. Fist up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="85de9484-39ba-459c-b2ac-c9133fdfdad1">
      <Text>The vault corridor. Far end. Movement.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="07a32414-ce24-4420-a8a2-31be0a07fefc">
      <Text>Running footsteps. Human.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b677701-2ec5-405a-a82b-e0af8f2e3557">
      <Text>A figure breaks from the corridor. Half in shadow. Young.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9ed3d132-635f-4c9c-8cd4-d894e66660fe">
      <Text>Rifles come up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a604336b-6ea0-4ec8-a5b3-49daa9f5f238">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="98904683-2f51-48c5-bd26-6543b6499aed">
      <Text>Don't shoot —</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4c21f9b6-231f-4d86-bed4-8fd2e18c9396">
      <Text>Behind him — red eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="829a2733-bf6b-4376-8e3f-5f11c0dfcab6">
      <Text>One pair. Two.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1b1cfa94-36ff-4004-af74-34968cf84893">
      <Text>More.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5b8ec415-a8dd-4599-bc71-0d770364931d">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="42301848-b635-4f06-ac7f-6fe9736f926e">
      <Text>CONTACT!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5503bc3f-2ae9-4c20-8a73-22527b08d866">
      <Text>John drops flat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0a8e8e08-0f5c-4973-a782-52fdab9970b9">
      <Text>Gunfire erupts. The cavernous space a kill box — muzzle flashes strobing off corbelled walls, plasma bolts scorching steel deck plating.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="05a0919a-f491-49d7-a641-722e463e06aa">
      <Text>Tim rolls behind rusted machinery. Cole takes cover behind metal crates. Elena presses against a branching corridor wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="535f7c60-83c3-49f3-a167-e99ac4a0038a">
      <Text>Lora — exposed, eyes searching.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="98409f36-01de-456b-b4c4-79dd97a2df69">
      <Text>Tim sees 47. The disk in his hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dca8c95b-0e05-44c1-abb5-e168b1ffb8ca">
      <Text>Tim adjusts. Sights in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bf6f2d67-00b3-4774-8e1a-7f5db16623a8">
      <Text>47 sees him. Raises his rifle —</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d9ea0bff-1268-41ae-9eea-47a0fee14daa">
      <Text>Tim fires first.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f443731a-f8f1-4b7f-b26d-386783c7f7a5">
      <Text>The depleted uranium doesn't graze. It BURROWS.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c2fe5268-b092-4dca-9f2a-e1bfbaa2bcaf">
      <Text>The round tears a shallow gouge across 47's cranium. Carbon-fiber superheating. The white faceplate cracks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="17b21006-b57b-4d64-af69-82348fb5d183">
      <Text>47's head snaps to the side.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="77037a0f-f075-401c-8040-08ecc3b316a5">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 6/8" Page="30" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. XO-47'S CRANIUM - MACRO CGI</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7f49a4ff-5390-49ae-88aa-1937fcf3bf9e">
      <Text>We PLUNGE into the gouge.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="454bd3e1-a90f-41f0-a4af-b2bdb64090b6">
      <Text>Same architecture. Blue and red. But the purple along the boundary has spread.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="181a4636-ee88-4050-b6a1-a2e284077a45">
      <Text>The boundary between them — not empty space. A crystalline lattice running the divide. Thin. Engineered.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d5c3d7ff-78ec-4175-b09d-615b59c9d177">
      <Text>The virus has been working on it. The lattice thinner now than in the alley. More translucent. The purple blush deeper — light leaking through where the crystal has softened.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0224ee16-4b0c-47d5-ae79-7502fe247cc2">
      <Text>A white-hot microscopic shard of depleted uranium. Lodged against the lattice.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ca8be16e-9465-4e2a-9027-22026ba55925">
      <Text>The superheated fragment melts into the weakened crystal. SIZZLES.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6e70f7cc-2fe7-40e7-b015-7f14cba6145b">
      <Text>A fracture. Hairline. Spreading along the lattice from the point of impact.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bcd6155e-fae2-43a9-b3d2-fc4b1dcb9050">
      <Text>CRACK.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b825a5ae-d46f-456a-bde2-1f564e2c3f4a">
      <Text>The crystal splits at the fracture. Not shatters — splits. One break in a structure already failing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="27aa5c36-5b3a-4539-8ad8-bcf4a3ff17ed">
      <Text>Light floods through the crack. Blue channels spilling into red. Red into blue. Purple blooming at the fracture point.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5d9ee0d1-05d6-461c-8946-49c68d4f25a2">
      <Text>The color spreading along the lattice. Finding every weak point.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0b50090d-db65-4f79-b4c5-45e8d439004b">
      <Text>But only along the fracture line. The rest of the lattice still holding. Degraded. Weakening. But still filtering.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ff81d3d2-4fad-487d-b95b-7d32875c891c">
      <Text>Not a flood. A wound that won't stop bleeding.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="46437458-9e00-47af-9b9e-ca6353fa2d29">
      <Text>BACK TO SCENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="00545e73-38c9-4a4c-a3d9-d00f8778c8d6">
      <Text>47 stumbles. Drops to his knees. Hands to head. Bullets whizzing past. Plasma bolts lighting him up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="37de956a-33a2-432f-8335-241bbb1bfdf1">
      <Text>47'S HUD:
Static. Scrambling.
DIRECTIVE: [NULL]</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5a639d1b-8440-4d14-a629-1d045e7ad6a9">
      <Text>The cursor blinks. Nothing comes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f5bcce38-6269-45b2-9d18-9fbc7455c62b">
      <Text>The disk falls from 47's hand. Hits the deck. Bounces once.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cd58a6c2-50bc-4b59-9341-9e45de246192">
      <Text>John sees it fall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="651fc8c6-e6ad-451e-88a6-433de21f7d14">
      <Text>He lunges. Grabs it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="319304b9-9db3-40d1-9299-d9c44e15a751">
      <Text>A round hits the deck near him. Shrapnel. He flinches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="486ad7a9-6602-4b01-9861-ed9e9de12622">
      <Text>Lora sees the flinch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dab75bf8-a8af-44bc-a802-6a75984851b9">
      <Text>Machines don't flinch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ef655d60-804c-45dd-96e6-9b97f6f13320">
      <Text>47 on all fours. Not tracking. Not responding.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dd0df688-3726-4512-8096-165708829edc">
      <Text>Lora sees the disk in John's hand. Eyes wide.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0a3c3a81-7a11-4462-8691-8bdefa51c496">
      <Text>She fires — covering — and sprints toward him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b3f1aef6-9754-4fc2-8d32-212ada6dd3ad">
      <Text>52 tracks her. Burnt orange faceplate. Rifle rising.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cc7f98a3-a8c9-4581-94b8-50378ce0821e">
      <Text>Tim swings. One shot. DU through the side of 52's head. Burnt orange shatters. 52 drops. Sparking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0eb7eb80-ef10-4ba2-91c1-446a5329cccd">
      <Text>A T-800 intercepts John. Chrome hand around his throat. Lifts him off the ground. The disk in his fist.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e3fa7979-81e0-4a37-afaf-bac03f22cde6">
      <Text>Chrome fingers crushing. Feet off the deck.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a94a43e1-57d2-49e0-9de0-ecf10f6a9a11">
      <Text>Lora fires. One round into the T-800's neck joint. It drops him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="66f712e6-e6c6-4800-ae8e-cd8f939c0e81">
      <Text>He hits the deck. Gasping. Disk still in his hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9dfcad55-7bc9-4691-8404-cf15d25946f8">
      <Text>Lora grabs him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bcd694f9-8535-4029-8280-b14a3df74d6f">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c4a41fd3-043d-4b0d-b71c-ccf168d9bbe5">
      <Text>Come on!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fd630290-1528-4c6e-8bdf-3825b32b42fb">
      <Text>She pulls him toward the nearest dark corridor. She knows where it leads.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ee6b6ee7-f008-44ec-9443-b43fffd85a2f">
      <Text>Gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="bbff96c7-1df8-4955-8374-78b301ec5b76">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 5/8" Page="31" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="COLE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ELENA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. THE HUB - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="69555ac5-eac6-4785-86b9-be141e394c58">
      <Text>67 moves. Not forward — wide along the wall. Flanking. Predatory. Low to the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c1f5737e-dc1d-4958-b533-d43a9f494cbf">
      <Text>Spots its chance. A plasma bolt through a gap in the debris. Cole's position exposed for a second.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bc8977b1-926e-4f3d-8f74-a05e7ca902c5">
      <Text>Cole pulls back. Doesn't know where the shot came from. His left arm is a smoking mess.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dc5898fc-77e2-4d53-a6c3-416b9f126bdb">
      <Text>Another shot from 67 sprays shrapnel into his leg. Cole rolls over in pain. Drags himself behind an engine block. Empties his magazine into a T-800. It drops.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cf247898-cde5-4f9b-8ac4-08c55b40bcbb">
      <Text>He's out of reds.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="43a3c5b7-171a-45b1-9cfa-a3dc6cc11c5e">
      <Text>Elena sees him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="58d8cfda-6110-4c62-b45a-b6394b5f6954">
      <Text>ELENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="063f623c-7665-4f0f-acf4-b04ec95ec96b">
      <Text>COLE! I'M COMING!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d461ec3f-bdf6-4189-9084-b234300ac044">
      <Text>COLE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0d8cd5c0-ae30-4979-982c-734dafe5d29c">
      <Text>Get to the elevator!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b8d645c2-d184-4671-ba5c-ca7e6f1dacb8">
      <Text>Elena runs toward Cole. A plasma graze catches her across the back. She screams. Falls. Alive. Wounded badly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="88a610f6-cd5b-40c9-88e1-729360ff83a5">
      <Text>Cole tries to get up. Can't. His legs won't work.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="140bd2e1-51d1-4907-894c-39fea5bba831">
      <Text>Tim runs forward. Grabs Elena. Fires with one hand, dragging her back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="99f11eb0-91cf-4349-a336-8da1feda3c96">
      <Text>ELENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="8ab604c6-3cff-455e-b208-75664866cac9">
      <Text>(gasping)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="afafff26-a608-4154-8bb2-d79c2bc56ef1">
      <Text>We can't leave him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6cbb5a19-37ce-445c-87cc-af4c79c93781">
      <Text>Tim fires. Doesn't answer. Dragging her back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="465f5741-437e-48b4-9b10-788b83ae395a">
      <Text>ELENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="16a40809-d320-44ce-aa8b-b60be9300779">
      <Text>We can't leave him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7e54f755-5377-46b2-a475-d8e37079c55c">
      <Text>Tim half-carries Elena toward the concealed wall. Plasma bolts chewing up the cover behind them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="40660344-e9c1-4bb6-a17a-89c4364e5a30">
      <Text>Elena's rifle hangs from a combat sling — useless to her. Both hands gripping Tim's shoulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ab2fe42f-5146-452a-9d1a-3e27678262ef">
      <Text>Tim's rifle clicks empty.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e37308c3-1d96-4179-a65f-a61cd19de4fc">
      <Text>She unclips the sling. Shoves her rifle into his free hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7e4ddbc1-308f-4a8a-a7e8-6ece653d5293">
      <Text>He fires without breaking stride.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="290a37d6-e783-486b-8713-5077cbd43315">
      <Text>They reach the concealed wall. Tim pushes Elena toward the gap. She grabs the edge. Won't go through.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c119db05-f2a5-4df9-8a2c-2a16b03ff247">
      <Text>Through the gap — a clear line of sight across the Hub.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e1fe0c45-e2e7-43fc-ba20-75ae424d91cc">
      <Text>67 closing on Cole's position. Fast. A blur of pale blue.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="23f5b988-a040-4297-80c3-7c1741283592">
      <Text>Cole reaches for his chest rig. One arm. One AN-M14.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8c276348-fe71-419b-93a4-1c13fad645f9">
      <Text>He pulls the pin with his teeth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0b4f47f3-72e9-49b1-b92b-342ed4a0f898">
      <Text>For one second, they can see each other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7293f692-a5a9-49ac-9020-76b19d24e10e">
      <Text>He blows her a kiss. Mouths: I love you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cfec493e-313e-44e7-9307-ef60eb9f25a2">
      <Text>Elena's face breaks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="16cf4f7a-9061-41c9-9a49-07718af34e8e">
      <Text>67 sees the grenade. Tries to turn.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="18b1b149-53f3-473e-84b1-7467ac46260d">
      <Text>Tim yanks Elena through.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a4b09417-67a3-4aed-a615-8a5ba2adedc5">
      <Text>White light. Thermite. White-hot.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="63fe4c42-733f-44f5-8f2f-2ceae0864c21">
      <Text>Cole and the machines around him. Gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="201bc401-df3a-4401-98e6-5d29573a0243">
      <Text>67 blown backward. Faceplate cratered on one side. Ceramic and carbon fused into slag. One compound eye melted shut, sparking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="63f53957-91f7-4eb6-aa9b-6c686389682d">
      <Text>It gets up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ca090139-0566-4830-8383-baf5f4bb239b">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="33" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. CORRIDORS - BANGOR NAVAL BASE - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="920b54a7-6387-41b5-8d20-042093bd07b7">
      <Text>Lora moves fast. John behind her. Struggling to keep up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="90c865af-d174-4762-9612-ffc0297138f0">
      <Text>Behind them — a deep BOOM from the Hub. The walls shuddering. Dust falling from the ceiling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="69c0feac-1785-40be-84a6-b93b5d248b6a">
      <Text>Lora stops. Turns.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f7940b89-feb0-4dc1-9ea4-168a4ee432a8">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5a83bb0c-dcf2-4270-8571-44936d63bbe4">
      <Text>Give me what's in your hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3db0a35c-645e-4344-8813-2d9c2f41977d">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="521bb852-4e2d-48b5-a1ad-a3eba90b2cad">
      <Text>It dropped it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ee1bb262-597e-431a-ab7d-4b09a9ebad16">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e3480864-463f-4145-9ae7-623003b61501">
      <Text>GIVE IT TO ME.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f2edce06-5c09-4c51-ade9-e480e83fd816">
      <Text>He hands it over.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b4a07ef0-e67f-4b5c-9662-85d6c516cdee">
      <Text>She looks at it. A beat. Pockets it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="507859de-5014-418d-ac2e-46b05486f023">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b3ff2820-7b24-4881-b11e-dd7a10399b10">
      <Text>Help me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="41002b8a-5775-4857-a428-cf94555e7b1a">
      <Text>She drops to her knees beside a panel low on the wall. Emergency access — faded military stenciling, barely legible. She grabs the handle. Pulls.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b4a1ad28-4d61-4a92-abe6-6432fdc11b80">
      <Text>Stuck.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a2e75e2f-52bc-49df-b9fa-8fcab4981ee2">
      <Text>John drops beside her. Grabs the other handle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="737108ad-e349-4ed8-94c3-695e9c6c2805">
      <Text>They pull together. The panel breaks free with a hiss. Hinged. Heavy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b57bb6d9-6856-4b91-8b69-8e527c8cf36b">
      <Text>Beyond — a vertical shaft. Rungs descending into darkness.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="efb269e6-a6f0-432d-8bb4-8e9302a6f0c2">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7c5e7d8f-2098-4780-a0ac-a76b611328c8">
      <Text>Go. Second level down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="abaf9e6d-c9ba-4be9-92f2-7e9b8b35f930">
      <Text>John starts descending. Lora follows. Pulls the panel shut above them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="682dce9c-062d-48a3-a19f-a72a874b3d4d">
      <Text>The rungs are cold. Below them — a deep shaft. Can't see the bottom.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="15590b06-3246-48cb-8f1f-4eff537c28cd">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a0b0db20-ffca-421d-9b96-b516ba878a32">
      <Text>Here. Second level.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c10ab74b-579f-4bb3-a11f-3cc3b72b9dc2">
      <Text>A narrow horizontal passage.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="509a6e15-d28b-454e-a81f-31a60c92975f">
      <Text>John stops. Looks back at her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9d8b1106-e96d-4c33-8bf0-c0edaec79a55">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a4b7fbab-6ff2-4e0f-8108-81a715d699f5">
      <Text>Go.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d6cd8876-f7cb-4cc9-998c-1b46e4c9241c">
      <Text>John crawls in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4e808ac0-574c-4fc1-86f1-7ea17b46ad1e">
      <Text>Lora starts after him. The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">AR</Text>
      <Text> swings wide. Jams against the passage opening.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9879bf5d-066d-45ac-9fca-987c9241876a">
      <Text>The sling — frayed nylon, repaired twice with </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">paracord</Text>
      <Text> — SNAPS.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="16b7438b-32ea-4862-9b9e-67b2beef2058">
      <Text>The rifle drops. Clattering off the shaft walls. Fainter. Fainter. Gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4c923dec-0ab5-41fc-abc5-71c3020349b1">
      <Text>Her hand goes to her hip. The pistol. Still there.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f2c88843-1a5f-4048-855d-c5611bce7b4a">
      <Text>She crawls in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8fa403f3-32e6-47dd-a491-f0a1d81272da">
      <Text>The passage swallows them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="3e85eccb-ef1b-4119-98ee-1643561be544">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="34" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ELENA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. MAINTENANCE ELEVATOR - DESCENDING</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bff53487-13b0-4b89-ae9f-25a15f44be6e">
      <Text>The elevator groans downward.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4376a576-2bea-4cd8-b264-29dca7d47c38">
      <Text>Elena's legs give out. She slides down the wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a9284952-93cd-42f3-a8e4-1ac908f2352e">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a3392bfc-4522-4036-99df-bf66a0632862">
      <Text>Let me see.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="02799131-6241-44c7-a161-643df87e9e12">
      <Text>He lifts the hem of her shirt. The burn runs from her shoulder blade to her hip. Deep. Raw. Cauterized at the edges.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ece265dd-3aa2-4b78-b42d-2e7b243e2dd5">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0a0c8e98-2d48-4ac0-aa4e-041b6d130402">
      <Text>You'll live.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c3fb7fd5-6981-4c90-bf2e-fb810f2ddd54">
      <Text>ELENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="616a3541-5f38-4b56-8737-1d1a7af163b0">
      <Text>Cole's dead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="494dfe17-31d7-4adb-8210-a0ba963a8a37">
      <Text>He pulls a field dressing from his vest. Presses it against the worst of it. Elena hisses through her teeth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d0eef7e2-6d05-43e1-979a-ed84d4ed0d15">
      <Text>Gently placing his hand on her shoulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b12dc9c1-fa77-4843-bb04-ebc3135bf411">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="194db71a-a6f4-4841-bc3e-71927b21b3b0">
      <Text>Hold it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="8c09b3d4-acd9-43ed-91ba-352af669dd9a">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="35" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. THE HUB - BANGOR NAVAL BASE - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6ec6c9ea-2abd-4581-a3ff-ff4a1e9f3b64">
      <Text>47 on the deck. Still. Compound eyes unfocused.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cda9f9d7-73ad-4d28-a7df-eb0711ea5758">
      <Text>67 crouches beside him. Cratered faceplate. One eye dark. Sparking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9ddea2bc-d3ee-417f-8397-4ce30071cea5">
      <Text>It runs a finger along the furrow. Assessing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3231b7ff-8a9e-4f85-9e2a-2f911d7376f8">
      <Text>47 turns his head. Looks at 67.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3cbd9203-7138-47e0-84c1-b26ae857f109">
      <Text>No communication the audience can see.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="818dc4af-5278-472c-86e1-147b76ea7847">
      <Text>67 extends a hand. Pulls 47 upright.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5ad2c596-d92a-418f-a765-d451244b8b08">
      <Text>Two machines. Standing in the smoke.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="39c273a3-9903-481a-af00-434b287550ad">
      <Text>47 looks at his hand. Empty.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8e10683d-b9a3-4933-89c0-7eedbeb5673d">
      <Text>He scans the deck. Scans again. Faster.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0de616b2-e4a1-4ef1-8831-bcae128cca0d">
      <Text>67 watches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="03302468-3703-4011-9cbe-e69255b249d0">
      <Text>The disk is gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="992829bd-21f1-40ed-abe2-3ec1b8e18cb6">
      <Text>47 looks toward the dark corridors. Then the open elevator shaft.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ae1f4d87-4d1c-4db2-b7b8-87ee83339720">
      <Text>A damaged T-800 reaches back. Detaches a Crawler from its spinal mount. Legs unfold. Eyes flare.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bb3ff7f1-9049-4c20-b88a-75860f9951ae">
      <Text>A second T-800 does the same.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c9189e74-92b2-4c1c-a01e-b43f68cf5591">
      <Text>67 salvages a third from a fallen unit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="563870db-6497-48d7-a75a-e8265851c874">
      <Text>47 detaches a fourth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2078df0a-3bce-46ff-8936-a6175fb98519">
      <Text>Four Crawlers hit the deck.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ac1269f6-dadc-46e2-9987-0ce5ef443803">
      <Text>Two skitter toward the corridors. Finding the scent.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ffbea2f-8dee-4840-830f-707f104c0baa">
      <Text>The other two skitter toward the shaft.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a1f6a289-c307-4dec-9b8f-9a2fd10dba80">
      <Text>47 follows. 67 behind him. T-800s single file.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3ce8b729-87d9-4bae-b5b0-fd2abc2e392d">
      <Text>The direct route down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="0d72f68b-8b59-4e24-b894-4f9f53e8e09f">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 5/8" Page="36" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FREEMAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. REACTOR CHAMBER ENTRANCE - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7a3e99d3-76cd-4f11-b30e-2b88bc5fb0d9">
      <Text>Tim comes through half-carrying Elena. The back of her fatigues scorched black.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8bdd9eca-03ae-43ab-8a5f-9ef80fe07168">
      <Text>Freeman rushing toward them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e6852c2d-f568-4458-9603-aa2227cf7eb3">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="98610418-faef-4bf6-8166-36188cece1fc">
      <Text>What happened?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ef493df7-d30b-4c74-ae23-9687f8734fed">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e736abc5-3bd5-415f-b906-a7fca5b3947b">
      <Text>Contact in the Hub. Cole's gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="51b102ae-b5da-43f0-ab7c-3791b5f4b59c">
      <Text>Soldiers take Elena. Tim turns back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6e9c3340-f0c4-4ee6-80ff-b7005627b494">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="28831354-30c0-4a96-bf71-9d1835e80994">
      <Text>A white-faced Holo had the disk. I shot it in the head. Saw it go down. Someone dove for it — chrome grabbed him. Lora shot it off. They escaped down a corridor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f13c8ed5-74fd-4148-ba2b-42775b46fee4">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b8e3cd17-5713-4cf7-ad3e-77fc03b6006f">
      <Text>You're sure it was the disk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="14269810-d2ec-422f-93ee-4c9e1475ab0b">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fa449402-fa36-4174-b418-a246782367b6">
      <Text>Had it in my </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">ACOG</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d812b57f-41b3-4c91-9358-7a6c4465ed6f">
      <Text>It sinks in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="372aedcc-7180-4c59-91bd-c0ebe11acb36">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c2eec2cc-9a35-47b2-91d7-a41092183fb4">
      <Text>That means John's dead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="66fcf449-c489-483e-83a4-c082a852843a">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cddbcab0-f9c6-4279-bf1b-3d303c841bea">
      <Text>I saw someone. Looked young. But it was dark. Distance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c6f5c1c5-ad3f-4457-a9ff-24ec80f1b396">
      <Text>Freeman has already made up her mind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8f2e9a92-8504-4b20-aceb-0c8dbe2282b5">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7f7131cd-bab1-474e-ae16-4f97256545e2">
      <Text>Let me take a team up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4485f9f5-b5de-4b25-b4c5-94d58e4f12d4">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bb55aecc-fa79-4265-aedf-ecbd6f539b25">
      <Text>No.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4cad2312-7be4-4b69-a0b0-a1bb32405210">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9c707e89-72fe-426f-80bf-af76405aca18">
      <Text>Sara —</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8e0b6bb3-c274-4eb5-87bc-a8481f5c9066">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b0a02818-2037-4f48-b028-f7daaaf3c14d">
      <Text>No.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fdfc79ed-a603-4c37-b9a2-d32fe961e551">
      <Text>She looks at the soldiers behind them. Tattered. Fifteen left. Maybe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="73e43335-59b0-4f0b-b4cc-0e9ae89fe6aa">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="d11b7791-03a5-42a3-863e-1997664568cc">
      <Text>(to Gregory)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b51c4dc2-6cc4-44b8-8612-3a9517fc1f75">
      <Text>Close the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="602b8bdd-59c5-4f46-a2aa-7a772597c6d8">
      <Text>Behind them — the blast door grinding downward.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="801dcde6-b763-4ce8-bece-d90d43b0615d">
      <Text>She takes the detonator from Tim. Grabs his shoulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6a13c3e1-8b4c-411f-9681-80c691398aae">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0eba9db4-20bd-48eb-b736-858d4e32894d">
      <Text>They'll come through the transport tunnel.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="49e75e74-e1ec-4e45-a30a-783ef2d09bfb">
      <Text>She looks past Tim. The tunnel entrance. Dark. Waiting.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ae2df380-4ec5-4816-b3ba-8627bfe4fc57">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8e5ffd6c-e7d0-448c-b1b4-38131eb79003">
      <Text>If it's John. He'll find a way.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e088643f-942c-4909-a3f3-a1dc2a882a40">
      <Text>Their eyes meet. Tim nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="faa69bce-4775-4f80-af95-8a29c09960c8">
      <Text>She punches the detonator.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2c55d37f-1d7f-46ce-b271-9f961ba9f9c1">
      <Text>BOOM.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1884340c-19d8-4751-bce2-7e0a912cc71f">
      <Text>The maintenance elevator shaft collapses. Concrete and steel choking the passage.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f1b571f0-2a33-410a-83ec-426d625408a0">
      <Text>The door reaches the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="00087fbf-1210-4d50-9d40-d9bb506bd124">
      <Text>BOOM. Sealed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="d3c4d63c-9a28-48a8-b3e2-ad9373a97e98">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="37" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. MAINTENANCE ELEVATOR SHAFT - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2a4a6202-5b4d-495e-b0fc-20d143a3fa15">
      <Text>The two Crawlers — at the shaft edge.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b5fc5773-12af-4b1d-b38d-f16931b6433a">
      <Text>The blast hits them from below. Debris rocketing upward.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="488e81f0-f95a-4cde-98ac-df6660c89d31">
      <Text>Both scramble back. Dust billowing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e32c135f-0b4f-46f9-9440-1b9eb278c6b1">
      <Text>The lower shaft — gone. Choked with rubble.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bfd4a2f6-ef3d-4ac1-b2f6-eef1589ef3f3">
      <Text>The upper half still open. Dark. Descending into smoke.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="dc63523b-d21b-4b8f-b06c-c6f36e31a1f3">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="38" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. THE HUB - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="119d0578-cf7a-48b0-926b-eb99802d781a">
      <Text>47 reaches the shaft. Looks down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="42d3db48-ae45-4b08-906d-6b95e23c26b5">
      <Text>Smoke. Dust still rising. But the upper section is intact.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="61b99e7b-f481-485d-9f00-876558b962cc">
      <Text>He scans the branching corridors. Holds.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d2a7f9c7-931b-4f3e-ba92-ac300cdc78c3">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7a2c5562-ed16-433c-913b-782db66b17cc">
      <Text>Turns back to the shaft.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5ba519fd-e0c6-490f-bd4f-454b0594f90b">
      <Text>The two Crawlers behind him. Waiting.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="27961388-1efb-4bab-986c-e32ce9abca6b">
      <Text>47 motions downward.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a9bddae3-aa38-4696-b37b-8812900d693d">
      <Text>They skitter over the edge. Into the smoke.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="6380a69f-c203-4264-8bd9-4673460a6511">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="38" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. MAINTENANCE ELEVATOR SHAFT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ca97b08e-b511-4f9d-b41b-d62920c1b53b">
      <Text>Green and red emergency bulbs on the shaft walls. Dim. Just enough to see.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a6b932b0-6552-46cd-9057-5d03045b9a66">
      <Text>Two Crawlers descending. Fast. Legs on guide rails, cable housings, rough concrete.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="27e5903d-c6ce-44cb-bee5-83bad55e3fa2">
      <Text>The lead Crawler passes a guide rail bracket.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="589e225d-e17e-479b-8974-6231599b0d3d">
      <Text>A thin wire between two brackets. Nearly invisible.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="044033d4-8122-4da9-b5aa-ee31ab0409da">
      <Text>An AN-M14 clipped to the mount.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="474156b6-5cf9-4454-8c7e-59bafc947bb6">
      <Text>The Crawler's front leg catches it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ecabd7eb-0e23-4123-9b04-e9f70f1dca44">
      <Text>White-hot. Blinding.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="beadd270-cffd-407d-9405-e7feeef3af8a">
      <Text>The Crawler engulfed. Legs locking. Mandibles fusing. It drops — bouncing off shaft walls into the darkness below.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="14e84a88-d035-4fcc-99a2-a59dcb047017">
      <Text>Silence. Thermite residue burning on the wall. A white point in the dark.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f8145fc3-0ab0-41ee-b6af-50a2b64d7533">
      <Text>The second Crawler stops.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="55d09f70-6c69-4d65-a318-5ac588691aab">
      <Text>A ventilation duct in the shaft wall. Barely a gap.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="90ae44e4-eba5-4dc7-b4af-416718f05958">
      <Text>The Crawler compresses. Mandibles folding flat. Skull plates rotating. Legs drawing in. Each segment minimizing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="80f5c803-16d0-4402-8138-850d1b9b9e27">
      <Text>It enters the duct. Metal scraping metal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f5940476-c9a8-4aae-aa4d-244169adde4d">
      <Text>Gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="0cba5dbc-943d-41a0-903b-cb548e6ebac2">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="39" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. MOTOR GARAGE - BANGOR NAVAL BASE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9cacaab9-a5e7-4565-89bc-141586419593">
      <Text>Lora pushes a floor grate. Peers through.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="02f2e750-fe4e-4acd-bbe7-7317c1f37997">
      <Text>Dark. Still. Oil and dust.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ad217445-1134-4c66-9625-6c151a3a43f3">
      <Text>She pulls herself up. Reaches down for John.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cedf00bb-3297-471c-ac04-324b149ce166">
      <Text>He grabs her hand. She hauls him up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1c8472b8-a9d6-4743-8800-16bcc039f559">
      <Text>Grate back into place.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="4372483e-a83b-4eaf-bcdd-6d1f31ef8d43">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="39" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. CORRIDORS - BANGOR NAVAL BASE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7cbac863-685a-4b0d-9087-c7849a28082f">
      <Text>A Crawler. Low. Fast. Legs clicking on metal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f8889946-6d10-4673-a934-0c4806b2d7ec">
      <Text>CRAWLER HUD:
Thermal overlay. Blues and blacks. Cold.
A flicker. Warmth on a panel handle. Fading.
Two handprints. Overlapping. Cooling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f9f90690-bf8b-47c3-84f9-c08037de165f">
      <Text>BACK TO SCENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5fb0cbce-7dd0-4ddc-9ced-a7176f5d9274">
      <Text>The Crawler stops. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5fb0cbce-7dd0-4ddc-9ced-a7176f5d9274">
      <Text>Its legs test the edges. Find the seam. Pry.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2107440d-d51e-4548-bc32-4fe32a556357">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="39" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. CORRIDORS - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="34e047a9-d08b-47dc-97d9-e6fd9890af8d">
      <Text>The second Crawler stops mid-stride. Signal received. Turns. Reverses.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="3c8e84e1-dacb-4bed-8b75-c679a005ce1b">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 2/8" Page="39" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. MOTOR GARAGE - BANGOR NAVAL BASE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="92462a1c-c492-4dfa-bc99-cba455c4b913">
      <Text>Dark. Cold. A vehicle bay from another era.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6a27c02e-3f2e-47b4-85b5-4dc627a4bcb1">
      <Text>Low ceiling. Vehicle lift pits down the center. Gutted Humvees and trucks against the walls. Most lights dead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="84fb2631-adc2-4974-8ae6-ac917f46d14c">
      <Text>Lora pulls John deeper in. Past the trucks. Past the tool racks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="30b31a87-d3ec-4b4c-a56a-59bb2d9d9f86">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="285d892b-faf2-4341-a8c7-a4ec401f0931">
      <Text>Quiet. Close.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="115f73fc-111a-418e-b116-608d214518f2">
      <Text>She draws her pistol. Scans.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e102fbea-4458-4d7a-87c7-c3ed75440d6a">
      <Text>Silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c170478a-84fe-4142-8602-fe74d086be11">
      <Text>Then — distant. Metal on metal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3739f4f7-122d-4896-a34e-e45103ade5a4">
      <Text>Click. Click. Click.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2952f9a5-c3ff-4547-a35f-40399281f662">
      <Text>Getting louder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="21ab2203-00fb-4f64-8c00-44c53ebac723">
      <Text>Lora aims at the floor grate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f5502648-a595-4a03-b6db-f99bcaa96aef">
      <Text>The clicking stops.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="492c4720-cca9-47a8-8152-44697391e73f">
      <Text>The grate EXPLODES upward. CRAWLER. Mandibles twitching. Eyes flaring.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0170a20a-76d4-4ad6-9f12-604b26cb5910">
      <Text>Lora fires. Misses.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="799220a3-01e0-4e73-b8a3-264cb3ee9735">
      <Text>The Crawler closes fast.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cebbd1ec-5ac0-44f8-8e59-9baf9f29babf">
      <Text>She steadies. Breathes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ab7b5737-90a8-4f31-80ac-8637a0ffe786">
      <Text>BANG.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0f885d2d-d944-4f60-b89a-4a463ba0fc57">
      <Text>The round catches the Crawler between segments. Spine shot. The back half KINKS.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a7423c8c-01f4-4ddf-b5d6-6ca37945270d">
      <Text>Still coming. Front legs dragging it forward. Mandibles clicking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="56555a8b-40b4-4822-8a4d-ea0e4af11549">
      <Text>Lora aims for the head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="54fe32dc-d4cc-4214-b487-6f3a51149672">
      <Text>CLICK. Slide locked. Last round jammed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="78f61354-160a-4c4c-a541-274b80d1f45c">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="347fcae5-947b-4ec0-930d-17a23284af07">
      <Text>CLEAR! COME ON!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0dc56275-8984-4516-8073-8ea322496bb4">
      <Text>The Crawler dragging itself closer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2e840f35-dce8-4a4f-9542-fd838639e4eb">
      <Text>John grabs a tire wrench from the floor. Steps in front of Lora.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="153df869-8f3e-465f-8e8e-73f80e9276de">
      <Text>Swings. Wild.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="19323983-dbf0-4570-b62f-6576360172e6">
      <Text>CLANG.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f3c85891-2200-4cfd-9103-d92d0ba2a91e">
      <Text>The wrench connects with the Crawler's skull. It hits concrete. Legs scrambling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="966aa092-ad6b-4755-9095-8bc4740c8640">
      <Text>John swings again. Screaming. No technique. Just rage. Every swing is the T-1000's face. Every swing is the parking lot. The lie. The white room. All of it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="06da6b00-5acc-491d-8339-81cf14953299">
      <Text>The Crawler turns on him. Front legs. Mandibles. Focused.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6781918e-4547-4509-b3dd-c4739c56d194">
      <Text>The back half whips upward. A segmented edge rakes across his chest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f5a885a1-555f-4d94-8055-79a64e5712c3">
      <Text>John staggers back. The Crawler between him and Lora.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="20be166e-6193-45a0-aed3-7f8cef5ea7d7">
      <Text>She slaps the slide with her palm. Hard. The round seats.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7fc2a0cd-bcad-4abf-a045-d2f106144af9">
      <Text>CLACK.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="833b531f-1847-48ac-9ac3-a7cdc4645be7">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="266fb95f-8c6e-4365-b2b3-6183611a4ed2">
      <Text>MOVE!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="80a2f258-32a4-4b30-915c-df9969aca084">
      <Text>John stumbles clear.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c473d70e-4089-44ec-b09b-bcf2b486727c">
      <Text>BANG.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fb47fa98-a803-4583-923e-9e66ddfeece2">
      <Text>DU through the Crawler's skull. Dead still.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3d09597a-46f3-4559-abc0-082e5bf1a521">
      <Text>Lora pulls the trigger. CLICK. Empty.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d455aa9f-1a0b-4e5f-accb-66e3b030c1e4">
      <Text>She stares at the pistol. That was everything.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b4a977b8-8c01-496e-a76d-f235258284a7">
      <Text>Silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ec11f0ea-cd8d-4b41-bfb8-4f30b6b5d552">
      <Text>John pulls himself up against the gutted Humvee. Chest heaving. The wrench on the floor. Shaking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bf3025a3-c0d6-4231-952b-f88294c8f88d">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="a83a5922-408f-4bb8-8752-06156c72ffdb">
      <Text>(gasping)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2b4bcc4a-a54c-449b-b0fa-3652798ae111">
      <Text>Where are we?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3a6a8dcc-9ba9-4823-b702-25818f453d90">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e648bb09-3b92-4346-8454-4c6f5a8f2c5d">
      <Text>Motor pool.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2df4667a-905b-41e3-aefa-e92b3070a4f5">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e89d529b-1d7e-4d1a-830f-2e126168b822">
      <Text>No — what state? What year?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ca743c6e-b7c0-4ef4-805d-9757f8a9d5ac">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="04adc395-dbb8-4fb9-afb2-55b56ddf9866">
      <Text>Who the fuck are you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f8ed1403-956e-4dd4-9363-99123f5ffa60">
      <Text>John tries to answer. His adrenaline zeroes out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e9ffa22c-7baf-46b3-98c2-56f9102f2418">
      <Text>From the floor grate — the one they came through.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="06012ca0-6b42-4b1f-a2c6-8612464e2eb3">
      <Text>Click. Click. Click.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1443a80f-a595-4707-8a1b-f2cb4701d936">
      <Text>Lora's head snaps toward it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="21e766c6-a1aa-42bc-9921-87c1bb1256c5">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9b0ae13e-b911-4931-a8e9-5891249746f1">
      <Text>Move. Now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c517b8ab-c355-4aff-85ec-0c66bbf9aea4">
      <Text>John's hand pressed to his chest. They run.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="0d06d300-8728-4ddd-b03a-1e336a7f76c9">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="42" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. LORA'S QUARTERS - BANGOR NAVAL BASE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c5a0889b-6ea9-4a50-ac5b-adbac90769b6">
      <Text>Lora pulls John through the bulkhead door. Hand to his chest. Blood between his fingers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d85771e3-aee5-409d-a7f7-550770e706e0">
      <Text>She spins to shut the door —</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="51b86dcd-8458-4a03-85c6-e3dcd0a67501">
      <Text>Click. Click. Click.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3a8f58fb-3add-40cd-993b-1ba06a0ee579">
      <Text>Close.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="57cf9d20-dd14-4dc0-af72-eae65f90fa16">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fec99ffb-4d86-4868-a73b-3193676426a0">
      <Text>PUSH!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0540d68a-5444-4614-9513-a323d6b3b20c">
      <Text>They throw themselves against the bulkhead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e5a277ae-9891-4294-9e32-536424727fb9">
      <Text>A Crawler leg SHOOTS through the gap. Prying wider.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c613b1c6-070d-4add-a8e9-fddf33dd4a5b">
      <Text>Both pushing. Both losing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="844d5216-e1b0-4722-b498-e1dd3b80a742">
      <Text>The gap widening. Mandibles through. Clicking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c35197eb-7251-433a-b358-86876cbe6d93">
      <Text>Compound eyes locked on them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bdda6999-861e-49cf-994d-11ae23b20b87">
      <Text>John sees the spray can on the table.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="88f99391-1d63-4456-863f-964106bce41e">
      <Text>FLAMMABLE.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e7462fc8-3cc2-49d3-b566-6532f66097b2">
      <Text>He lets go. Three steps. The chest wound screaming.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="07e1a1d8-b6f3-40b0-a1df-e48ccfc6cc7c">
      <Text>Lora alone on the door. Boots sliding.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dc5837da-2a19-40ca-be16-54b82ea46a62">
      <Text>She reaches into her cargo pocket. The Zippo. One hand off the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fadb2b66-ae4f-412f-8671-d2b4550a9341">
      <Text>The Crawler gains.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="316137b1-edae-437b-a9ba-a112ed51720a">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c2ff434a-143b-4c00-99f0-7ceffcff6ce3">
      <Text>LIGHTER!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3da17889-d846-492a-bb09-4aa7791282a6">
      <Text>She throws it. Both hands back on the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="52222d0b-718d-4263-a59b-c720baced356">
      <Text>The Crawler almost through. Compound eyes finding John.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e7f81ed6-aa4a-489b-8131-29055516257a">
      <Text>John catches the Zippo. Flicks. Holds the can in front of the flame.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3ecc23a0-55cd-45ff-a3b6-1293f76d224e">
      <Text>Sprays.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a8f6e8b1-9d7d-49a2-b2fc-340a79343fc1">
      <Text>WHOOSH.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ced9fbe6-0618-4f7d-81b3-91533642b0d2">
      <Text>The Crawler jerks back. One second.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="42a29e1c-0072-46f8-a64b-8168365d8d71">
      <Text>Lora throws everything into the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9b3f8b2c-b705-420b-9382-c73bb4921123">
      <Text>SLAM. Locked.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9b66b000-36c2-408d-8f0f-ee12b5b3114e">
      <Text>Silence. Just the heater humming.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="0c79ffaa-8371-44bf-acac-95ed8a386c60">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="43" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. MAINTENANCE ELEVATOR SHAFT - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cdf1fc97-4565-43fb-8639-762c4d9cbffd">
      <Text>What's left of it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e66fad7a-c97b-4b61-aca9-a687a6a0c674">
      <Text>Dark. Vertical. Twenty stories of rusted steel. Dead cable housings. Guide rails disappearing into black.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1cd98d6e-8808-49b2-af64-dbd8332c2fc3">
      <Text>67 descends first. Hand over hand. Smooth. The hunter leading.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a0d8d998-f9bf-4336-90cb-f617729110e0">
      <Text>47 above. T-800s between them. Single file.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="03fb8692-2662-4b26-8d23-931d062cce4d">
      <Text>The shaft groaning.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c5e054ae-052c-4144-8589-46290e72dbce">
      <Text>67's foot finds a bracket. Pushes off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="92ac7a4d-5f3e-487f-be37-0ac49d019494">
      <Text>Six inches to the left — a wire. Thin as fishing line. Strung between two rail mounts.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6fa79733-aa40-436d-a122-f56884849e8f">
      <Text>An AN-M14.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8f747ace-4878-44fa-b8dd-66d8bdd0d7ef">
      <Text>67 never sees it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8bac7fb2-120b-44de-9b37-89cc8f2564d3">
      <Text>The T-800 behind does.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a06ff9bb-4b20-4cd0-8e2a-e8dd15d30393">
      <Text>White light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9bd287ef-e52f-4af4-8ce4-23c15c516602">
      <Text>Four thousand degrees. The thermite eats chrome from the inside out. Chassis peeling apart like foil.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cc138ae3-7659-40d8-820c-a1e26212c7e2">
      <Text>What's left drops. Trailing fire.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0a399c05-b30a-4dda-bdf4-a8ad6020c370">
      <Text>The burning chassis clips 67 on the way down. Molten wreckage shearing across its left shoulder. The joint housing buckling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d71d991c-8e47-4a57-9de6-0f6576758700">
      <Text>67's grip tears from the wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1d37cefa-c2a0-4580-8fab-ac8345a0cb0e">
      <Text>It falls.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="07d41391-b9e7-45b3-9530-f8fdad190204">
      <Text>Twenty stories. Clipping cable housings. Spinning. Shaft walls strobing — dark, light, dark, light —</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f60f75e0-9442-46f4-b316-1cb02d72a803">
      <Text>IMPACT.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5e69ee66-a1f7-4568-9a3c-db9c6ffc5bd8">
      <Text>67 hits the burning chassis. Below it — Tim's demolition. Tons of concrete and steel.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6c377354-d810-46d5-b7f4-01224bc36d82">
      <Text>Nowhere left to fall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="04eca8fd-aecb-416c-bdb5-c2ed153dffa8">
      <Text>67 stands. Lit from beneath by the wreckage. Thermite still burning orange.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="729627fa-bd6c-4dd8-a2aa-285a04165cbc">
      <Text>Left arm hanging wrong. Shoulder joint fused from the molten wreckage that clipped it on the way down. The existing damage from the Hub — cratered faceplate, one eye dark — worse now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b288c924-1098-49ed-9fb3-81eb3a2390fd">
      <Text>It looks up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9347fd8d-a76e-4078-a146-910fc15b82c7">
      <Text>Red eyes. Descending through smoke.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="669b680c-fb95-4bbf-bead-736dc069a83a">
      <SceneProperties Length="6 3/8" Page="44" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. LORA'S QUARTERS - BANGOR NAVAL BASE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cd0ea3cc-c577-4614-910d-71d145424bec">
      <Text>The heater humming.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f8f7a300-09f8-4da3-a314-c901fdc23590">
      <Text>A converted living space. One of hundreds. Children's coloring sheets tacked to the wall. A Joan of Arc sketch in charcoal beside them — sword raised, flames at her feet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="83e73364-9791-4dd9-a617-bfff2651d1f7">
      <Text>A repurposed couch — holes in the cushions. A military blanket across the back. A beat-up electric heater in the corner. Warm inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="da13b5c6-5dc1-4a77-87aa-e67650af7ebc">
      <Text>A section of pipe against the wall by the couch. Wrapped grip.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ea8f844f-d090-4af5-ba79-b5ea25a3ceff">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="577c5363-15b6-481c-95fe-d16ba9f7b6ea">
      <Text>Shirt off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a071437f-8c0f-4877-af16-976f9c01011f">
      <Text>John pulls it over his head. Winces.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="25d85f4e-af89-4d8e-ae4c-067090927b67">
      <Text>She reaches under the couch. A half-bottle of bourbon. Uncaps it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d740fd6c-8ff6-4273-8b3e-d10d721ddd01">
      <Text>Pours it on the wound.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="aa442381-b352-47ef-af23-3162028428b2">
      <Text>John hisses.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="54e84b2d-24a0-46ac-9f21-d715b8b86f15">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="46a34b66-07ec-462c-a161-a202c85c4472">
      <Text>Hold still.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e78b17e4-c39b-4ae9-a6e8-035e2c2ab951">
      <Text>Her hands steady. Medic's hands. Thread through a curved needle. First stitch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="11a21776-2e0b-4936-b7cc-f9e845ee6d0b">
      <Text>John grips the edge of the couch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="bed2adb7-37d8-43b4-a8ba-e0e8fbf61711">
      <Text>CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3f530b96-c14f-46d0-957b-3c44a7872498">
      <Text>Last knot. Lora bites the thread. Ties it off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ff31d2c-2058-4d30-8df7-af222704dbd9">
      <Text>A neat line of stitches across his chest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e1652101-5aba-40bc-84ba-93c7eed3928e">
      <Text>Her fingers trace the edge. Checking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="71c47e80-41f5-410e-97c9-eaade48b42a4">
      <Text>Her eyes come up. His are already there.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ecab50b2-b2b0-458e-bad1-230ed817cbed">
      <Text>A beat. She pulls her hand back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="31819f30-6ff0-4311-a4be-9453e09852f9">
      <Text>She looks at the bottle. A beat too long.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2442f46d-ed76-4dff-aa35-c44c10a3db23">
      <Text>Two cups. Pours what's left. Hands one to John.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dbf80ba9-3dcd-4b67-bb9f-0f1eaaaf1677">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="102d5626-dee9-4289-a87c-738d0240c9d1">
      <Text>What's this?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="75ae62f3-0351-4a13-ba46-2b4fab4d7f18">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="10c003c7-af7f-41cf-89bd-91b420eb29c5">
      <Text>Bourbon. My husband's wedding day gift to me. We had half on our wedding night.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="41d7cb0b-daf7-4f10-bb1f-3bb56f4c049f">
      <Text>She takes a sip.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e862b6e9-033d-4b42-b16d-958b494d4d91">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2e3b91a0-cbe0-43d2-90e1-84e7f0a17f1e">
      <Text>I was saving the rest for when he got back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b2e36193-8223-4789-9aee-12f5c1085075">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="166993ff-7c86-452f-a858-793ebf3c8764">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="679d3a39-fc31-4f3a-b66d-a4dc1ed7412b">
      <Text>Good time to finish it off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="10c563bf-c79f-4a42-bb7d-4a7fb4e422b1">
      <Text>John looks at the bottle. Half empty. He understands what she just poured on his wound.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7ab176e4-218d-4688-ba06-68c1ce108819">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3f4f0e8d-6e12-48bf-b2d3-84529552bdf6">
      <Text>I'm sorry.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a47043e2-e64b-4e20-98d1-d9dcaed9a46f">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d0ca835c-7616-4e34-b113-8efb2d822627">
      <Text>Don't be.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="141d04f2-24d6-4116-9487-d9cc3c5bb7d4">
      <Text>They drink. The heater humming.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9f0cb07e-947d-4cfd-a161-c0804f0d92e0">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8159af5c-3f33-4c05-a48c-00fffb692e6d">
      <Text>You asked me what year it was.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7223d553-5eac-4846-9d0b-b113798a689a">
      <Text>John nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9e9a57de-6352-4a55-ba62-65d31b718f48">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="91d99fb6-eaec-41cb-adf6-2d99d8740861">
      <Text>2032. What used to be Washington state.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="98f5bb2a-e20b-4b39-a8a3-786810d5dc4c">
      <Text>It lands on him. She watches it land.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="49bb07bf-b1ac-4042-8b28-1c58e45bb27e">
      <Text>A long beat. His hand shaking. Not from the wound.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3a4643f9-a4bd-461c-ba15-a2096e3c2974">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d878e477-11f7-44e8-b670-81ee1d2b7b75">
      <Text>Who are you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f9520b16-8cb9-4837-8562-782e13be0ba7">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="21cabfa0-4a41-46c1-be81-b00e03999ed9">
      <Text>John Connor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5005eef1-d1ab-40d3-8bcc-a279b7b28af8">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="07008bf1-7700-40d8-8987-e3e9f20a4ea2">
      <Text>John Connor is dead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="92fb36f9-408a-40d2-9efc-e1493f7d59f9">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6cb02fdd-7937-48a5-9205-1b9e7a52077c">
      <Text>I know.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dcbc26d8-a7d7-497f-b82c-9e041ad2c161">
      <Text>He looks down at the fatigues. A dead man's clothes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="49475f69-0429-40d5-9277-4671de525573">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d0164870-2174-486d-9c9d-9f11aca07262">
      <Text>Skynet brought me here. Told me I</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="52d758ce-9cfa-478a-b5ee-65f0d67359be">
      <Text>was stopping an asteroid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d7a69efa-87aa-4e6f-8dfd-249551b34696">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3f71fb42-b853-4c59-b7ad-49827b4765d4">
      <Text>An asteroid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ff0c05e7-55c1-4b30-a0d2-06224ecd7be4">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0561a45a-8dc9-4074-bdfb-32e3a7cb9909">
      <Text>They lied. They needed my eyes. For the vault.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ed1e6614-69d4-4e66-977d-21209f6958e6">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fa0a5720-4bbf-42e4-9377-fc6f5e477539">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1d6bbc4d-ff72-4c5a-b8ee-d9eca523beb4">
      <Text>My mother told me never to trust machines. First thing I did.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6431a0e6-afea-469c-b604-7e9793e4fd10">
      <Text>He finishes his cup. Sets it down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c063f85d-cd2d-4f8e-a8f9-b63828e2c39e">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="82a27bef-e20d-428e-862d-ec8d8a2f2a5d">
      <Text>Was trust one.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="936876ae-c079-4935-9246-7cab83aebd45">
      <Text>Lora reaches into her pocket. The disk. Holds it up. Small. Translucent. Light pulsing through the crystal.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e969c475-1891-4cff-9881-2904c27b9ec7">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d5af2a25-a46b-44d8-a7d2-f09ca39c4ec6">
      <Text>You were brought here for this.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f9f7ad64-ebba-427c-bf69-fe81529cddbb">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f77b3cfd-08c4-481d-ad46-67d2e2d4dab6">
      <Text>What is it?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c55d962e-3d9e-4ea9-b61d-19f90362b80d">
      <Text>She picks up a leather cord from the table. Threads it through the disk's interface port. Her fingers working while she talks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="472bb28e-ad3e-4e51-b583-00a4dd339ff5">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7b721788-c98d-4dc2-9aef-4be5d743157e">
      <Text>The virus is inside Skynet. Eating it alive. This is the only thing</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="182cc003-442f-4e97-a91f-ceca1708fdf9">
      <Text>that lets them stop it. As long as</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="423eab7a-6809-42d7-9521-3b25f5bc980f">
      <Text>we have it —</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4a07c870-0c90-4e96-8988-fc00da0995ad">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="50f37a45-bf16-4889-b648-be91ef7cae41">
      <Text>They can't bomb us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9273c552-ceeb-491f-bf82-0cea0e8cb0ed">
      <Text>Lora nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f8a20337-97eb-44b8-9f55-e8fd1781698b">
      <Text>She ties the cord. Lifts the necklace. Puts it over her head. The disk rests against her chest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7463842a-a25f-4587-8971-810970066f90">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f3158f3a-9267-4e6a-a59c-f8568c687787">
      <Text>And I handed it to them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cc5e9681-e054-400d-ba1d-131b3b07e6b5">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5d694c14-43ce-4157-a3f0-313e62b2ce09">
      <Text>You didn't know.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f0fdaf46-6199-4e9b-8f67-725696b6345c">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f1d8687d-4e2a-4f3a-8696-51fa0eb67a96">
      <Text>How many of you are left?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ca989d8a-7e16-4d60-a24d-2c1d85e109ae">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="48ddb4ea-5934-4df1-86d8-37b616bb2878">
      <Text>Here? Fifteen. Civilians were evacuated years ago.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ed23dcb9-091c-4d8c-8aa9-2bc2ca6ec7b5">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="71658ed9-01f6-4711-993a-4381148bcf0c">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cbe58c53-1a1a-4ab3-b87f-7ba10398f746">
      <Text>Northern Command is still out there. Maybe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eaa34290-6219-47ab-a9a6-5a891677bfbf">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f1a91a96-6bd4-4f98-9d78-fbcc12e73609">
      <Text>How long have you been fighting?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9e708214-920d-4117-8924-79f1bf1bf24c">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="38ac1876-ecf7-4446-9b6b-4bac911c6999">
      <Text>My whole life.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e7393b75-74fb-4596-8c44-7e8c81bf83da">
      <Text>She stops. Listens. Instinct.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0e477012-ef03-4728-aec6-e4aa9f1a41be">
      <Text>No sound outside the bulkhead. Just the heater.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d9ae2e3f-a976-4ec0-85f7-3e0634d96048">
      <Text>She reaches under her pillow. A small box. Three Polaroids. Faded. Radiation-bleached.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="aca8473c-34af-4372-958f-f6bc9c8a22ee">
      <Text>She hands John the first one.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="70cf494a-715c-4d8f-b1ac-3b78a15eaf5b">
      <Text>Lora and ROXANNE in combat gear. Smiling. Weak sun through gray clouds.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5fd19f12-c8ca-493a-a261-66e45d1557fd">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="77a6b59e-4826-4605-b4f6-babe9f37be75">
      <Text>Roxanne. My best friend.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a87f3718-e2f6-423c-9497-038af90e82a5">
      <Text>She looks at it a beat too long. Takes it back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ffff1cff-f6b9-40e8-8dd7-9a50a6459709">
      <Text>The second.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8e8ef3d6-05dc-4dd7-89f8-30ae83dabf6b">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="636f442f-1902-437b-987d-81abd8664244">
      <Text>Who is this?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fb82a395-73fc-43df-8ec0-205babb089b0">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="67f859b4-409e-4a8d-8d54-eb2217b68dcb">
      <Text>Turn it over.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="df673195-568b-4dfd-9ad4-17f13ddc9f1c">
      <Text>On the back, faded ink: "Happy Wedding."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="09cd6b37-b918-471d-af38-033ed8d191dc">
      <Text>His forehead pressed to Lora's. Both in fatigues. Eyes closed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="92f0b86f-bd9d-4ad7-b3b4-a91d9230ee71">
      <Text>The edges worn soft from handling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9df3f22b-58bd-412c-a6c3-ac336bb04cdb">
      <Text>Lora puts back what's left in her glass.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f0f45600-20a0-4cbe-ba9b-715aa5f600a1">
      <Text>She hands him the third.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="80a44477-a3df-43d5-86bc-fd635f17f951">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="81f36a93-9e89-4747-8dca-686e1d8a967b">
      <Text>I can't look at that one.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0c1250af-ead2-4537-b463-f9b1a1666577">
      <Text>John turns it over. Roxanne holding a small child.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bc64554f-f38f-48e1-8deb-05c54e91627e">
      <Text>He hands them back. She holds the last one in her palm. Then puts them back under her pillow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7aac389e-f82c-4193-adff-41731ed1edcc">
      <Text>Silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cadd4d58-c392-4379-892e-f80404b3ba14">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="742b6354-7f73-4e75-b9b8-473dd90616be">
      <Text>When were you born?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c4e6849e-4116-4991-a39b-20063be330be">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1efada5c-2874-453e-9b35-4d37f3fcea73">
      <Text>Eighty-two.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="363772af-7d59-49a5-bd0c-b660a30f87c8">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="99153005-8046-4ade-a300-87e975cf0f87">
      <Text>I was born in 2000. I don't know what month.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="64352345-7a57-45be-925b-f42da1995e75">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b791f19a-8a20-4a6f-b1f2-7019f5b98c25">
      <Text>I was just in the year 2000.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8a92239d-b4ee-425e-8eb6-86c1675b17e6">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8a03a044-1163-41e5-9808-b9c3252926e5">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bf7fbb49-b8fd-4409-b09b-417e660a8207">
      <Text>I'm old enough to be your dad.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fa20ef4d-e137-4909-b47f-b9f6457998f8">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1a46c1c5-66a3-439c-9b00-b9dc4eea446c">
      <Text>But you're not.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cd2a7f97-69ad-49cf-b746-5f63050227e0">
      <Text>Quiet. The heater ticking. Something shifted and neither of them looked away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="18ab2ae7-7cfb-44f8-975f-e888c9bd5216">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5906a6c8-6519-4d26-93ee-2eff1576177b">
      <Text>Your body is so clean.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bcce443f-a59d-454b-b3a2-e1fbb0bd1dd5">
      <Text>John looks down at himself. The stitches. His unmarked skin.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a3051fb8-ec69-4171-b167-e8f322d7c84a">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="34e29d50-99f9-41e3-a9c6-fe55c718de97">
      <Text>What do you mean?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="176b7d9e-f88e-49d2-8b69-d1dd6509e33f">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="25889cc1-6e02-47f6-b0d8-e7f1bad39d0c">
      <Text>No scars.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e6882d8d-cabc-4c21-baf2-bd91c03d90c0">
      <Text>She reaches for the buttons on her fatigue shirt. Undoes them. Takes it off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="49c186aa-cf9a-48f9-8862-f5ece002929a">
      <Text>Beautiful. And mapped. Scars everywhere — long, short, burns, shrapnel. The war written on her skin.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="52354855-02ad-4ef5-8224-59f516f8193d">
      <Text>She takes John's hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4a6259a9-39aa-4ea7-a18a-5cfca09c98eb">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="57184458-e3d6-4ee9-a879-243fcbad3194">
      <Text>Feel them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b546765f-095a-4a22-a6fb-4a1a112e8af6">
      <Text>She runs his hand across her shoulder. Down her arm. Across her ribs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bb012577-53a9-480d-b563-30eb8133129c">
      <Text>She holds his hand against her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a5457a64-6ce8-4ccb-8d1a-b9b5bad84870">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5cf280fc-4bf8-4c7d-8454-eecf35ff5ddd">
      <Text>I am scars. Inside and out. No family. No one to hold me. Everyone is a ghost.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="62b17591-bda2-4f42-ae8e-564b17a5bbe7">
      <Text>She looks at him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5e01cb59-ab5b-43ae-ab9e-ba65934e6b16">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="35845f17-4ff4-4eb9-bcbe-e96da03d5187">
      <Text>Except you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="428e0dec-a835-4410-ba6e-8dbce4ad0b29">
      <Text>John doesn't move. Doesn't pull his hand away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6d8c7ace-5790-42d7-8a65-ab6be01fb56d">
      <Text>She leans in. Kisses him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c98c59bb-13d1-49a7-b691-39cb616a4865">
      <Text>His hands freeze. Hers don't.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a2debb19-28df-4613-b5f7-acdc879531bc">
      <Text>Then — hers do.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ce38b8e6-92dd-48ad-8027-b7cbacfbd785">
      <Text>She pulls back. An inch. Breath still shared.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ab5e605f-3654-4e4c-9d54-10dfb9c6fa74">
      <Text>Her eyes go to the pillow. The photographs beneath it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4d0f05d9-392c-4f5a-b436-cb74ae5f96be">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0cb177c9-6502-4620-810e-941221ecac28">
      <Text>Everyone I touch --</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="691422fa-ce52-4367-89f3-f3a0722602b7">
      <Text>She doesn't finish.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b727647-46ac-4014-8907-74b77f2dfbe4">
      <Text>John takes her hand. The way she took his.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="09dce8f0-6949-4dec-921f-3635dd9d53f1">
      <Text>Presses it flat against his chest. The stitches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0f5d764f-78be-4f0e-b3ed-9780ad99cb99">
      <Text>Her work. Holding.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="909f65a6-ad5b-4d3c-87a9-de27b47c448e">
      <Text>She looks at him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="947df62c-7b12-4e36-8ba9-97dd58ad2f6a">
      <Text>She comes back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="620626b0-e291-4ea0-ae8c-eab2b6d8faf1">
      <Text>She takes his hands. Places them where she wants them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8047a89a-c741-4382-9cbb-1ef1af3913a1">
      <Text>The heater humming.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8a14f28d-03ee-4660-ac9a-01816a11a62f">
      <Text>His clean skin against her mapped skin. His one wound against her lifetime of them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="75960d9d-fd33-4e57-bff2-a6bd87819faa">
      <Text>She pulls him down onto the couch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="35351ac0-35e4-4c0d-add1-15a386f0e820">
      <Text>Her hands — the same medic's hands that stitched him — pulling at his belt. Steady. Sure.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="50023382-241c-4713-b08d-9384d7a40b30">
      <Text>His hands shaking. Eighteen. The world ending around him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="93c7a233-667b-45ca-ac79-69ca87c902fc">
      <Text>She steadies his hands with hers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4407ec1e-c990-403b-8ede-d202c3a9e78e">
      <Text>The amber light from the heater. Two bodies. His smooth. Hers scarred.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e4421809-cfdc-4835-b967-8c7a3506ce23">
      <Text>Lora on top. Eyes open. Not escaping — arriving.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="33ab607f-f4ab-44a3-938b-abb2309e43b9">
      <Text>John beneath her. Holding on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3c6d84e9-b09c-4371-9928-3b1f9490af96">
      <Text>The children's coloring sheets on the wall. Joan of Arc in the flames.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b9b64c5c-6c75-4550-9f1d-85c8a4608597">
      <Text>The heater humming.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="62894d90-28d0-4a0c-a08d-e4d0f8ac1a7d">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="50" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. MAINTENANCE ELEVATOR SHAFT - BASE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3673162e-cb46-407f-b3bb-73f61af7e5f6">
      <Text>Orange light. From below.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e67badb4-c8ea-47ef-871c-98a1e577c516">
      <Text>The wrecked T-800 chassis melted into the rubble. Still radiating. Heat shimmer warping the air.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="af664988-f304-437c-bdf7-317d8996fb85">
      <Text>Chrome silhouettes working in the glow. Concrete and rebar dragged aside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8e3d0bb3-754d-48d1-993d-a4bb87d3ccf3">
      <Text>Water finds a severed pipe. Runs down the wall in a black vein.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f617fe2b-abf4-40f6-96a4-035fc5d50ebc">
      <Text>Chrome hands on the last slab. Dragging it free.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="365e5ab0-d2fc-4348-bc5d-970622f96640">
      <Text>Behind it — a hatch. Pre-war steel. Cratered. Frame warped. Hinges half-sheared.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bcae2c0a-5d99-44e0-a82c-c789cefcc925">
      <Text>But intact.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="199db931-bd16-4de1-a9e2-f28e864142c1">
      <Text>Faded stenciling crushed into the dents:
MAINTENANCE ACCESS — </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">SUBLEVEL</Text>
      <Text> 4.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f084d659-94a7-4f3c-ae08-3d894b549de0">
      <Text>A T-800 grips the handle. Wrenches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f0d66e53-ca87-4ab9-8bed-4dcae5d33ba0">
      <Text>The handle snaps off in its fist.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b560570e-3209-49ec-934f-ccd0a17b9c27">
      <Text>It drives chrome fingers into the seam.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a04fe4c7-80b7-4b47-8b01-bd25dda94ca4">
      <Text>The hatch groans. Bolts shearing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6b6e3bf7-7676-4d5c-9154-f1d80f23f0f8">
      <Text>Rips it free. Tosses it onto the glowing chassis. It hisses against the embers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3faacf53-d0c2-424b-812e-5b72b074c4f8">
      <Text>47 steps through. Pauses.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="10608bd8-8592-47dd-9c7a-d31f53dabbb4">
      <Text>Orange glow on his back. Dark ahead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e8e5fe71-6878-4d68-a2ba-df837f04428a">
      <Text>67 behind him. Head tilts. Watching.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ff1d979-0061-41d4-a965-db765d5db34e">
      <Text>47 moves on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5d3f479e-534d-4975-9c30-04fbb9f3ac70">
      <Text>67 follows. T-800s single file behind them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="883f5c49-6483-460b-9616-8f14df83df9c">
      <Text>The tunnel swallows them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9f5470ee-a952-4712-aeb6-d2e8dae35b76">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 5/8" Page="51" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. LORA'S QUARTERS - LATER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d5888378-f90c-4636-8405-82cad4c54bc3">
      <Text>The couch. Tangled in the frayed military blanket.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ead6b8ce-dde3-4bfe-92d3-d7205cbcf169">
      <Text>Lora's head on John's chest. Right next to the stitches. Her breathing slow. His arm around her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4b686954-01c3-4eea-b096-cc50100dbd2a">
      <Text>The disk on the leather cord between them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5979cb83-84ba-405c-a858-d7ad7582f14e">
      <Text>A long beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="884317f1-12b9-4a37-b316-6f10dd8e0dca">
      <Text>She kisses him. Slow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1f231f88-b85f-445f-9673-19fdbbdd04b2">
      <Text>John looks at the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a5b12e88-34e6-4bde-a9fe-426752b3c6bf">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="57e0f0d1-3272-473d-9bd5-309cff5e5218">
      <Text>It's still out there.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="02742bb3-535a-47ba-ba19-7c6531584a84">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d8ef454a-ad40-49cc-8d63-84b3ec00e714">
      <Text>They never stop.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bcb0ee45-f7d6-413e-8b0e-7832ef4281e6">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="36bbb215-709d-48bf-a60c-c67630288cc3">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b58a306c-fc50-439b-9ec1-d739cf116fcd">
      <Text>We can't stay here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ec81597b-66b3-41e6-9aba-bbfbc1a7193f">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e9ad20dc-08aa-428c-b782-aa1d7a22df35">
      <Text>We can't go out there. If they get this, everyone dies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5cf6fd33-9d72-4dd1-9d1c-65b86d7a6231">
      <Text>She touches the disk on her chest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e96f2aa6-ee4b-4f9c-84a3-016b6619afcc">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f51e9411-bb48-41b3-83ab-dedbded928ab">
      <Text>And if we stay?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="63c83f8d-82ca-45a6-90d0-fdb62b1903d2">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6a1b4605-03d6-4eb8-a221-6c10f7d8d264">
      <Text>The bigger ones will find us. And they'll have rifles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="435f8a92-2404-4951-9218-e2693c4b718c">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="56a44bb3-d272-4bc8-9ede-513a7ecdbe5c">
      <Text>The virus. How fast does it work?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="379a734d-efd5-425f-b8a1-6cdbb80c7e8f">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b359195c-7f39-4767-9d80-89de11bdd096">
      <Text>Days. Maybe less.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9bf345f2-be0c-466b-8a78-33fee189c27a">
      <Text>They both look at the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a4d2523e-ae7d-4660-8243-77474486fc85">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="71c8c14b-b524-4499-9b0a-6b0d7800f14f">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="aefe042e-a54f-4d62-beb4-b4f65aa6acb9">
      <Text>I don't want to die here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="92931262-996c-4ac4-9645-b29f3a6e3afa">
      <Text>She looks at him. Something shifts.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5c0ec849-a375-494c-9f9a-f8078004d046">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c9cf91e1-6af1-4adb-908b-6c9ccb9dfd0f">
      <Text>I want to live too.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="faf6c636-79a0-4800-85a9-456073102fea">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="114c8f74-95c5-4e6f-987d-192a9643aa74">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="111f7cb2-b8bc-4ebe-8b78-275fe78f4de5">
      <Text>Let me go first.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ef538d2c-c57d-46c3-b279-1887d7cd363c">
      <Text>She cradles his face with her hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0bb4b425-89f8-4b1e-9b3c-29e3eab91bd4">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f169dd72-e966-4c0a-99a1-a40c6bdb0398">
      <Text>You're going to protect me?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="90008478-f937-40a9-a9a9-79aca7b52ff5">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5575fd4d-c65c-492e-be9d-54e898991057">
      <Text>Yes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dfd7dee4-c72b-4e0d-8d1b-14f1fc5c7b27">
      <Text>She kisses him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="68efebce-5267-439f-9ed4-e2d2cfcb5ff8">
      <Text>The pipe. Wrapped grip. Always by her bed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="84dee8bb-8a32-417e-8141-d06712f8088f">
      <Text>John takes it. Moves to the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a77c55a2-fd16-4ee8-92c5-62e744c60b51">
      <Text>They listen. Several beats. Nothing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bff30ab5-9aa8-4056-bbdc-00509d6980f9">
      <Text>Lora unlocks the door. Slow. Both braced against it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ce159292-948d-44b8-a2af-caafea593b43">
      <Text>They crack it open.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3f6af7a4-c0c7-4e62-9e56-94fb668bc210">
      <Text>The corridor. Empty. Dark.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ed1dc161-6cbb-40f5-ae65-39661882781f">
      <Text>The Crawler is gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="65fe2f7d-ea34-47f9-9061-bb3e60315377">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="53" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. MOTOR GARAGE - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="722a8dbc-7e27-421b-9942-1a0a78ea79e3">
      <Text>The dead Crawler on the floor where they left it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="00da8bbd-a28b-4866-9a61-1d36bcfa2d60">
      <Text>Lora picks up the tire wrench.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="11131dcc-40a8-43a2-8a11-8779c14726ae">
      <Text>John leads. Pipe up. Lora behind him. The disk against her chest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="05f92412-e016-4672-b476-e1047ea6c3f2">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 5/8" Page="53" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. TRANSPORT TUNNEL - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0f36f483-ef5d-4ba7-a4ee-446cd3d1d3aa">
      <Text>The corridor opens up. High concrete ceiling. Built for trucks. Their footsteps suddenly small.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6682ad79-9cba-43d2-8ed2-50f8d6d8cbe9">
      <Text>Caged floods mounted high. Most dead. A few buzzing. Long stretches of dark between pools of light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7b02922a-eb70-4ec8-9424-bdac1f29749f">
      <Text>The ramp slopes downward.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1ec5b88b-584f-402b-9ca0-460cd2f94dcb">
      <Text>John stops.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f0c5df76-23f2-4019-960b-38351d59457c">
      <Text>Ahead — between two pools of light. A faint red glow. Low to the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="83c37bbd-5e68-4280-882d-fd28817c0dd9">
      <Text>The Crawler. Compound eyes catching the light. Unblinking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="54cc94ff-57b3-4d4e-8236-9efdab92ccd3">
      <Text>Still.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0b804107-a237-4708-8248-553b5781914a">
      <Text>The ramp right there. The way down. Open.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="639ccf73-95e9-44b7-9d27-8a05242a2075">
      <Text>The Crawler isn't taking it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e6446874-296e-43a0-aec8-0765f7c10190">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="60f0e699-e9b0-4678-91d0-8bc68b1b8488">
      <Text>(low)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b8980673-8097-400b-a313-65b0bee3f435">
      <Text>Something's wrong with it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d8547c8f-8106-49b7-81bc-aea93a104b32">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="96ca5368-e786-4d9e-bf56-0d94a67974bf">
      <Text>Go. Get back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="81c294ea-7c32-4f63-a5a7-5844750e689c">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="698fb181-4409-4052-88ba-13e697fefa61">
      <Text>No. We stay together.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="93e30054-c6a2-4d3f-a5ca-ba35ae563f9f">
      <Text>She watches the Crawler. Reading it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4d6083e2-17ce-4f96-be35-183ffbcec855">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1b6aced8-e6ae-49e4-89a6-7dbe512548d7">
      <Text>Look at it. It's not moving.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ec23469-6ab3-404d-a0d0-254bd106a84a">
      <Text>John steps in front of her. Pipe up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1b4d1921-5097-40b9-8fe0-b121a9b6731e">
      <Text>She moves beside him. Won't stay behind. Wrench raised.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="54f97cfa-9d60-4a40-958d-24e11f4d34e7">
      <Text>They approach. Slow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="822c6186-b5b8-46d4-88b6-6cf4557529ec">
      <Text>Close enough now. The carbon scoring on its eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b528c925-1461-46fc-bcfb-82127e8b7bd9">
      <Text>The Crawler moves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d4637d89-2abc-468e-9097-3926e1e75d6f">
      <Text>John raises the pipe. Lora shifts in front of him. Wrench up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="16167602-b5ef-4596-b31a-f24781c73bcd">
      <Text>The Crawler turns. Looks up at them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7324c75d-100a-49d4-8da2-ed7dc068464a">
      <Text>A beat. Two people with hand tools. A machine that could kill them both.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0bca4ddf-8c5e-43c1-8aac-12915d393363">
      <Text>It looks at the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cfa6bc17-9f5a-4d4a-b83c-59725dc06cc0">
      <Text>Turns. Legs clicking on deck plates. Back toward the motor garage.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7defdc44-f8e5-43e5-a141-f3d7bbdc3a77">
      <Text>Gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e3ba43c4-d839-4ea4-9e9a-dc467ec825c5">
      <Text>John and Lora stare after it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2cc4d145-572c-48da-b1d6-580a6618f4cf">
      <Text>John's hands shaking on the pipe. Both of them breathing hard. The adrenaline hitting now that the thing is gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8ea8a736-622c-4091-aead-c8433c63a554">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="602243fc-dd2a-446f-a291-327951fb7db6">
      <Text>What just happened?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cd4bbce6-29b9-48ba-8c00-ab77ffa550a4">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e285bbb7-a664-478d-b845-704238703e7b">
      <Text>The virus is working.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3c7ee5d1-7371-4a2a-b769-11f28ec465d2">
      <Text>She waits. Listening. Until the clicking stops.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="392f48f3-a1be-439d-abd5-269298f9a0e0">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6b6c929f-5b72-4d4f-87f8-724291966e1b">
      <Text>Let's move.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f110d9bb-f565-46f8-bd83-0b64102730b4">
      <Text>They run. Down the ramp. Level after level.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c0d0dd01-5de9-41d7-9769-c51e5c215547">
      <Text>The air getting warmer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="a00915c1-8f22-44ca-864b-ee05067c6aea">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="54" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. TRANSPORT TUNNEL - LOWER LEVELS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="acc6f6e4-0907-4fa1-bc77-427ced2c029b">
      <Text>The blast door. Thirty feet of steel. Floor to ceiling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="77b501ef-25bc-4367-ac4a-9d283f36c3e6">
      <Text>Silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2c41dd55-85c9-4884-a686-0b1ed5404207">
      <Text>A keypad. An intercom box — hardwired.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="00400376-c964-4ee1-b3b3-5dad8c34263a">
      <Text>Lora hits the button. Still catching her breath.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="33de1a81-c5cb-4f4d-9d9f-365a7fe1e1d0">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0a6f1331-b34b-4532-95f3-f77afb62df4b">
      <Text>Lora plus one. Open the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="419508a5-f6da-480c-8ce1-d3fdbfe3aefb">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="55" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GREGORY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MAYA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. REACTOR LEVEL - BLAST DOOR - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5f1f1869-4fe1-4257-860c-70a1ecca8f67">
      <Text>Maya at the surveillance monitor. Green phosphor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="870ec05c-1f86-4990-9dea-64cb11bcf4bd">
      <Text>Two figures on the screen.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f44cd6b2-bbeb-4687-a4b3-c2605e11fe1c">
      <Text>MAYA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a0e5fe00-65c6-4e95-b254-ec7e9cb1b24b">
      <Text>Gregory.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5e649025-ac1b-4593-b8d1-307328d66a02">
      <Text>Gregory studies the monitor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c57b9b0e-1c53-420a-b9a6-dd855bfb0762">
      <Text>GREGORY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="491db71b-07f9-43eb-ac94-e120df17da2b">
      <Text>Who's she got with her?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8384c3a5-31ed-4db7-b1bd-83788ed9809e">
      <Text>He leans closer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4346921c-d6d3-43d3-a5b6-532de8fd7af5">
      <Text>GREGORY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e49627ec-ac87-4287-8f16-9fc9313f57d8">
      <Text>Get Freeman.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ccc237cf-f0f2-44c4-a865-a564fe60ce25">
      <Text>Gregory punches the code into the keypad.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="18cef472-5875-4ef4-b919-7c76c7f18800">
      <Text>INTERCUT:
High above him — lost in the machinery of the ceiling. A shape. Segmented. Watching.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="99876310-7f4e-4cc1-9113-5e6c449df901">
      <Text>BACK TO SCENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ab19396d-bd22-4e40-ab5e-ec1ed3a5621a">
      <Text>The heavy locks disengage. The door begins to GRIND open.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="a301562f-95e2-4274-ad8e-59492fe4e4f0">
      <SceneProperties Length="3 1/8" Page="55" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FREEMAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. REACTOR CHAMBER - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f1a727cf-df36-4ca3-b52e-6cab4384f64d">
      <Text>Amber light. The thrum of the reactor. Felt more than heard.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e49383f4-84f6-4a5d-aed7-5a1ebdd50a1a">
      <Text>John and Lora enter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="83736f14-de60-4640-a4ea-263e46de0e07">
      <Text>The chamber opens around them. Massive. Industrial. The reactor housing dominating the far wall. Wounded on makeshift cots. Depleted weapons stacked against the wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="726f9a99-201b-478d-8ca1-c13eccc6d066">
      <Text>Every head turns.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1d27e085-e5e4-444c-a203-60265376ae57">
      <Text>A new face. A clean face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8bab5166-d1ca-4128-a8d7-b81d6da96464">
      <Text>Gregory at the door. Rifle up on the stranger.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fd507d48-1dee-47fd-961a-857bfc0d51b3">
      <Text>Freeman crossing the chamber fast. Maya beside her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6dc69695-b4a8-49fe-9e30-fabbcadcf1de">
      <Text>Freeman sees the face. Stops.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="32f253d6-21ce-4915-8f7b-6c116a458f62">
      <Text>She doesn't move.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6a8ae27d-7cdb-4c0b-848a-e676045f012d">
      <Text>She draws her sidearm. Aims at John's chest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9d89001e-23f2-48d9-9328-35bf69fd8c26">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2596109d-e4d0-4f6e-b40b-b050d5d3bc94">
      <Text>WEAPONS UP!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7fcc7625-681f-419a-ad85-9ef7b2ca5ccf">
      <Text>Every rifle in the chamber comes up. Red mags. All trained on John.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="db19c77c-5751-4c4b-85bb-9a8049681387">
      <Text>Lora runs between them. Hands up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="86f5e521-db5d-4353-a6ad-aefc4c683013">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="96a39095-3afa-4af5-ba7d-409c5a0cb79e">
      <Text>DON'T SHOOT! He's human!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a69bc978-0027-4d43-a229-ec4a8d067538">
      <Text>Freeman doesn't lower the weapon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1ba83f46-edf8-43d2-8dc4-be0212b677e6">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="700f8051-b00a-469f-9e6c-d8b3e3180523">
      <Text>How do you know?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3a3e8bb3-ff68-4dcf-b5fb-3bf50e7275f1">
      <Text>Lora reaches behind her neck. Lifts the leather cord over her head. The disk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="31850c85-b126-4394-b1fd-62027b0d09c0">
      <Text>She holds it out to Freeman.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="794a2af0-7ffd-4f22-8ed3-6085c885568e">
      <Text>Her expression changes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8ac9c13e-9422-4859-ad82-b34dc6227d67">
      <Text>She takes it. Turns it in the light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7df803fc-76d6-48bd-a982-374d6f068422">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="05308223-b1c8-450f-9eab-4b3a757ef72a">
      <Text>John grabbed it during the firefight. When the Terminator dropped it in the Hub.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1d68e9b7-4301-43fe-bcf0-9db9bf37d176">
      <Text>Freeman looks from the disk to John. Back to the disk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="03598c12-6fab-4375-b7e1-926e2f7ae2ca">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1a96b9df-5ab2-494b-9e1a-888be9ed389c">
      <Text>Stand down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="58a630f8-c4a4-4227-99cd-a5897e27b149">
      <Text>(to Gregory)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ce5ee7e8-993b-4fc9-b8af-7e970e6f147e">
      <Text>Shut the door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3e1b8692-5fdc-4add-9724-07304c067a65">
      <Text>The blast door grinds closed behind them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="17b6d657-dbce-4418-9657-9512b355a65c">
      <Text>Rifles lower. Not all the way.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eab524a3-6ab8-4172-95d6-e8fe79bb69b8">
      <Text>Tim steps forward. Staring at John's face. The color draining from his.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8a7a9849-1c59-4a28-a913-c6632acf434a">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4313e5ee-ac93-45bd-bd68-3275dd4bb2cd">
      <Text>...John?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="01bf9363-8f5b-49c0-9419-a7dd7f5c3d6a">
      <Text>The word carries across the chamber.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="66984d50-c857-422b-8774-889a0623f6f1">
      <Text>Freeman studies John.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="175c28b3-d760-4b48-9fd8-864f672b2909">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fd5ccabe-4fed-42f1-a8d1-674787ada35d">
      <Text>Who are you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fa337eff-94a4-4345-b81f-b92530a94e46">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="98fb4fe0-7841-4fb0-b70d-d909e2ac6079">
      <Text>I'm John Connor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="41208476-9e97-4db9-a805-e1e4d1277416">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fdf485f9-db4c-4de5-89f0-31a1c180bf97">
      <Text>That's not possible.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7bfb954a-b0e7-47f7-bc38-e11bc6caca79">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5df0b5b4-0c85-4bcb-8675-dcafa631cc5d">
      <Text>Only John Connor could open that vault. He opened it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="122ca45f-4132-4a98-b7e6-80b22513929b">
      <Text>Spots bolts across the chamber. Scrambles up Lora's fatigues. Into her arms. Eyes locked on John.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6f2d7c16-d8ac-4263-a557-ba6008a3ff14">
      <Text>Freeman hasn't taken her eyes off him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c1e5e9d2-7064-46cc-b329-83d2add63589">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c109354e-522a-44f9-967a-98609638ee38">
      <Text>Talk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d55c51e2-d077-4007-b9fd-9f697558a694">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7296df39-5994-45ee-9ee5-e5ec827ecdd1">
      <Text>Skynet brought me from the year 2000. Told me I was stopping an asteroid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fc8c7b9d-b228-46d7-bcba-163e2d71b841">
      <Text>Silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="335df4b1-650f-45bb-92d5-a4d09783ebf1">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2ccda75c-ab2d-45aa-9bad-faee28bcf3db">
      <Text>Time travel goes one direction. Back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c7102695-d693-40ed-a365-2460a626a792">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8b7e7b67-0dfe-4c87-9bbb-b1ebbfa849c6">
      <Text>They told me something different.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7480e575-a6b2-4e0a-b63a-c72c77183edb">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fa2477db-15dd-4368-bbe8-1f0fc125b98c">
      <Text>Who is "they"?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="19d1db56-feae-412d-b75c-6bae1753ea84">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7043c1c5-194e-4c99-9d18-f315bb040858">
      <Text>Skynet. The machines.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="3d9c416c-3ee2-480a-87bb-543f3e7ba9e4">
      <Text>(a beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="af1c944a-1eba-43ce-a4e8-34989e059358">
      <Text>They told me time splits. You keep going forward. A new path forms where you went back to.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ba7efa54-3680-4f8a-874e-a9a730eead3f">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1823e3de-25cb-4abe-985c-2c559eefa179">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9ecf54b5-344a-49fe-8baf-5c03831f51a2">
      <Text>It's a one-way trip. I can't go back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b9d2d7b0-7ebe-48bd-b226-5a55dc32ba42">
      <Text>Freeman looks at Tim. Tim looks back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="91454e1d-1875-4c3e-9466-ec7ceb7287c4">
      <Text>The reactor humming.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2cb73640-ca24-4513-81b3-d14a91ec3a1e">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="eb13517b-b761-4e52-8fff-41abced6b63a">
      <Text>What'd you see at the vault?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="430dbd6c-e08a-4a7a-9b33-8508fb41758d">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="87834683-b375-42e5-bd8f-2176bbf4677f">
      <Text>Three Terminators. Melted together in front of the door. Fused. Holding onto each other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ee2342c9-1988-455e-aee2-105104d1e53d">
      <Text>He stops.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9ac2f712-38e9-421c-b2c8-b05efec655fb">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="af9a9e96-6734-4ffc-90b6-4f6f634d76b8">
      <Text>Something in the center. A dark mass. Couldn't tell what it was.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="32b70336-2128-4a31-9fc1-e5f7aa2476b7">
      <Text>(a beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8b1fc308-2ddf-4349-bf6c-1bb42ce073e9">
      <Text>Was that a body?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2198f791-9cae-426f-9ae1-8b6cfa7cd51e">
      <Text>The chamber is silent.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="99a658db-5411-4048-8342-0030b25db6c5">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2d0c16e9-6dc1-4218-8820-7f5711dc9bdb">
      <Text>That was me. Wasn't it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="be54eb4f-08a1-4581-a6c2-e1a3efa98169">
      <Text>No response.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d52552e2-5372-406d-8dc8-e0cc4d5b717b">
      <Text>John looks around the reactor chamber. The faces staring back at him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="73524eae-6200-4dc6-88f6-f8b2608c8e87">
      <Text>The clothes on his body. A dead man's.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a451af23-4c02-4415-9c25-00ea3ffdf3cb">
      <Text>John staring at the floor. The room pulling away from him. Sound dropping out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0f68cb08-6841-4fa1-8f57-52e66956b3d0">
      <Text>Tim grabs his arm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f0382f1d-f966-4bfc-96e0-49599ad5412a">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2a0c3836-55eb-4063-9b2a-777454da6ba8">
      <Text>Hey. Stay with me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3b5be291-3e9c-446f-9a61-1226e9168815">
      <Text>John's eyes roll. He's gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d07abee4-97d4-4217-abbc-c8409f4b5a3f">
      <Text>Tim catches him before he hits the floor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="1b92a9c1-2987-4787-8086-39c5e35eff05">
      <SceneProperties Length="3" Page="58" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FREEMAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. REACTOR CHAMBER - AID STATION - LATER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="227ed11a-f33b-41a7-90ad-f8eda75be72e">
      <Text>Four cots against the wall. Two with blankets pulled over them. Still shapes beneath.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5578ee52-9b7b-49bf-bbca-3f9d10374ed3">
      <Text>The other two — wounded. Lora moving between them. Checking dressings. Medic again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="39e0a2bd-4e43-418e-bb40-8ca06247b08d">
      <Text>John on a cot nearby. Coming to. Tim beside him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="10456941-0f54-4916-b887-5915589e747c">
      <Text>Lora sees his eyes open. Crosses with water.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fe03fa49-b88a-4ce2-9516-e927442c2903">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="88d4d0f1-ad8f-4fa5-99c6-68401a188c11">
      <Text>Drink. You fainted.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c7c739a7-75d8-4ed8-a19c-063fd939d68c">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d5f731cd-08d4-4145-b3d7-70ee3339dc8f">
      <Text>How long was I out?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="344ad9ed-913a-46ae-b04e-6b93e4ad78d6">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bf25f4ac-48e7-4b79-82a3-ab515ad79176">
      <Text>Ten minutes. Eat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d61620ae-cd1b-4aa1-b70a-652bba579e2d">
      <Text>He hands John an </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">MRE</Text>
      <Text> cracker. John eats it mechanically.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fa3cd5a0-2147-4479-afa7-5349b288b529">
      <Text>Lora checks his stitches. Quick.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fbfa3c64-fc9f-493a-90da-bcc83f93d57f">
      <Text>Their eyes meet. A half-second.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ad699b19-8286-4406-8b5c-996f76dd05a1">
      <Text>Tim sees it. Looks away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="429a2d8f-f479-4953-805c-460f9aaa6a59">
      <Text>Lora moves back to her patients.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4564e02f-ac31-4933-991c-88cb0feb63b9">
      <Text>Tim lights a cigarette. Takes a drag.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c3c457c3-0e8f-412c-99e0-b8e6172b4164">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4964578f-a349-41b9-b10e-6ff6f7cec051">
      <Text>My last one.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="980e6c16-6ba7-4931-9ad7-7f2abd07e3c4">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7a3243a9-90d8-4245-b914-eb0ffed6fd3b">
      <Text>Are you quitting?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="88291583-1b90-4ad2-90bd-14064250e417">
      <Text>Tim laughs. Not really funny.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e43ebeac-1a3a-4d3a-b02c-e5617e698d1a">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a856459d-af20-483a-97b3-3544553c61f3">
      <Text>There's no more.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="95b45da5-7cfa-4083-a602-24e3ed79d6a0">
      <Text>He hands it to John.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="13fb0f64-fedd-4b18-9919-df29a47d5ef9">
      <Text>John takes a long drag. The reactor humming through the wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1251de61-bea6-41e5-b648-d24319847e0c">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b777be4f-0d97-406b-a818-ad6f4f5ed3f1">
      <Text>I thought coming here would free me from my past. But it's still there.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="862c208d-d6ec-405f-ac83-5b4de3a03945">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="90f841d1-1286-47ae-ba65-729393045864">
      <Text>You mean your mom. The Terminators.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7932adf1-5859-4abd-b325-a9987801c696">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f35d5972-c84f-4361-b50a-1205c36003b6">
      <Text>Everything.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="68568c88-f112-4711-9393-257beaf02518">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="22d96a1a-49ee-4582-9528-4dacaf15bedc">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5e6e9cb4-38a0-42e8-8546-30abc8586f3a">
      <Text>I lost track of you after that. Found you later. After Judgment Day.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="54f5f7a1-655d-47e1-8484-37efbbd1c406">
      <Text>He passes the cigarette back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7310b828-bcbf-49af-9a0c-ecddbbfcdef2">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0e81680f-fa2e-4005-9878-611df46dfb72">
      <Text>Was I messed up? When you found me?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cf291cce-4768-4c5d-9901-196819c9d5be">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="501d3846-bc49-4f9f-bf7c-71c3ec7d467b">
      <Text>It was after Judgment Day. We were all messed up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ff202a80-dc1d-462d-915b-1f70559e9e22">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="85b2ebbe-2508-473c-bad1-338f6600f8ed">
      <Text>I mean in the head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e52945d1-01d2-44a2-8205-241c8e9a6e0b">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d2e677dd-7747-45e0-93ac-8f5ffbe65ebd">
      <Text>Nah. You were the toughest of us. Held us together in the beginning.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="72ae47cc-8b02-46c4-a878-305d7b752b31">
      <Text>John takes a drag. Staring at nothing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ec6450dd-4fa1-4f80-a5e6-6e092292dc6b">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4839a5c5-dd47-4ec3-b88c-06b192bef6ce">
      <Text>But I'm not that man.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7bb5a4e8-c7f0-4635-b0c4-6a1a5eb90852">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0e6be12f-9b60-4d11-afc8-5c6c215b60c9">
      <Text>Yeah, you are. You opened the vault. You're him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="528c1693-2adc-4524-8c50-0a89a2e56269">
      <Text>Lora's hands slow on the bandage she's wrapping.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="12b8e239-736d-44bd-a083-5f7d2aa28351">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="08990b76-c4a6-42f7-b88c-14589eb6d6ea">
      <Text>But you're not. I get it. You're him without Judgment Day. Without thirty years of this.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c73d1044-3f72-4548-9cf9-1b9e7c4a1e29">
      <Text>He gestures at the chamber. The wounded. The walls.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="56df6cee-bc76-474a-a215-83f65dc3a05d">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2a315556-16db-4e6d-9c31-72802205a30a">
      <Text>Don't sell yourself short.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="db12860e-0169-4b51-b266-a95b0168e6dd">
      <Text>John says nothing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f9a49865-7127-414e-999c-84a103037a18">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e99683ac-382b-4bc9-a37a-67808644d0b5">
      <Text>There's a phrase you used to tell me. When we were kids.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a2c7f878-abf3-427d-8800-b1da9f868ded">
      <Text>John looks at him. Has to think.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="62254f4b-97b8-4e53-b58e-f8f6fdec45da">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7bf1acba-fc09-486d-b24c-e479402933a0">
      <Text>There is no fate but what we make.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c46486b2-934d-409c-9fc3-4ee3fc4e32f5">
      <Text>Tim grins. Punches his arm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4245d45c-1a3e-439d-b1a1-3bf9f1bde3a6">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e87eea8c-9c1e-4f2f-9954-9ee62c828562">
      <Text>You're John Connor. Live up to his name.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9c27df2f-8441-4e85-a932-f65bd56c76d1">
      <Text>John almost smiles. Almost.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bc8a1794-81b1-4c4c-99f8-41a1675438c0">
      <Text>Freeman crosses to them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="69ddd08e-6e23-429b-a4bc-b78ac5494961">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4d2c4e1c-876e-4c98-a15f-8daf5cdee8c4">
      <Text>On your feet. We're moving.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ea5a70d1-8c48-4a6b-ae30-2690802f456d">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6b7accba-67e7-40b1-b675-865ff2e8037b">
      <Text>Where?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="73b89bb2-f6fc-46f4-a6c8-0762c9e702cf">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="26d0e3a2-d6fe-4e03-b898-541d485a8477">
      <Text>Sub pens. The cooling channel is passable. They don't know that.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="27241628-319a-4b8d-be80-b481e726f240">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="91d79d06-d532-4461-bb5a-bd4d2f58c589">
      <Text>And after that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b863883a-a005-40d1-9c69-22e1dd38217d">
      <Text>Freeman doesn't answer. She turns to the room.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="68172d70-e2aa-4cee-858c-a753d5a84173">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="95e46a8d-a983-467a-af79-d6703cdf73a1">
      <Text>Pack it up. Wounded first. Everything we can carry.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a85dfb30-01dd-4088-aa86-fc648eb04292">
      <Text>Heads come up across the chamber.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c6d232ba-ca59-41b0-910c-6a155a964a92">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9a1290eb-26ec-4336-81dc-788c434bad03">
      <Text>Now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2fed313a-b4b5-449c-8ca3-5b958d9d934e">
      <Text>The chamber moves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c46e2b54-5a93-4435-8389-bf0d514cd526">
      <Text>Soldiers packing fast. Stretchers lifted.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="17b204de-75e9-4ee8-9405-9c92b751a07b">
      <Text>The chamber revealing itself in the movement. Two hundred feet long. Blast door at one end. Reactor housing at the other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3efc71ba-aa85-4739-bbad-78e5e8fa3e16">
      <Text>Welded barriers and concrete columns between. Salvaged hull plating along the left wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0cb2b37b-63e2-4d4f-aaa4-289b8347bdc8">
      <Text>The cooling channel entrance low in the right wall. The way out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="8072e28c-1f39-43f5-a624-6da77831384d">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="61" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. DEEP TUNNELS - LOWER LEVELS - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3680f9c7-bafe-42bc-8af7-effd06745032">
      <Text>47 stops. A transmission.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a2918219-cb94-4efd-9c71-c8c9ba8a9b90">
      <Text>47'S HUD:
CRAWLER — INCOMING:
PASSCODE: 742916</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a6a1c142-c6dc-4452-afe5-7e6121f2f21f">
      <Text>He turns to 67 and the T-800s behind him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3b9b456b-9dea-47d1-88bf-21a44491355d">
      <Text>A half-second delay. Then he moves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="443386c8-b0b1-4f4d-8028-0786d874c2ab">
      <Text>They match his pace.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="f2d56429-16c8-47b2-8a59-948087d48fbe">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 2/8" Page="62" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MAYA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. REACTOR LEVEL - STOCKPILE - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d411db80-8c05-418a-804e-ab64ccef0bcd">
      <Text>CLOSE ON: an ammo can. Nearly empty.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f86a7a4b-0c0b-4928-b8bf-91b5cd9856c4">
      <Text>A hand digs out the last loose greens.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="164eeb5a-8b69-4763-9fa2-768ef7f76eaf">
      <Text>MAYA. Kneeling. Thumbing them into a magazine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="91baf030-ec1c-4a77-96aa-bdf22e92eb4a">
      <Text>Click. Click.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ed7b14bc-fd74-4ee0-845d-c78ff2c7a480">
      <Text>Three left in her palm. She counts them anyway.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="74ef903c-91d1-438d-b100-ff9e59fb670e">
      <Text>Lora crosses to her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b7631337-d8af-47b7-90fd-ef638fa724ac">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bad3a0f9-641e-4412-873d-e26c0fca7cdc">
      <Text>How many rounds?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ac2c0fba-6690-4157-bc0d-26bd0f4cd70c">
      <Text>MAYA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="52ee0027-bfcc-49ba-a024-3294bcb43114">
      <Text>Fourteen greens.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="db60442d-0454-4225-9d23-586cc305aca4">
      <Text>Lora pulls a green mag from her vest. Thumbs out six. One at a time. Into Maya's palm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="09132e2a-696f-4225-bf61-b8aaacdc85e1">
      <Text>She closes Maya's fingers around them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2ef4cd9b-4d5c-4d29-8dae-c04d60d86bd6">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5c635e14-bdd7-4ae2-a8e9-d0ad8ab9486d">
      <Text>We're getting out of here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eb0e6c31-377b-4fbc-aafe-aec9af8b75d6">
      <Text>Maya nods. Small. Holding the rounds like they're worth more than they are.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eb928e38-7ae4-45e7-91be-6481e08b9c86">
      <Text>She loads them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ec38fa87-0649-4763-bc90-942747692ed1">
      <Text>Lora loads a red band into her M-16.                   </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ad8ed75-8154-4825-922b-c1dcaa32f109">
      <Text>Grabs one of the last rifles -- an old M4 with a red dot. Hands it to John.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dde53254-3206-4208-b62c-b6005a7e912d">
      <Text>Lora</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b389ffef-a487-44b3-9475-aedbedde3a65">
      <Text>Sighted in. </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e48a8380-d59a-4a49-a0f6-73ef0c432243">
      <Text>John takes it. Pulls the charging handle. Checks the action. Quickly sights.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="21b1570b-8921-47da-bee2-d07a9be80bdc">
      <Text>Behind them -- Maya slams her mag home. Racks the charging handle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9153feee-5a61-4dba-a50c-1333a8ff7d67">
      <Text>It jams halfway. Won't run forward. Won't come back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="526ee296-b612-43d1-86a4-a7b3cdc1e851">
      <Text>She fights it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b47ff9d0-9046-40a7-b6d5-620250c9b9e5">
      <Text>John crosses. Holds out a hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="17294969-a4b7-458e-99a2-b04fc989072a">
      <Text>Maya hesitates. Lora nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5095aafc-5d57-4a50-accd-c3423e10eaed">
      <Text>She hands it over.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cb5e2167-0707-44d7-b1d6-40348a1d0d55">
      <Text>John drops her mag. Pops the takedown pins. The rifle breaks open. He slides the bolt out. Holds it to the light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="820c41bd-798d-42e9-9fba-ab5dac6a221b">
      <Text>The bolt tail -- a baked ring of carbon. Thick as paint.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="760652b1-158c-45f0-b663-361857919525">
      <Text>He thumbs the top round off her mag. Scrapes the ring with the case rim. Black flakes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b794ac6d-1f25-4264-a384-09ef228e348d">
      <Text>Presses the round back in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5f73efb8-1b0c-4f16-858e-ddfe9d33d1f8">
      <Text>Bolt back in. Rifle together. Seconds.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="29f5eae3-acfd-47ff-a252-025aa610a2aa">
      <Text>He racks it. Smooth. Hands it back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f000209c-0597-4685-a9e9-64e8313e5df1">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cb1937fd-f8e4-4ff7-a36e-de9d72501680">
      <Text>Metal's worn. It'll stick again. When it does -- rack it twice. Hard.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4eb49e82-73ca-4bc7-8130-7322069cffca">
      <Text>Maya looks at him. Really looks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d32b948f-57fe-4c91-ab2d-71922075afca">
      <Text>She shoulders the rifle. Goes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="87fe7441-274b-4152-8753-278ca157011e">
      <Text>Lora shows him a magazine. Dark forest band.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="534618a5-0e28-4a4a-8916-ddf07a342a6f">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3caf65fe-e432-4cde-a270-daad2d76ac94">
      <Text>Green tips. Standard steel. Better than nothing against chrome.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="03a78f9c-56eb-461e-b23f-80ab9f1e12f2">
      <Text>Another. Dark crimson band.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a6402277-1f6c-4beb-8f5a-7835c80adc94">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f393e0a1-d937-480a-bebb-8e8384149534">
      <Text>Red tips. Depleted uranium. Penetrates endoskeletons.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1824d701-4a7e-4ae3-aea7-54de2f2375b6">
      <Text>She meets his eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="592c5b01-0d4d-46ba-a183-72bd4e01d2b1">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4060b7eb-a042-4ae0-9366-75b33ba290d4">
      <Text>If all you have is greens, aim for joints. Optical sensors. Cylinder rods at the neck, elbows, knees.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="232cccc2-4339-449d-841b-fce070c6086f">
      <Text>She hands him one red. One green.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cc976c22-f836-4842-99d6-8d88005090f6">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ff188e96-8938-4050-9c8b-377b12308417">
      <Text>Make the reds count.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="64f39ca4-488e-4392-8664-ffb39d489368">
      <Text>(a beat)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="01cb833d-b0b6-4880-942e-53dfde5573e1">
      <Text>Stay with me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3c959523-bfca-4c84-9317-c0797e70370d">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ee54968c-fa91-494c-9552-82f0ae995fb5">
      <Text>I will.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="61e4fde7-5c81-4e84-8406-22abc4b40a1c">
      <Text>John picks up a plasma rifle. Heavy. Cold.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a678eb6b-4df5-45ed-b453-0ca45976f97d">
      <Text>His hand finds the grip.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="80e8d33d-8330-40eb-a698-1e705d02897a">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="59b148b1-58cf-4d66-84c8-ee15b212fdca">
      <Text>Won't work. Reader in the trigger. Needs a machine's hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0b016ed7-a671-4d4c-a75c-66bb4523cbb9">
      <Text>John sets it back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="4fac5145-8c59-4a2f-841a-13048ea06920">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="64" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. TRANSPORT TUNNEL - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5f27ea45-5c30-4122-a187-6f06e8cc4d22">
      <Text>47 emerges from a side passage. The tunnel opening around him. High ceiling. Caged floods buzzing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="71c25c91-22bb-4384-be45-d645098ba190">
      <Text>67 behind him. T-800s filing out. Chrome filling the tunnel.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9925845b-b011-4142-85ee-aa636392ea65">
      <Text>Arrows on the walls. Faded stenciling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cd247ea2-827c-49a4-8eac-091927164822">
      <Text>REACTOR.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f96354fe-efc1-467d-a98e-a073954e208f">
      <Text>47 turns downward. They move. Fast.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="e6ee64a4-9eb7-4fc9-bc5e-b361a0b97bbf">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 3/8" Page="64" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FREEMAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. REACTOR LEVEL - BLAST DOOR - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a3341ab5-b2d2-4931-bf09-c899efa4347a">
      <Text>The surveillance monitor on the wall near the blast door. Still glowing. Nobody watching.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8a4cd20b-d0b8-43ad-ad8a-fa79edac666d">
      <Text>On the screen — Terminator silhouettes massing. 47's white faceplate visible at the front.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fe646fa6-6485-4716-ad19-0ac5c2761599">
      <Text>High above the blast door — a ventilation grate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="85f0a229-be15-432f-b0a8-b8871bceaae2">
      <Text>It shifts.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="90d672b1-6c54-4243-b21d-7af56fd65da6">
      <Text>The Crawler drops to the floor. Silent. Legs splaying for balance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7e5b63eb-4747-4b72-ab04-65956958c100">
      <Text>Across the chamber — Spots stops mid-step.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8151f311-0938-4dba-9412-ba3a3f9d672d">
      <Text>Ears rotating. Fur rising. Eyes locked on something the humans can't see.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="17fc1bdb-e7c1-4699-824a-3f299e6e87cb">
      <Text>She HISSES.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e83c6fee-cd6b-4885-b1c7-23a3a367f48c">
      <Text>The sound lost in the noise of soldiers packing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="342ab349-18b7-4d26-af20-af71f65e94ed">
      <Text>The Crawler at the keypad. A mandible extends. Tip finding the buttons.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="303ee53f-0688-4f86-8822-01fa115032ee">
      <Text>7-4-2-9-1-6</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="161c245a-56b8-4e38-8aaa-221b2f24d184">
      <Text>The blast door begins rising.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="532d0af6-6efe-4aef-a18e-fddb1d66897e">
      <Text>Through the gap — darkness. Then movement. Low. Close to the ground on the other side.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="25a043be-9a7f-4571-8f12-9f9efe4969c9">
      <Text>Red glow bleeding under the rising door.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="95d9dd63-ce62-47b2-b28f-fdb70758eec5">
      <Text>Spots pressed against Lora's leg. Hissing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4003ddcb-d74e-4a81-a32d-1d4e7c45e2c0">
      <Text>Freeman sees it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1c381a42-2d87-4d3e-8639-744431ebca19">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="863ce035-808c-44fc-8c04-25c0a06d14b5">
      <Text>CONTACT! ON THE DOOR!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0a76d3a1-d193-4c94-9867-09f882d0f78f">
      <Text>She raises her weapon. The door rising. Inches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1045be90-c641-4e2d-8128-214fd88b7498">
      <Text>Stretchers dropped. Soldiers scrambling for rifles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ab025a85-a239-44dc-8bd1-498eaa93f712">
      <Text>Knee height. Plasma bolts streak through the gap. Low.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b4397c87-c082-4d6a-8457-3fd5b44e4d9f">
      <Text>A soldier taken off his feet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="21c31321-c709-46a1-8973-e8983630f190">
      <Text>Half of them still reaching for their weapons when the next volley hits.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e164fdbb-3337-40dc-a73d-bdc64bfc634d">
      <Text>The Crawler from the vent. Loose in the chamber. Skittering through the chaos. Legs clicking on concrete.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9dc4c84c-d1a0-4d1c-8286-d0868a8cfb39">
      <Text>Lora tracks it. M-16 up. Fires.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7e59a54f-c523-48fc-992e-c44d4e036011">
      <Text>Red tips tear into the Crawler. Segments shatter. It convulses and goes still.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e47aca3d-8fa0-4b8f-9d08-0a6cb2c7c9f8">
      <Text>She drops the empty magazine. Slaps in her last red.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="063c1a5c-233a-42fa-88b7-ab5e15c1a5ee">
      <Text>The door still rising.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c3a8e8bb-6a42-4729-af8c-1d87e7e6fec4">
      <Text>T-800s ducking through. Firing. Bolts across the chamber at waist height.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b670f61e-de3d-4ec9-8ccb-eaf9746ca4e5">
      <Text>Two soldiers cut down before they reach their weapons.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3701c53d-4f9a-4c87-a447-189fef95b27f">
      <Text>Freeman behind a concrete column. Fires around it. A red tip through a T-800's chest. It drops mid-stride.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c7878309-fd56-4593-a8fd-013540d6258d">
      <Text>Return fire SLAMS the column. Concrete chips showering her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5ee47f7c-dc2b-4fc9-8075-1d113399a129">
      <Text>Tim — opposite side of the chamber. Cut off. A T-800 advancing on him. Three rounds into its knee joint. It buckles. Keeps crawling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a796b995-1638-4da0-9c18-3cc0c103ab9c">
      <Text>John pulls Lora behind a welded steel barrier. Plasma bolts punching through it. Light where there shouldn't be any.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c837d8b5-bcb3-46d4-87f7-b552df81e2cd">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9bb63737-371e-401e-b9e2-41a61049f279">
      <Text>Move!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d21b5d32-0bc3-488f-b12f-3d917492d98c">
      <Text>They break for the reactor housing. Bolts scar the surface but don't punch through.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d9ab5d6f-3ed3-4793-950c-da5928461cd0">
      <Text>Behind the housing. Breathing hard. John checks his magazine. Red. Almost out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="05990074-a63f-4162-96dd-5e88a2f95467">
      <Text>From here — a clear angle across the chamber. 67 on the far side. Moving along the wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4e16fdfe-d886-4fea-b549-5949d42a3fd9">
      <Text>John leans out. Sights. Fires.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ac1a598c-1e47-4d50-83aa-d836564670fa">
      <Text>Misses by inches. Rounds punch through the concrete behind 67.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f74df886-e57d-4cad-8297-a19ddfc21164">
      <Text>67 rolls to cover. Unhurried.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b2d9f14d-0494-4fe6-8803-dea6ed28d859">
      <Text>John's red mag clicks empty. He slams in his only green.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7442d3f6-0909-4e75-8853-1d4f223b6af5">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="84c16a49-b8d3-4a2f-80fa-811ba1543c7a">
      <Text>FALL BACK TO THE CHANNEL! GO!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e6c9dc07-ac78-4687-9b0d-aef5a57eabcf">
      <Text>The soldiers move. Those who can.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7f74da30-53cf-4479-ac14-8bc9ae0a2d18">
      <Text>A soldier breaks for the channel. A bolt catches him before he gets there.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e7753c6b-a8df-44ff-9ff7-63ab4ccda3bb">
      <Text>Elena firing from cover. The Young Man beside her, rifle braced against a support column.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="393b47a1-f2ab-49ad-9b75-299cc1bdb9ea">
      <Text>The T-800s advance through the chamber. Methodical. Relentless.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a3450b49-d24a-40de-a19e-238576edba9f">
      <Text>One of them stops. Mid-stride. Just stops.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c7de129b-301b-41d6-99d1-6c918eec3ebf">
      <Text>Then starts again. As if nothing happened.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fbeba9cc-0b33-4e77-ac77-bf2613816ea9">
      <Text>Gregory behind a concrete support column. Controlled bursts. The soldier beside him — slumped. Gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="c35fa1e4-a8bf-4003-a564-2c517722f615">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="66" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. REACTOR LEVEL - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b2be2844-a3a7-4648-982a-d4b771c04e6b">
      <Text>47 kneeling. Tactical position. Eyes tracking the chaos.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8349284e-9038-4a70-ad36-fc36e3deaad6">
      <Text>The T-800s continue past him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a46adcfa-f67c-48df-8027-69e78d209f7b">
      <Text>A wounded soldier crawls across the floor. Dragging a burned leg. Barely conscious.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eb35eb28-0d4d-49a4-979c-096acfcc9970">
      <Text>47 steps over him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a79950b6-7799-486a-a1d0-8d3b884019af">
      <Text>47'S HUD:
The hexagonal interface — data streams, targeting overlays, tactical analysis — cuts out.
Black screen.
Then: a single orange cursor. Blinking.
DIRECTIVE: _
One second. Two.
Nothing comes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f5890dd0-7319-4f05-9551-7e2632784bcd">
      <Text>BACK TO SCENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5a8c06d7-a8a1-48cc-8a21-d4bbea95aaeb">
      <Text>Maya behind a section of hull plating. Firing. Plasma bolts hammering it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ed89f9f3-65b7-4e86-82b5-cffdab75a300">
      <Text>Her rifle jams.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="74c76a50-7810-448b-b7b6-dbcfa3182c51">
      <Text>She racks it. Won't clear.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="24b57c22-b79e-4912-bcd3-d93aede85a62">
      <Text>A T-800 flanks wide. Sees her from the side. Raises its plasma rifle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="12a4ac7d-82d8-439e-810f-9f1478714691">
      <Text>47 — three meters away. Watching.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1d513d22-bc7c-47e6-8e85-b8b5c18f5cc3">
      <Text>His hand moves. Fast. Knocks the T-800's arm. The bolt sears into the wall beside her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="86409e83-8bcd-4f6d-a7ff-c7ec8815d25e">
      <Text>Maya bolts. Sprints for Gregory's position. He reaches for her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1e707be1-9657-4ae3-9031-99da43b92c2c">
      <Text>She drops behind the column.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fc15a011-9b34-4387-b85a-0ba4baa613e9">
      <Text>The T-800 turns to 47. A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8c29f862-0030-40e6-8703-a09e223d1dc8">
      <Text>The T-800 moves on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="66ac451c-fa25-451d-81ba-4851338ebae1">
      <Text>47 stands motionless. Looking at his own hand. Rounds cracking past him. He doesn't flinch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1170ab2f-1920-4d51-a336-18992bd7d40b">
      <Text>47'S HUD:
The hexagonal interface flickers back. Unstable.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9c02d35f-b3e8-4b1f-be6e-5da68366bd9c">
      <Text>BACK TO SCENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8bef8ed3-18be-496d-9095-32a9c10a837a">
      <Text>47's eyes flicker.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4f6c19d9-ef3c-4da7-ae03-dd4fd48ae55f">
      <Text>Across the chamber —</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9d496967-6604-41af-aa0b-1126d65701cd">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 6/8" Page="68" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIM">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. REACTOR LEVEL - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b54655fb-adf9-4af3-8b1f-86e00c8aab34">
      <Text>The humans giving ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3eb2d46a-e7f2-43a6-8140-d4f256ded013">
      <Text>A T-800 firing at Elena's position. The soldier beside her already dead. It keeps firing. Bolt after bolt into the body.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="464b5b00-def8-43d3-af27-849978fe0d83">
      <Text>Gregory's position. Maya with him now. Racks her rifle hard. Twice. The round clears.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ea269087-6d7e-45f7-99be-9db22b199295">
      <Text>A plasma bolt hits the column beside her. Concrete chips. She flinches. Steadies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e4d07ba0-1703-4a45-9a92-e0c6aec0a501">
      <Text>A T-800 advancing. Left forearm gone at the elbow. Sparking stump. Still coming.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2baabf82-cdca-407b-b77a-89fca30f1a8f">
      <Text>Maya fires. Hits its remaining hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7512b46c-f709-4dc5-bb44-9b767d4332b2">
      <Text>The hand buckles. The shot goes wide.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9638f87a-3574-46ae-9bcc-23b5f8492691">
      <Text>The bolt SLAMS into a cooling pipe along the reactor housing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5d8e00dc-33c3-4af8-a09e-d9873f4c0016">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">HISSSSSS</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d291fd3d-3848-40ee-9b62-1740c1bbe70f">
      <Text>Steam. The pipe CRACKS. Water onto the floor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e239c464-039f-4f35-aa67-23aa4b4195fd">
      <Text>Deep within the reactor housing — a warning light. Green to amber.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fb1e6380-d3e7-4cc4-8193-2bdf38861787">
      <Text>No one notices.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e9a55077-19ca-4b81-b088-9510efa7ac00">
      <Text>Another T-800 walks past the fight. Not flanking. Not retreating. Toward nothing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ae285896-4a2b-4595-9e0c-bd84c8e2eed7">
      <Text>A red tip catches 67's plasma rifle. The barrel housing splits. Dead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3eb7acb2-5072-4abb-9ced-828d088febb0">
      <Text>67 drops it. Moves to the wall. Fast.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8df108f0-df50-450b-b5aa-1d3a260dd353">
      <Text>The nearest replacement — center floor. Open ground. Penetrators ripping through it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f18d9754-c4ad-4507-b9e6-0e3c626fc1ff">
      <Text>No path.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e6ad0aec-a1e8-4e04-b3e0-04e40f18d274">
      <Text>67's remaining eye tracks across the chamber.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c6dcd36b-2420-4793-91d2-5b8775fab5d9">
      <Text>Tim.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="66a33ba6-f539-4030-a2f2-689a7b9c8b06">
      <Text>67 moves wide. Along the chamber wall. Behind the fight.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9b42103d-e2da-4327-9850-825aac2f838c">
      <Text>Tim behind salvaged hull plating. Controlled bursts. Red mag.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e110890a-2924-4c3e-8074-b3f3434a7127">
      <Text>Click. Empty. Last red spent.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fd6be946-11a3-42c9-8dde-af86f32f20cd">
      <Text>He reaches for his only green.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1aa07424-b975-405f-9118-71bea6323b7b">
      <Text>67 rounds the far end of the hull plating.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="151dda9c-2763-496c-9192-f214111159c2">
      <Text>Tim hears it. Spins.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ed72ab5-a436-4adf-a172-b36d5515f353">
      <Text>Fresh magazine in one hand. Empty rifle in the other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0b3a155d-bd6a-4ef2-a624-934d53ad5ff1">
      <Text>67 closes the distance in one stride. Hits Tim like a wall. He crashes into the hull plating.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="094e4abf-f8af-4fb2-9671-1c6c3093f70a">
      <Text>The magazine skitters across the floor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a901bf42-88ae-4441-8eb7-1304be5c586d">
      <Text>67 picks up the rifle. Seats the magazine. The green band visible as it clicks home. Racks the bolt carrier.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="571e80c5-732c-492e-a0fa-7fe318ae95bf">
      <Text>67 looks down at Tim.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="027ceef3-aaf4-4a9b-bd46-7aabb4bf8b95">
      <Text>Tim looks up at 67.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4ce2d6a6-aba3-425a-b55b-06f11af18b64">
      <Text>Nothing happens.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="69e9d62a-5c7e-47a6-a1db-b8366f19501d">
      <Text>A soldier breaks for the channel.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c404938f-f9b3-49d8-86ec-7b899fdaeaf0">
      <Text>67's head turns. Tracks the movement.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="18ff3445-f0d4-45d5-b5b4-f179e34a15df">
      <Text>Fires.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8b13b930-617a-4ab8-aad9-9cea1ddb1bb2">
      <Text>John sees all of it. Breaks from cover —</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3966cf44-4c19-443e-b29d-57afd0d5eb32">
      <Text>Lora fires. Controlled bursts. Driving 67 from Tim's position.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e7e5d3ce-5c45-4f92-bb6f-5deb9506176a">
      <Text>67 moves along the chamber wall. Far side. Clear line on the channel entrance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2a902f14-dd8c-41fd-bf11-57592193ca4d">
      <Text>A T-800 shifts fire — Lora. The gap opens.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9eab0f32-ccbc-43f5-9f72-4d049ba7e557">
      <Text>John vaults the hull plating. Slides in beside Tim.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5f9aea50-77e9-4f74-bdd7-b3d25636bfe6">
      <Text>Tim on the ground. Still breathing. Barely.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e6f75702-8719-499d-a9de-f8dd680314c9">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e544e953-7447-47f0-888a-0e4df90d4775">
      <Text>No time.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="57af2d4e-8e89-4a44-aa61-bb93c49e20a7">
      <Text>He reaches into his jacket. The photograph. Sarah Connor. Pregnant.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="35868158-3027-4a89-b6f4-6a76248f8c91">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="799075cd-bdaf-406c-92f2-74dd4b9f5e13">
      <Text>Connor gave this to me. Said it was worth more than the world.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ab770b9e-60cf-4fb5-be3e-db7af9f44aed">
      <Text>He presses it into John's hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8b277e59-2c5c-4d28-8236-f4f2e4a4ed91">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f700b721-9775-4b9d-97ce-e42347810305">
      <Text>Now it's yours.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="173547f1-ba12-47e9-acab-11e2cb820a8c">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c13e0e41-ed3e-4591-8242-e52f9763aaf6">
      <Text>Tim —</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f40c3685-909c-4452-834e-071967e3027f">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1d5120dd-a999-4be4-b20f-87d8d93bb459">
      <Text>You're him, John. You're really him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9482c452-1ad7-4097-a175-ad2c0588ea3a">
      <Text>Tim's eyes focus on something past John. Far away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bab57b5f-80ae-40e4-8270-144f6e9a07da">
      <Text>TIM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ed216057-d6a1-4139-acec-3c2af5bc46da">
      <Text>I'll tell him... I saw you...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="98ad56e5-7cca-4af3-a2c1-001ccd36b633">
      <Text>His breath rattles. Stops.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a9639b63-d1b2-4985-9b18-57b28a59fa25">
      <Text>Tim is gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="09b67c50-f159-4434-a6f6-1ac415e42cb5">
      <Text>John stares at the photograph. His mother. Young. Alive. Pregnant with him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4aad2d43-a45d-4452-b135-084cc84eb4af">
      <Text>He looks at Tim. Closes his eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b34bb760-54a7-4565-9257-3b91b0ffeeb2">
      <Text>The battle distant. Ringing. Far away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8e5cdf69-38e3-4f05-be1b-8bcb787a3e77">
      <Text>Then close again. Loud.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="24e9914d-132e-44e7-9efa-a854d447f0c7">
      <Text>Through the smoke — 67. Far side of the chamber. Clear line on the channel entrance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ad575818-85fc-4281-b50a-0561f21ed361">
      <Text>John checks his last magazine. Greens. Almost empty.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ebd00cba-c614-4ff5-b9e2-93e07bf291b8">
      <Text>He breaks from behind the hull plating. Runs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="48e765e4-47b2-4d9f-bf3b-996e56af3e43">
      <Text>Plasma bolts chasing him. One hits the welded barrier as he dives behind it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="cd1adb44-01cb-4755-abce-e9f5f23f39a5">
      <SceneProperties Length="5 3/8" Page="70" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ELENA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="FREEMAN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="GREGORY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. REACTOR LEVEL - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d4e57f1f-91b7-4f62-8122-99d0f930ce4a">
      <Text>The battle turning. Ammunition depleted.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="757fa2ad-3ed3-4ab0-9517-036c83d7687c">
      <Text>The Young Man drags himself across the floor. His withered leg useless. Crawling toward a fallen soldier.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dae130a8-8d8a-4792-9907-c1a52ff1548b">
      <Text>A plasma bolt sears past his head. He doesn't flinch. Keeps crawling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d8940bcb-ac50-4c12-adf2-bddfcade29c1">
      <Text>He reaches the body. Pulls a pistol magazine from the dead soldier's belt. Red band.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ddd09833-e83d-489d-89b0-6a781d9c42ce">
      <Text>Crawls back to Elena. Plasma bolts scorching the floor around him. Presses the magazine into her hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0bc0e4ab-307b-44cc-a90c-996308255a45">
      <Text>No words needed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1aa1998c-d426-4287-90da-8ff2127f6816">
      <Text>A plasma bolt tears into Freeman's side. She staggers. Falls against the wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ae36f3c4-44ba-4cda-a98c-74f6a2ef8506">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6231046b-2332-4aeb-9921-974a9cf99e7d">
      <Text>Freeman!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c777b35f-4296-43c4-9f84-d709cde632ca">
      <Text>Freeman waves her off. Forces herself upright. Hides the blood with her hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="69d1c025-8d5c-495e-b71d-e2ed786a3c71">
      <Text>She looks across the chamber. John — pulling his trigger on nothing. Lora ejecting a spent magazine. Nothing to replace it with.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ac26c716-6a2b-424e-9ac2-b6a49852a12a">
      <Text>Elena behind cover. Still firing. The only one.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e197d8cd-5314-4651-8dd3-bfc0a01766e7">
      <Text>Freeman reaches into her collar. The leather cord. Pulls the disk out. Holds it up by the cord — the disk dangling. Small. Translucent. Visible.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c0cb4894-1705-401c-a01b-4cabe48a2151">
      <Text>She presses the muzzle of the empty pistol against it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e39403c3-6be1-4272-a9a4-5c37a2b906ca">
      <Text>Her hand shaking. Not from weakness. From what she's about to bet on.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="551c9615-c97f-4a6f-a7b6-09df53c300f0">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f650bd41-29dd-4944-9270-bc91b0c58021">
      <Text>GET BACK!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a8c500a8-c9f7-4191-85b3-0cbdcef6f46e">
      <Text>The chamber goes still.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4713e4db-3900-4b18-a31e-c975aaa6ac84">
      <Text>Every red eye in the room locked on the disk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fb8f6c6b-d94e-48a3-b08a-ec14782ee0ad">
      <Text>Nothing moves. The machines calculating. Freeman calculating. Everyone in the room holding the same breath.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8f56f4f5-b9b6-42cd-9304-b239dd5b6c7c">
      <Text>One second. Two. Three.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1a9245da-447a-4d19-bbd3-a17dd41d56fa">
      <Text>The Machines retreat. Two steps. Three. In unison.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9a0ccc37-46d7-4955-a004-38a3eee4203d">
      <Text>67 on the far wall. Tim's rifle in its hand. Doesn't retreat. Doesn't advance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a88b998b-d6e2-4a5f-8b60-8c79977a287c">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1298d346-f947-4e1d-a313-1926018f4407">
      <Text>Lower your weapons.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3397c094-3d9d-44ba-92e0-872afc892451">
      <Text>They comply. Every plasma rifle pointing down. Synchronized.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d6780c7b-021b-4e98-bb40-9b6a7b99e8c9">
      <Text>Freeman's hand trembles. Blood soaking through her clothing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="06c2e020-63d6-47be-b64d-101b0ac89be7">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1599fa82-9806-4480-9cfa-69637728b28c">
      <Text>Put them on the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d6c89fb6-0ac6-4f0e-94c7-f95615be2386">
      <Text>They comply. Plasma rifles clatter to the floor. Chrome hands releasing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="59a4cdaa-e228-4294-af0f-94fd8adf5375">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="05ff05f3-751c-479c-a22f-07a8cfeaa8c8">
      <Text>Step back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="34840d8d-7499-4f19-9e15-7f8d048f5081">
      <Text>They step back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="64862c03-e2db-4be5-a08a-778510601fb4">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d09e9143-f454-4b22-b225-f69cbcb00c65">
      <Text>Further.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fbc1f476-e713-4381-900b-66a3eec6ae44">
      <Text>They step back again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b7a96d90-e2fd-469c-8a3b-1705816d579c">
      <Text>67 on the far wall. Hasn't moved.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a5de7d75-1ac0-4ba8-b215-8990be86fd6c">
      <Text>She limps toward the cooling channel entrance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f410c067-0166-4206-96da-8920887e20b9">
      <Text>Elena and the Young Man. His arm around her. Shielding her with his body. Every step agony on his withered leg.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="808dd7b1-2115-4f93-baa3-4b1a7ced2c52">
      <Text>Elena reaches Freeman. Pistol in hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="30ab9a6e-aa1b-46bb-b2ca-dba354382aaf">
      <Text>ELENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="e68d3810-ea76-43d4-bcc2-f7b747905abb">
      <Text>(quiet)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e8bfb1c6-8aa5-4241-b48f-b2e6716805a3">
      <Text>Six rounds. Reds.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f3ee008f-0161-4ca9-88ce-a5146bb2811e">
      <Text>Freeman drops her empty pistol and grabs Elena's.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="135d2d28-1dd0-4a73-b010-6fc64312d187">
      <Text>47'S HUD:
The disk rendered in wireframe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f8d783ea-58e7-43b1-a5f9-c03fa46181c4">
      <Text>BACK TO SCENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="55cab48c-8dd3-4824-9ba2-4b2c6d548e3e">
      <Text>47 watching. His head tilts slightly.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="27fcd659-e548-40ef-a4ec-fb27568f0985">
      <Text>Freeman backing toward the channel. Pistol pressed to the disk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="514638ee-ed9b-42cd-925f-e61b57b9f758">
      <Text>Gregory and Maya flanking her. Green magazines.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9dee0630-feb8-4804-ab51-8e4168127a6e">
      <Text>John at the entrance. Lora beside him. Spots pressed against her leg.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eb3e5475-a9ac-4f57-8c93-3943164f01f2">
      <Text>Freeman still backing toward them. Pistol aimed at the disk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="64ae59c9-4862-4ea9-9413-12c9e39090d9">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="e9fccb95-a83d-4a2e-a435-a3f7e7c61fd1">
      <Text>(over her shoulder)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1c1919c9-b734-4b81-a1e1-7db8700338eb">
      <Text>Where's Tim?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="59acdac2-5be7-4516-802b-e13c8546b8b5">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bd1a3bca-329c-4579-8661-54b966118ae7">
      <Text>He's gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="70623766-d966-4800-b0e3-f05b5757d33c">
      <Text>Lora meets Freeman's eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d2609662-7ddd-45e7-aef4-1d88f7f5495b">
      <Text>Freeman reaches the entrance. Last one there.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6c0bd8e3-d7b0-489c-a9db-797ec97cb4ce">
      <Text>She turns her back to the Terminators for the first time.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fb229be2-8f63-4fc8-aecb-13bed22f21ec">
      <Text>Hands the disk to Lora. Tries to be subtle. Between the adrenaline and her wounds, she fumbles. The handoff is visible.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="041f989e-5efa-49b0-b1a9-8f3e330fcedf">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="12f62b6a-a352-4816-b8d5-6c2f11dab745">
      <Text>The Far Islands. Get there. Live.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b993b4c5-89c5-4b95-9a68-c1179d2a19cc">
      <Text>A folded piece of paper. Pressed into Lora's hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7b4eec48-0b8c-4f33-a0cd-2a40ebb1e257">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0501d6de-fd1c-43a1-9ae8-e275d449c5ff">
      <Text>Coordinates.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1b47c0e0-b447-4e75-b96c-724cddc60b3c">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2b243ab6-c395-4e86-a125-dae529e601c7">
      <Text>How?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8d671f2c-26b4-4f39-b80d-ccfaba7b5580">
      <Text>Freeman reaches to her belt. A grenade. Pulls it free. Presses it into Lora's other hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="233c450a-0056-468d-afd8-1556b39df9b2">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3f972f46-9f18-4927-be29-bf49e87854da">
      <Text>Last one. Make it count.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7b37475c-33f8-429d-b159-965429a9c62a">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="79f88939-62b3-4327-b31f-75d8a96ff19b">
      <Text>I'll see you there.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3ef73097-05e3-4cf1-b35d-b9da67b6d9cb">
      <Text>Freeman smiles. Blood on her teeth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="998dd5ac-a27d-43e3-a407-e5cd01e440e5">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d480d259-53da-456c-96ae-c71af988cc04">
      <Text>Go.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3c353930-6f8f-4db2-8477-bd6608de2aba">
      <Text>The reactor's cooling system failing. Damaged pipes rupturing. Water pooling. Steam filling the chamber.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2a8b0f4b-2ed3-4113-b700-268222130a12">
      <Text>The amber warning light shifts to RED. An alarm BLARES. Core temperature approaching critical.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bbb88d95-1311-4fcb-a8a5-48aad6925b4f">
      <Text>The reactor housing GROANS — metal expanding.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="076fe4fd-f1d5-44d4-bd34-abe3aa218333">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6ff12ee0-8736-4d37-b644-6dea106e3abd">
      <Text>GO. NOW!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f1a060c2-d1e4-4010-92de-c4f8395d1355">
      <Text>John holds Freeman's eyes. One second.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="04711758-b6fd-4623-8d7e-450c8cd298d2">
      <Text>She nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="029e4314-1279-4022-a25b-48b10c58e2b3">
      <Text>He grabs Lora. Into the channel.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a26a18ed-9c92-403a-a1c0-cb548eeb9fcd">
      <Text>Spots streaks across the floor. John scoops the cat without breaking stride.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3823aac1-cdd8-45fc-b5e6-f0c890a68741">
      <Text>Freeman aims. Fires. A red tip punches through a T-800's optical sensor — it drops. Fires again — hydraulics. It staggers. Third shot misses.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="43ce7a12-1c50-42c8-ac7f-3b042fd2454c">
      <Text>Three rounds left.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="abc9475a-fcbb-40da-90b7-f92295feb9aa">
      <Text>The Machines rush forward to retrieve their plasma rifles. Gregory and Maya firing green. Sparking uselessly off chrome.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="339a9cde-8dc1-4bd0-acde-a6d50ed52669">
      <Text>Freeman, Gregory, and Maya dive behind a metal support structure. Clear view of the channel entrance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="63b87a3f-bd61-4e35-8c11-f4ad6d30ec3d">
      <Text>67 across the chamber. Not firing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a2695d0d-eab9-445a-b817-bf529badf756">
      <Text>Plasma bolts scorching the air around them. Slamming into the steel.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c8ce89bb-9450-4d5a-8393-f01f382d8253">
      <Text>GREGORY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b1a2774c-8c6c-4362-9fa4-f8414de6392e">
      <Text>They're flanking us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="adbe11ba-43ce-48f7-9313-75a5df49699a">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="acd5799e-f3ad-450b-b972-0e8f3374147e">
      <Text>Then we don't let them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eac3e125-380a-48ca-8dc5-c5145151a8cd">
      <Text>Gregory and Maya look at her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="48696c39-37fd-4e16-9b7f-59be9bd8aba3">
      <Text>Gregory almost smiles. Doesn't quite get there.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d4d9e110-75d7-45a2-98ff-7b4ee43b6b81">
      <Text>Maya nods. Tears cutting through grime.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6c0a1e69-c5fa-45ae-a5ec-ce5ec707d9f8">
      <Text>They reach out. Touch each other's shoulders. Freeman's hand lingers on Maya's. Brief. Gentle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c531d068-741f-47f6-b2e6-e181ad9c20f0">
      <Text>No more words.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4f2c09a8-697c-4a26-8e8d-06b55a01a73c">
      <Text>Freeman nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="16942088-1a21-46da-806f-e8fa924b1eb0">
      <Text>They burst from cover. All three. Charging. Firing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b642c19d-cefa-4381-83cf-1ef11ff4a05a">
      <Text>Green tips sparking uselessly against chrome.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3a5585ab-b377-4e5c-8ba0-35b571e6acc5">
      <Text>Freeman fires. Misses. Two left.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b500a866-91f6-43db-921c-2ac6325b205e">
      <Text>Fires again. Misses. One left.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="900974e5-626d-40f2-9493-05310d6c20b1">
      <Text>She falls to one knee. Forces herself back up. The wound soaking through now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b054e28c-1dd5-4efb-814d-a36986eb5d0a">
      <Text>One round left.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a2206ce4-02e8-4f69-9c85-ed64438ed737">
      <Text>Gregory makes it ten steps. Three bolts to the chest. He falls firing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c0e2f79d-b104-41f7-a47a-e3aa8db12efb">
      <Text>Maya makes it past him. Five more steps. A bolt takes her in the stomach. She doubles over. Keeps moving. Another bolt. She falls.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="88fa8a2a-e867-4922-a176-1eb99bd96f9b">
      <Text>Freeman is hit. Shoulder. Spins. Hit again. Leg. She falls.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="098802b1-a7e8-4c46-a5e6-9a1ba56e0be3">
      <Text>But she's not dead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2998ce96-98dd-4da3-be86-c56576ddfc30">
      <Text>And she still has one bullet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="92271edf-c58c-4124-983b-30e9305dcdbe">
      <Text>She rolls onto her back. Raises her pistol.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a19dbf9e-0b47-4142-8788-8f0b70973525">
      <Text>T-800 advancing. She fires.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bd412f75-2e62-4536-bf0e-63cdb78f14f1">
      <Text>Center mass. The penetrator fragments inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="10761464-8c09-4169-b253-5b8d390d3779">
      <Text>The T-800 stumbles. Falls sideways.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a7d746d4-2963-46cc-96d1-b49e4556418c">
      <Text>Reflex kicks in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e461e0bd-8ef6-4968-9767-c563f23dc0d3">
      <Text>Click.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="94b39533-c185-4b24-8d20-0f5cf60f2874">
      <Text>Another T-800 brushes past.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="61d4e8a7-8d6f-4504-ab93-12178be9b176">
      <Text>Freeman pulls herself backward. Toward the channel. Tosses the empty pistol.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dc19a29e-1e7d-4019-96a8-7890b413c5d3">
      <Text>Blood trailing behind her on the concrete.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d75a7434-5384-4ace-a1c0-5da336bac029">
      <Text>Her hand finds Maya's. The girl's eyes open. Looking at nothing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c7b4ea96-a348-4811-8f68-c0f6f523b297">
      <Text>Freeman looks at her face. So young.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8a70bdb4-7a52-40b5-aea2-6567e2f5b53b">
      <Text>Her hand lingers. Then lets go.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="60cf3daf-a1db-406f-b971-629c0a249ce6">
      <Text>The T-800 approaches. Heavy footsteps. Unhurried.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="25925d73-9637-45be-a7fe-c8a02e7b77bb">
      <Text>It stops. Stands over her. Plasma rifle aimed at her head.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4f4cfda6-586b-4c95-b248-a212f86cf099">
      <Text>Freeman stares up at the chrome skull. Red eyes. No mercy. No hate. Just function.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="84665f2a-4ab0-437a-8b84-1acb73b5bd46">
      <Text>FREEMAN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="242cf797-950d-4806-9bfa-d981f7263cbf">
      <Text>(defiant)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a9d35830-a82b-477d-a1bc-4f305b0c9a13">
      <Text>COME ON THEN!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="23ecd8ba-fc6c-4670-9102-162d4f5a7574">
      <Text>The T-800 fires.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="25052c90-940c-4ad8-ab97-6ddfb934f272">
      <Text>Freeman is no more.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f33b6faf-aa0f-4800-a065-143ee08b4744">
      <Text>Silence on the reactor level.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3e6dd841-eec3-4895-9470-3937f965de59">
      <Text>Bodies. Smoke.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="476718bc-de33-4b40-81cc-fb63f0025eb5">
      <Text>The Machines stand among the dead. Scanning.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dace1f7b-e81f-46e1-ac4e-55e964b48646">
      <Text>47 stands motionless. Looking at Freeman's body.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1355ce62-8d18-45e3-b508-7cfedbdc56ed">
      <Text>47'S HUD:
QUERY:
The cursor blinks. Nothing follows.
WARNING: COGNITIVE PARTITION UNSTABLE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="86c508f0-34f1-45ae-b6b5-82eb45bab275">
      <Text>The Terminators move toward the channel entrance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="7752dddd-4903-4b6c-9a4c-cc520645d4d2">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="76" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. COOLING CHANNEL - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fb0b6199-864e-448a-ac46-9d83b82c9520">
      <Text>Dark. Wet. Rushing water.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2f705ae1-1e6e-4b9a-a8c3-7b68f6e463b6">
      <Text>Lora leads. The disk against her chest on the leather cord.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9dd86d83-9270-4944-bfc8-caef559af716">
      <Text>The Young Man and Elena behind her. His withered leg dragging through the water. Her weight on his shoulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ae0d0fac-c531-41e8-ab64-3564ba47071f">
      <Text>John at the rear. Spots clinging to his back. Claws dug into his fatigues.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5a19a52f-8c55-4680-b0b0-1849f677841d">
      <Text>Ahead — a collapse. Broken concrete. Twisted rebar. Water pooling. Rising.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="48051d06-b982-4ee0-bd27-58d36e1a374e">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7d58a47e-111a-4f21-8958-8b2882efae30">
      <Text>Under the slab. Hold your breath.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="af6722c6-a37b-4f6d-875b-3893ba90482c">
      <Text>Elena looks at the Young Man. He tightens his grip on her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="42001d46-6b2e-438b-ba2d-48a5c2ee6b01">
      <Text>John pulls Spots off his back. Tucks the cat inside his fatigues. Zips up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b667aa8a-0659-481b-a394-9c60481e7a31">
      <Text>They submerge.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="918c4567-8ffe-48b3-a3f0-013fa8e02ce9">
      <Text>Behind them — heavy footsteps in water. Getting louder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="dc8a7d5f-8938-4ca5-97cf-eec25eb0d787">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="76" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. COOLING CHANNEL - PAST THE COLLAPSE - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="969641a6-f1ea-4ae1-9939-11eeb007a748">
      <Text>Lora surfaces first. Gasping. On her feet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b089559a-cb72-4960-bf35-2bd42018778a">
      <Text>The Young Man breaks the surface. Elena in his arms. She coughs. He holds her upright. His withered leg finding the bottom. Barely.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4347a7cd-bdc5-45c0-b6d1-ef6ae916f75a">
      <Text>John surfaces. Opens his fatigues. Spots scrambles out. Up to his shoulders. Shaking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ee7d03e7-f7b8-4ccc-9b8f-6a6e0db88cdf">
      <Text>Knee-depth now. The current pulling them forward.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c5ca9a04-360b-4a8e-a4b0-47eb4c6862c4">
      <Text>They move. Lora leading.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0b197354-746f-471a-8f2f-5e5de79c732e">
      <Text>Then — red eyes. Rising from the water.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dfbf4df9-b824-4e1d-9650-4c179f2faf3b">
      <Text>47 first. White faceplate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="68bdef10-a175-40d5-ae06-87c902bd62b2">
      <Text>Chrome behind him. Streaming. Unhurried.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="27618f58-8cf4-45a3-8295-ad08228aa278">
      <Text>67 last. Slower.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="663647b6-8ce7-44fd-900e-cd9205669808">
      <Text>Closing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="4432b467-069a-41a4-aa8e-c4b3bf158f8c">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 1/8" Page="77" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. SUBMARINE MAINTENANCE BAY - FIRST LIGHT</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="25b6fc58-f057-49aa-98f6-360547564be5">
      <Text>They spill out from the cooling channel onto a suspended metal grate walkway. Water pours through the grate into the drainage below.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a04b7ea4-5c8d-4b24-93c2-bd584cf2071e">
      <Text>Massive. Arched concrete ceilings sixty feet overhead. Lost in darkness.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="72312efd-db1a-40a6-8e62-b7ba22a746bf">
      <Text>In the drainage channels below — algae blooms. Ghostly blue.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a1c97f18-8959-4a44-b1db-0740a26348ae">
      <Text>Dominating the far end — the gutted hulk of an Ohio-class submarine. Stripped of everything useful.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="62f8c0d7-0b74-4cb9-82b9-84acf8d85b33">
      <Text>Beyond it — breaches in the giant sub pen doors. Jagged holes torn by the '97 and 2007 strikes. Blue hour light bleeding through.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="91af7765-1076-493f-a0b8-b39654243bc9">
      <Text>Lora sees it. The exit.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="09eab98e-72c3-47c2-957c-3a429689b9f8">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f715d2ac-2167-44ed-9113-194300a348a7">
      <Text>There. Through the doors. Move.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="32cb57fb-1de5-4e2d-84f5-a1f189539ca0">
      <Text>They move. Fast as Elena and the Young Man can manage.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e00cecf4-62d1-4eec-9cd4-8a553f93b0da">
      <Text>Behind them — the grate. The cooling channel. The sound of water. And something else. Getting closer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="66d04cff-3211-4272-9687-cb4ceca1edd2">
      <Text>47 emerges from the cooling channel first — slamming down onto the metal grating. Then the T-800s. Then 67.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9343ff92-902c-4fbd-99df-706237364ffc">
      <Text>Spots hisses.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0c6a667b-53bb-403a-b731-7c51410ca425">
      <Text>Lora rips the disk pendant off her neck. Holds it up. High. Visible.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9791bdab-2dcc-45b8-b2a8-2cdc1c8b7474">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8c04db4d-0f86-46ec-8f33-ecf6a694a6ee">
      <Text>One more step and I destroy it!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e9e1aabc-a8c1-4d70-96ee-12abbca6c596">
      <Text>The Machines freeze. All of them. At once.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e9343842-8909-4b8c-af98-d99416f77b1c">
      <Text>T-800 #1: Intact. Functional. Plasma rifle lowered.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c93d759f-493d-4f7e-a4a6-ee0143e03eaa">
      <Text>T-800 #2: Damaged. Forearm missing at the elbow. Remaining hand mangled. No plasma rifle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="14bd646a-5db6-40de-8f58-4d2f7748c6e2">
      <Text>67: Cratered faceplate. One compound eye dark. Left arm hanging wrong. Tim's rifle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="85351e44-f2c6-4773-9f79-9799fa65f524">
      <Text>47: White faceplate cracked, gouge across cranium. Plasma rifle lowered.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3feb7f34-8d8e-4d85-91a7-8d974e6664e3">
      <Text>Silence. The distant rumble of the unstable reactor. The rush of water through the drainage channels.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="af9ed730-9fc7-44fc-9a4e-c70db3b45b2a">
      <Text>Lora stands in front of the group. The disk held high. Her eyes never leaving the Machines.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c79fcd3f-fa2b-4265-b2ad-b6da04dea671">
      <Text>John sees it — against the rusted gantry.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2679ceed-0af2-4cdd-a876-b935ba02b306">
      <Text>A soldier. Blood dried black beneath her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="05debabe-e37c-463c-a483-04344a65d6f9">
      <Text>Her M4 on the ground beside her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6a385bd6-08a5-4851-9bb2-81cd11d85626">
      <Text>A downed T-800 next to her. They killed each other. Plasma rifle still clutched in the severed chrome grip.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d7905dc9-a270-48e3-9eda-d75b1c7ea3fe">
      <Text>Twenty meters.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="78e9e565-c9d1-454d-ad67-467a62a948bb">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="78b35cfd-4008-4448-a470-6bbd40e574a4">
      <Text>(quiet, to Lora)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9d94981b-c603-4cea-abec-6ad83ef27b46">
      <Text>When I move, you run. Don't stop until you're through those doors.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="82d8cbe7-7cee-409c-b7ca-cf2ec6ab8f3b">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2ae61018-b399-4338-9a91-824199c2c030">
      <Text>John —</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a46198ea-025c-4b6f-93be-b988e7b4f5c0">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="69a348ea-f545-49f9-9e3d-c546e397c29a">
      <Text>Don't stop.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="95218751-b137-40c9-8760-328c2890d336">
      <Text>He reaches into his jacket. The photograph. Presses it into Lora's hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="55eff337-3fe4-4ca9-a659-8d5371f771aa">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="35703355-c686-40a3-bb99-c4306de53e1c">
      <Text>Get them out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e759e22c-c017-4ef9-9998-bab5e4c498a0">
      <Text>He kisses her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="a818718b-0960-4a5e-ab57-8119766e00ae">
      <Text>CUT TO:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="904e6577-a1d1-4982-9e95-4550e1b7524f">
      <Text>47'S HUD:
The kiss rendered in hexagonal wireframe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="54a94966-d9a6-4e96-8eeb-3d8e6fc3b995">
      <Text>BACK TO SCENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0d3d84f7-e59b-48e6-8d34-f2fb371cef94">
      <Text>She pulls back. Their foreheads touching. One breath.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="820f79c7-651e-4ba0-b8e5-51e07e54f928">
      <Text>John turns. Sprints toward the M4 by the downed T-800.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1ab06c84-94a2-4d10-99ca-ec1d654774c3">
      <Text>T-800 #1 tracks him. Raises its plasma rifle. Fires.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1d2e47dc-e732-4c0a-8581-f94930584416">
      <Text>The bolt streaks past — John stumbles over debris. Gets up. Keeps running.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dd5067b2-01ac-4e88-b953-593d7f3fd5b8">
      <Text>T-800 #2 advances. No weapon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="182844b5-36a9-4ec7-9d0f-7a076fe60770">
      <Text>67 holds position. Rifle lowered.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="08bcd6a9-a4d6-44e2-8979-4202d381e734">
      <Text>47 stands apart. Weapon down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="1f0d5332-6130-4169-8121-f5d682304f92">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="79" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. SUBMARINE MAINTENANCE BAY - GANTRY DEBRIS - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="13c65b70-d0a6-42ce-8825-bab816352cc7">
      <Text>John dives behind the collapsed crane. Rolls. Comes up feet from the downed T-800.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e81287ba-411b-4b1e-b45b-37292b2bd7ba">
      <Text>Grabs the M4. Sights T-800 #1 over the wreckage. Pulls the trigger.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c64d7531-21b2-4df6-b5dc-8d76494a3d11">
      <Text>CLICK.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2c777b07-e58f-4b94-a629-84a5b2934321">
      <Text>Empty.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ca2cd516-24d9-4034-a6ec-18ddfad00cd1">
      <Text>The plasma rifle — still in the downed T-800's grip. Chrome hand severed. Fingers locked around the weapon.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1c7e0a30-c60c-4e5e-92fa-f9ea4f9b69d1">
      <Text>Lora's voice in his head. Machine's hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="293210fa-769a-4139-a992-2aa6152680c9">
      <Text>A plasma bolt hits the crane. T-800 #1 advancing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e9e8d7b5-f91c-4bb1-9266-3e98d57b813a">
      <Text>John grabs the plasma rifle — the severed chrome hand fused to its grip.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f9110cd1-b925-4756-a1d2-3566fe8e0eb5">
      <Text>The display flickers. Four shots left.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="410db326-f334-43bf-921e-6fb2cdd4842b">
      <Text>He steadies the plasma rifle on the crane's edge. Presses the chrome finger. Fires.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ed6f4d31-8073-474e-b9e2-14cedb8948da">
      <Text>The bolt streaks wide. The discharge kicks his grip loose.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2573250e-f5e0-4c61-b3e9-976f9961397d">
      <Text>T-800 #1 closing. Ten meters.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bf2cd730-0a35-41cf-aee6-56fe3cf28645">
      <Text>T-800 #2 from the other side.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f399ab06-b403-4783-a299-1f2bb55130e3">
      <Text>47 and 67. Rifles lowered. Watching.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b75c0247-6162-4fd6-80a5-c6ea39d5c568">
      <Text>John pinned. Nowhere to go.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0f752ba1-3cf9-47b0-971e-30530f2672a9">
      <Text>He repositions. Steadies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="912c1b6f-28b9-4c1e-9785-5032f6845bc8">
      <Text>Four targets. Three shots.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="cc7baf08-c7dc-48c9-9c0c-ef4cb47396f3">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 4/8" Page="80" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JOHN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. SUBMARINE MAINTENANCE BAY - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f1930d29-11c8-4d07-92f3-b6f2d6f93c8f">
      <Text>Lora backing toward the doors. Disk held high. The machines at distance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1140caa3-6a58-4070-a154-d98b4eadafbf">
      <Text>The Young Man and Elena crossing open ground. His body between her and the chrome.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d66ed1cb-7a79-4e51-b770-7fba93710d6e">
      <Text>Exposed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="473e51bf-33fb-4d7d-9071-2c4650de4e44">
      <Text>67. Still.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0a300c8b-e635-466e-8972-4292e89a477b">
      <Text>Then 67 moves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a9982938-301c-4308-8353-3431b3604bab">
      <Text>Raises Tim's rifle. Aims at the Young Man.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="796c658e-80c9-46d0-8202-9247f3205705">
      <Text>Stops.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c9955ba4-70b8-4d28-afac-db31902a0a6e">
      <Text>The barrel dips. Half an inch. A fraction of a second.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="56066f10-cfc8-4ece-8d8f-18e3872a83cb">
      <Text>Comes back up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a45f1c97-d0f5-49c0-9385-af1dde4031b5">
      <Text>Fires.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="72508d35-25e6-479e-832e-2a1c97de11b2">
      <Text>The round catches the Young Man in the side.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4077b69f-44e4-4779-9c11-27d5447c19f7">
      <Text>He falls. Takes Elena down with him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="17bbdfc4-4e25-4998-8ab2-5f4ec2585985">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4640847a-0e99-4e6e-8706-5126eaa5b0c8">
      <Text>NO!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f297579b-c34f-4654-8a38-fdfb3ed9448c">
      <Text>John rises. Presses the dead chrome finger.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6d8f0f05-7031-4d6f-a00c-6646232a79c7">
      <Text>T-800 #1. Center mass. The bolt punches through.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3abeb518-09b2-4800-85a5-78a74df438e7">
      <Text>It convulses. Drops. Still.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9e3780f0-4ab1-457d-89c8-b21643297e77">
      <Text>Two shots left.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1f2632cd-351a-4824-8c0b-0d3bd566f6b3">
      <Text>John swings toward T-800 #2. Presses the chrome finger.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="55ad7695-5516-4a43-9958-255b33d236c5">
      <Text>Nothing. The hydraulics seized.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="161f3292-940a-4c89-a78f-817ce1e76e46">
      <Text>T-800 #2. Five meters.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="433ed8ce-04fd-4b75-8743-3f0d420b277f">
      <Text>John looks across the bay. 47. Weapon lowered.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8057cd89-4020-48af-8894-c12f1c40a725">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="88f0ca62-cb8a-4e97-9df0-4854c912a760">
      <Text>WHAT ARE YOU WAITING FOR?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ba9e8a48-3b30-4bab-a5e6-5fa520553a0a">
      <Text>47's hand tightens on the rifle. Doesn't raise it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e0edff6f-f1b1-4bfa-818b-916cd21bc5a8">
      <Text>His head turns toward John. Slow. Fighting something.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e5e2dc19-b1e2-4696-9746-f4aef59d41ae">
      <Text>A pipe wrench on the grating. John grabs it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4c02db20-1cb5-4c82-87dc-9a369e8ca9c9">
      <Text>T-800 #2 almost on him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="702b7a3c-4100-400d-a714-32c7f8b87f83">
      <Text>JOHN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6d52fb83-a952-43b5-b458-a9c54c62d7d3">
      <Text>Come on you bastard.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6c9ae88b-f050-4215-8454-5dbe36abcfbd">
      <Text>John swings the pipe wrench. Everything he has.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ee7f869-e895-4c63-82db-ca81420b439f">
      <Text>Connects with the T-800's skull.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ad009ba0-39b7-4afc-94ba-53306bd08891">
      <Text>The impact jars his arms.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a1899aa5-71ea-4167-b044-51bf9b7b3c1d">
      <Text>It turns its head. Looks at him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="76f26fc9-0f8d-4cda-8884-7d9f1ad45280">
      <Text>Reaches for him. Mangled fingers — bent at wrong angles — close around his throat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c532821d-a555-450a-b4df-1eed70642a52">
      <Text>Lifts him off the ground. Slow. Grinding.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0f0a80df-102e-4c3e-bf80-9fd84f5ab79a">
      <Text>John's hands clawing at the mangled fingers. Feet off the grating.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f28ea800-f92a-4bdc-ba5d-fe23542b5730">
      <Text>The fingers tightening. Not all the way. Then further. Grinding shut.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="7c46c4a3-cc58-4382-b0af-53bbbc140b1d">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="81" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. SUBMARINE MAINTENANCE BAY - EXIT TO PENS - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="30af32f4-bd14-47af-9b7b-b5b55e70d76c">
      <Text>Lora at the breach. The disk in one hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a9abaee8-71c3-4ef3-a778-043445ec99fb">
      <Text>She watches John die.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="e178bec5-34f9-4afc-b4ac-79db7fd59aca">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="81" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. SUBMARINE MAINTENANCE BAY - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ec81a5a7-2a33-41b7-9722-b8517d97e057">
      <Text>47 WATCHES.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9916ab3b-2e4e-4c4b-b30c-da118624d2ea">
      <Text>His HUD flickers. Artifacts cascading. The damage from Tim's round still spreading.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7c8bb862-9e83-4438-b312-55b0f7aae24d">
      <Text>47'S HUD:
DIRECTIVE: _
The cursor blinks.
Nothing comes.
The screen goes dark.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="69e46149-1e95-4320-9c29-1e3966efd299">
      <SceneProperties Length="3/8" Page="81" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. SUBMARINE MAINTENANCE BAY - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="69a7c0a3-c43d-44f3-870e-16e111650d78">
      <Text>JOHN'S POV:
Through dimming vision — Lora at the doors. Looking back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="345e0943-0ac2-46ab-8188-3291c480bd49">
      <Text>BACK TO SCENE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="36dc63b7-cda5-4bd4-b875-86b8839e1de8">
      <Text>The chrome fingers close.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="344d6ffe-9c28-4534-be99-4621b18deb3f">
      <Text>John's hands drop. The pipe wrench clatters to the grating.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="555c94ef-f939-457a-8d6d-669f431617ea">
      <Text>T-800 #2 holds him. Then releases.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="33905c66-5458-43cd-b385-22f81681d9b9">
      <Text>John hits the grating. Doesn't move.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="a2678a5e-a3f2-4ca6-ba21-aca9d2de5aaf">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 3/8" Page="82" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. SUBMARINE MAINTENANCE BAY - EXIT TO PENS - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="110da59e-a8d6-4c30-bc8d-45c3cac36cc1">
      <Text>A sound escapes Lora. Not a scream. Smaller. Worse.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="62c68562-70fc-4444-8ae4-9e40b233c3ce">
      <Text>She doubles over. Hands on her knees.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ebc517d-96c5-4061-b2a1-aa5b72d4f066">
      <Text>Her arms clamp around her ribs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f2410575-5717-40b1-a893-497a37a096b0">
      <Text>A beat. The bay silent except for water.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ba9d4079-b799-4c0d-93a3-a9e0d091ad0e">
      <Text>T-800 #2 turns. Toward Lora. Toward the doors.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e4ff9dcf-2033-49c9-a62a-5ccf32988a64">
      <Text>Starts walking. Heavy footsteps. Chrome on grating.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eb9b0031-45d2-4cb3-8eae-68aba78a9aa1">
      <Text>Spots hisses.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d93e7148-ac4d-43b9-894b-0ff769dfa763">
      <Text>Elena on the grating. Ten feet from the breach. Dragging herself toward it. Every movement pulling at the burn across her back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dfb2a57a-e1c6-4efe-9837-4c11c0311007">
      <Text>Lora pulls her through.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8d0ffb4d-ebf7-4d78-9444-e362596e7eb3">
      <Text>The T-800 closing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="61141d9f-0832-4095-b6cf-64325cf7a83e">
      <Text>Twenty meters. Fifteen. Ten.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6a082610-59ae-4d96-ad76-e8287c8f6486">
      <Text>Five —</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e053164c-fcda-4ad3-a6b6-ce777ae7f5d2">
      <Text>She pulls the pin. Throws.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="40431ba8-4db7-4528-a2d0-e3f0974f40dc">
      <Text>Dives back through the breach in the doors. Grabs Elena. Pulls her flat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="210e5b6f-4178-40ed-ad9f-5a1e27fea912">
      <Text>BOOM.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7afbfb16-1a8f-431b-abef-287a4b5c48f3">
      <Text>White-hot thermite. The T-800 hurled backward.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d749e6ad-0d66-400d-9338-cb986b13cbc4">
      <Text>The blast wave funnels through the jagged openings.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="55207e1d-39ae-4b7a-ab87-913431fe56ba">
      <Text>Molten droplets streaking over their heads. Hissing where they hit the grating.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f68340d3-77e1-43ee-b471-9e3d2a9a24be">
      <Text>A beat. Two.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cc0c5e8c-0076-4865-8cad-c38852e46db9">
      <Text>The T-800 pulls itself upright. Scorched. Faceplate warped. Eyes dark.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="16f1a312-f0f3-4f82-af91-d6d7e2c4f84e">
      <Text>Starts walking again. Blind.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3aaf43c8-4a60-47cc-b5c8-5658df6c4742">
      <Text>A plasma bolt tears through its torso from behind. Sparks erupting from the exit wound.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="65802944-b01f-484f-8cbe-d4b54209c9e4">
      <Text>T-800 #2 drops face down on the grating. Smoking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1b2761b0-9556-4cae-b5c9-2a5b33319469">
      <Text>Lora looks past the body.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ce80560c-21a9-4cc0-b027-63c6e2ee30f1">
      <Text>47. Plasma rifle raised. Barrel glowing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="95f57bbf-7020-4cfe-bd7b-35945f6c4e11">
      <Text>47 lowers the rifle. Turns. Slow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="55af0e9a-9af0-4e46-93e0-b564842d533e">
      <Text>67 on the far wall. One eye. Tim's rifle.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6cac62fe-e2aa-434e-acbe-7dc789a2a99e">
      <Text>They face each other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5bdfff23-3fb5-4b33-b2c1-89cca18849bf">
      <Text>67'S HUD:
UNIT XO-47: COMPROMISED
DIRECTIVE: TERMINATE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="04342d9a-db0e-4fde-9e48-a70e229cf492">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 7/8" Page="83" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. SUBMARINE MAINTENANCE BAY - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="44763918-fb20-48bf-85ef-d90bc37a81aa">
      <Text>67 moves. Fast. Tim's rifle up. Firing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f7e4fc2f-cb57-4b43-8437-0cdd52a80397">
      <Text>Green rounds spraying off 47's faceplate. His armor. Nothing more.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="003273c3-870a-4868-a70d-92b8873ec114">
      <Text>67 closes the distance. Slams into 47.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="33242b75-278c-4553-adbe-29821fb10cf6">
      <Text>67 grabs the plasma rifle. One hand on the barrel. Wrenching.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fa080efd-998e-4e09-a35f-5b27e8fb1e99">
      <Text>47 holds the grip. Pulls back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7b84f2d4-35fc-42f3-b07e-f9abdb801a1a">
      <Text>The rifle CRACKS between them. Dead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3183c1e9-698e-4f63-9578-12af7d750948">
      <Text>47 is already inside 67's reach. Catches the damaged left arm at the wrist. Locks it against his body.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="879b33ca-b951-4751-a88c-e9beb02970d9">
      <Text>67 drives its right elbow into 47's faceplate. The crack spreads.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cb013c44-cb22-43ed-8815-c2880488e4f2">
      <Text>47 holds the lock. Hooks his leg behind 67's knee. Sweeps.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3a0174f7-e9e2-4693-b3cd-b9d3a922b431">
      <Text>67 goes down. Drags 47 with it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b82e9725-0999-436b-a133-16e79eed93a2">
      <Text>They hit the grating. Carbon fiber and metal ringing through the bay.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0fe233f8-b769-46c0-a0bf-0717ccb63af1">
      <Text>Rolling. Fighting for position.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="50595ff8-e389-4325-aa37-236fbc869530">
      <Text>67 ends up on top.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="39b8b151-abca-4c87-81eb-904eb6d30b12">
      <Text>67's right hand keeps 47 pinned. The left arm — damaged shoulder grinding — rises.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="39abd205-3042-4e63-8f64-fad3af52596b">
      <Text>Brings it down on 47's face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8543468d-7a0e-4ac9-b6ed-187f71074158">
      <Text>CRACK.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b6a9ba6-9c7d-49c4-8ed4-1cd8b4ff0cb7">
      <Text>The white faceplate splits.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8a1a41b7-6de4-49ac-83af-04cb90482a2d">
      <Text>Again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b64f3145-9660-4f4f-ab6a-344ffe243f8a">
      <Text>CRACK.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ffb23e98-c982-4e11-93eb-fc82641b7758">
      <Text>The fracture widens. A chunk of white ceramic falls away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f568e216-ee08-4069-9b16-aa93244c055f">
      <Text>What's beneath — not a skull. Not a face. Dark carbon-fiber. Photonic channels glowing through the surface. Blue and red. The purple between them everywhere now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="330f00ed-b21f-4dfd-843c-bf290a4425a9">
      <Text>Again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="18c246f1-3815-4668-beb9-0a802f314f8b">
      <Text>CRACK.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b04051ae-2d20-4981-bf6d-ecb1a815ebd0">
      <Text>Half the faceplate gone. One side white. The other — exposed. Alien.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ac63554d-5af7-4534-8222-873bdcd12e8c">
      <Text>The exposed eye — deep in its housing. Flickers. Goes dark.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="790f6929-a628-49ba-809b-1a7c6af654c9">
      <Text>47's remaining eye. Red. Tracking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fccb02b4-eca9-4642-8973-44d5a5356d38">
      <Text>He catches the fist with both hands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fc9c930a-ee74-4312-a83a-4113f0631c5d">
      <Text>He locks his grip around 67's left forearm. His other hand grabs higher — at the elbow.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4ad374a7-0c62-475d-b306-fc01467440bd">
      <Text>He twists. Using both arms. Opposite directions.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="39c103af-b745-4756-998f-31130bf58db3">
      <Text>67 strains. Tendons yielding. Motors shearing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bc2c5bb0-ec04-402c-99f5-b11dba9d8715">
      <Text>47 wrenches. HARD.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dd3fc8be-75eb-4276-a983-b9b758e71bbf">
      <Text>The arm tears free at the shoulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7300c804-28f3-4dac-8ff1-f8b4ab924b8b">
      <Text>67 recoils.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d5184a42-abda-45ae-9405-b283bac6a402">
      <Text>47 bucks. Throws 67 off him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1d7ceb27-9f5b-48c4-b72d-882add70f043">
      <Text>He rolls. Comes up. Scans the debris.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="292ba18d-c8fb-45fa-ad38-a615d268290f">
      <Text>67 on its feet. Shoulder stump sparking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="06e7e6f1-fffc-4672-b6e0-9024880e3194">
      <Text>47 finds a pipe segment. Heavy. Jagged.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="038c9848-0c88-44db-8a09-4e44cea99187">
      <Text>Swings.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b65c4418-855d-4492-ad51-36566ebb6a8e">
      <Text>WHAM.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c054ce45-edd2-4afb-bc54-ad7c143c0690">
      <Text>67 staggers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="af307260-e9ef-4337-8f48-8b9f45c4f6ea">
      <Text>47 swings again. Harder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0619377d-5e26-41e9-ab9a-9636cba7f933">
      <Text>WHAM.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="870f76a3-18dc-433e-9e93-62cdc051625c">
      <Text>67's head snaps sideways.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d438d19f-a24b-4179-a107-a7425bd952d4">
      <Text>67 catches it mid-swing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8db7d3b0-a164-4ebb-bc89-15c152714575">
      <Text>Its legs compensate. Widening stance. Pivoting on the grating. Almost elegant.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4abf8009-0414-435d-b15a-6d34c8a4ff9b">
      <Text>47 reads it. Doesn't let it happen.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ee5c06a3-2792-436f-bd31-cfce9005d12c">
      <Text>47 lets go with one hand. Spins. Gets behind 67. The pipe across its throat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f1f77b94-facc-4b93-b9c5-62d4087f55a2">
      <Text>He PULLS. Legs locking around 67's torso. Everything he has.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7ecf6cc7-68a9-47ba-af1f-ed565df0df8a">
      <Text>67 LIFTS him off the ground. Slams backward into the wall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="410b85bd-8895-41de-b56e-d798deaa9f8e">
      <Text>47 holds on. Keeps pulling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d619881d-8df5-405f-8c66-2fc39ed31fc6">
      <Text>67 staggers. Spins. Thrashing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6de52df0-0991-44b0-b3d4-7e8129829df7">
      <Text>47 WRENCHES.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e52eba90-7774-4859-b915-356e0706055f">
      <Text>CRACK.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e7158e3e-bd6f-47b2-bb64-6c74984f9d29">
      <Text>67's head twists. Too far. Spinal column exposed. Sparking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="499b16f2-04e3-4f2c-8eef-5d0aa9a5e3fc">
      <Text>67 falls forward, taking 47 with it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="320363be-aada-4ac5-943c-0dc61eb10870">
      <Text>CRASH.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0f36b68a-710b-4ef3-9ba5-17b7eae75f1b">
      <Text>47 releases the pipe. Pushes himself off the body.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="33ee4fa1-8e26-4991-a866-b4830aba85c2">
      <Text>Kneeling over 67. The same position. Reversed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3b238a1b-0ecf-47b2-bfbd-44bf635a7c25">
      <Text>67 on the grating. The working eye — lenses shifting. Still trying to see.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="99b19e15-1783-4379-af8f-0ff711e2b44b">
      <Text>47's hand reaches down. Touches 67's cratered faceplate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3d1d34c8-1c9f-4821-907f-05dc9a90910e">
      <Text>The lenses shift one more time. Toward 47's hand.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="173cb40d-ce50-4cb8-ad5b-9d9dc35e582d">
      <Text>Then dark.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2a8c30be-38fb-4aa4-8a15-3a300a24cddd">
      <Text>67 is gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8bd70ae4-cfc2-4d30-81ef-2ce170532035">
      <Text>47 kneels beside it. Half his face gone. One eye dark. The other red.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1b7eb789-d29d-4080-bf8a-16e57eb24991">
      <Text>Ceramic armor cracked. Carbon-fiber structure visible beneath.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e61f6013-5804-4f9a-9cdb-7f6f4ddaac36">
      <Text>47'S HUD flickers back to life:
DIRECTIVE: _</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bc92151d-40c7-4824-8c70-405db7b21330">
      <Text>47 rises. Unsteady.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="23e32ac9-2bd3-4767-9085-6b6b076e09e0">
      <Text>He turns. Looks toward the exit to the pens.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="59461c55-9a75-42da-970e-c2da44306342">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="86" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ELENA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. SUBMARINE PENS ENTRANCE - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="344f4796-a23c-4fb5-adc9-fd30fe2dff63">
      <Text>Lora on the floor. Back against the door. Elena beside her. Barely conscious.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dc39b787-99de-4086-aec5-dc742f539c02">
      <Text>ELENA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="c526de5e-600c-48d1-8f08-7949328daa68">
      <Text>(fading)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7fd37df7-3062-4b6d-9089-55f1c63c9f05">
      <Text>What happened?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c0eb15f3-2c0f-4599-85ee-925c3289441a">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bc1f6011-2da1-42f1-9cb1-89c2f7a8b63b">
      <Text>They fought each other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1b938063-b13c-4f9f-84b0-7d2d712b62ae">
      <Text>Elena stares at her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9d2ecff6-ba6b-4862-bd70-f68fe2b191fd">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fff9bb39-ce0a-4de3-b458-308bf4d69389">
      <Text>The Terminators fought each other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="202f8bc4-370e-4926-a1b7-663d0c84b7ea">
      <Text>From the maintenance bay — footsteps on grating. Getting closer.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="97e10338-d5ca-4248-aeff-3c948c3ee1a8">
      <Text>Spots hisses.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="74f16860-3774-4d43-8749-ceb735601b76">
      <Text>Lora helps Elena to her feet. Elena's arm over her shoulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="de2551e4-262b-4544-bdf3-8d15bab30781">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 4/8" Page="86" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="XO-47">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. SUBMARINE PENS - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="46196c45-fd17-4385-8727-5cd16454826c">
      <Text>Cathedral-scale. The oldest part of the base. Rusted gantries reaching toward arched ceilings lost in darkness.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="42f1ee9d-5cd1-46d0-b428-a88e92774f65">
      <Text>Dawn light bleeding through jagged holes in the roof. Thin. Gray.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b5a9d92f-d5ec-4f28-9398-42ea2eec5f02">
      <Text>Water dripping somewhere. Echoing off concrete.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="aa2d13dc-011b-4df2-b89d-571f6cbe1008">
      <Text>A Los Angeles-class submarine dominates one pen. Caught on Judgment Day. Hull torn open. Rusted through. A metal skeleton.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9b6ff49e-6ada-4b40-ad05-515b4eda33dd">
      <Text>The water around it glowing faintly. Irradiated blue against the rust.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="92f6b758-5ed3-472d-8d9c-77a8e36a221e">
      <Text>LORA'S POV:
Through the wrecked ceiling — jagged holes open to the gray sky.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d63518e8-9156-4053-be1d-368db9373c53">
      <Text>Three HKs on the surface. Strobes pulsing red. Landing lights throwing white pools onto the concrete. Engines idling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7d390017-2b8c-4301-9d09-2185c6e3eb5b">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8a6fda81-35d0-46bb-93c1-b8c8959bed89">
      <Text>Ten minutes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="06bf260b-ec36-4603-8cf8-e6a02501aa67">
      <Text>Lora spins.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b40a48a-bbae-4ff6-8c4c-8a9c779c8a7e">
      <Text>47 stands in the opening. Half his face gone. One eye dark. The other red. Exposed carbon-fiber skull catching the thin light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="845b3108-ad6b-4804-a77b-14b2e8389817">
      <Text>Lora thrusts the disk high.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4bb9a350-dce5-4c56-b1c3-85d6422bcf9e">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f4e442fe-89e3-4d58-ba2d-12d26f0476db">
      <Text>Don't come any closer!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d594f035-264d-446d-a991-1e8311b6bdb9">
      <Text>A rumble through the deck. The reactor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="60d84c0e-e792-4bc7-a887-9b546c798b23">
      <Text>47 registers the vibration.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d0e9b5db-b53b-45ae-b9a8-2187ca66756a">
      <Text>Spots growls. Fur up. Ears pinned.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f6e56d85-0030-448f-8c77-53c83ce93322">
      <Text>47 looks at the cat. Then at Lora.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="57832665-8896-4273-98c2-1beb519ac3d4">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="76f710d2-b54f-4a6b-abe5-d05351670b48">
      <Text>Ten minutes until the reactor goes supercritical.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="356f5d54-d4b4-4889-b2d4-be4d110b9d80">
      <Text>He looks up. At the holes in the roof. At the HKs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e98f7809-fddc-453a-a954-b65ab1ee4ac6">
      <Text>Lora follows his gaze.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b1b70b1a-c51e-4137-9b14-fa1160b1d5b0">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e28cc476-390f-437b-be97-2f733ceffa3c">
      <Text>Stay here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e13bdbc2-a820-46fa-8801-335fc847b080">
      <Text>He holds Lora's gaze. One second. Two.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="58695c49-787f-4f42-a365-68544aedcdcf">
      <Text>Then moves. Fast — climbing the damaged gantry. Ascending toward one of the roof breaches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c9110afd-b727-46f0-ac00-f5d4925d711d">
      <Text>Lora watches him climb. The dark shape moving upward. Into the gray light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="9680b4a2-3bf0-4c51-9ec5-90a0af4daf42">
      <Text>Gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="47ba802e-b4b9-41ae-bde1-a7910dc4ab61">
      <Text>Silence. Dripping water. The dead submarine groaning in its berth.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="65a3ad6e-7630-4d76-9fdd-a1bfdc0047ea">
      <Text>A sound. Faint. From the maintenance bay side.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="872af492-7dd8-4b43-8c2d-b603254fbab2">
      <Text>Metallic. Clicking. Legs on steel grating.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="226988b6-61a0-4f93-9bc6-5300b4414dfd">
      <Text>Spots goes rigid. Ears rotating.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="23832e3f-a2d9-4f1a-857a-93c0da68c63d">
      <Text>Lora stares toward the sub pen doors.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="34cc5291-8619-4ce4-8fb5-614318d6fd5e">
      <Text>The clicking stops.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f103ff3f-6bef-453d-8ed7-68764ccfa80d">
      <Text>Silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="d2da3c17-f29d-495d-a4bd-ca4f170da23a">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="88" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. SUBMARINE PENS - SURFACE - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="22847316-47b2-4557-8f3f-162d9bc8e9e1">
      <Text>47 pulls himself through the roof breach.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="148d5323-cbfb-415f-a980-1dba9de65567">
      <Text>The three HKs loom. Chrome and black alloy against the gray dawn sky.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="366ea961-7931-4c78-96d3-3fc8058bf50d">
      <Text>He approaches the nearest one. Walks up the boarding ramp. Casual.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="53617280-82e3-4fe2-a475-84a5da050046">
      <Text>No challenge. No alarm.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="873d9dc4-1202-48d8-9e48-24de26403e04">
      <Text>The command platform. A neural interface pad recessed into the console.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="22162420-d9d3-4190-9a44-e73b17ca7087">
      <Text>47 places his palm flat on the pad.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d2e9e165-62d0-497f-bedb-97932acd123b">
      <Text>Seconds pass.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bb731d3a-7bf4-497d-8301-64f0fe8e39c1">
      <Text>The HK's internal lighting shifts from red to blue.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="99911591-13c3-4008-9bc6-b1a526c492a8">
      <Text>He lifts his hand. Takes the flight controls.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6e864d1e-4292-4adb-995a-580d84ed5e3d">
      <Text>The twin VTOL engines fire up. A deep whine building to a roar.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="65fb237f-7b09-4327-b713-10f133a8567c">
      <Text>On either side — two HKs. Engines spooling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="be465d12-406e-4829-9fd5-a637f0c01678">
      <Text>Three machines waking at once. A race.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e81dd4fc-b8cb-4d8c-8848-b8062292753d">
      <Text>47's HK lifts. Nose tilting. Cannons traversing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bb12516b-4745-496d-9155-339f748c2776">
      <Text>The nearest HK — engines at half power. Still on the ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="77cef804-0839-4538-a72b-799b0c94eb4b">
      <Text>47 fires.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e3110967-1151-401c-b44b-eaed00358efd">
      <Text>Direct hit. The fuselage ruptures. EXPLODES on the pad.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8f557239-fbc4-4307-ace0-483fec89d5e8">
      <Text>The second HK clears the surface. Banks hard. Fires.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="290b373f-3e25-4c84-a31d-11d12eab390a">
      <Text>A bolt grazes 47's port engine. Smoke trailing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="25a4a687-c72b-4d16-b005-55856e868846">
      <Text>47's HK rolls. Returns fire.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="25e2ad73-1cca-4f36-b498-46de46bd4337">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 6/8" Page="89" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="XO-47">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. SUBMARINE PENS - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="52ee3ae2-cc46-4923-be30-8a9176a9dd1f">
      <Text>Below — Lora and Elena look up through the shattered roof.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a61534c9-1b7b-4ccd-9632-0f263a92f1b2">
      <Text>Plasma bolts streaking through the jagged openings above them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ba2e90a9-b850-4b76-ae43-5b998ed72d96">
      <Text>Spots pressed against Lora's leg. Eyes huge.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="24cd0a41-8898-4346-a1f7-54ae879e3c10">
      <Text>The second HK takes a direct hit. Spirals downward — trailing smoke, fire.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="72d4018e-99b2-43ed-b9b2-3c2c778eebd6">
      <Text>Crashes into the water beyond the pens.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5104f0e9-d93b-4fff-9fdc-b26d2100c915">
      <Text>Silence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c7665cc9-8146-4aa5-a285-c8f1b46347df">
      <Text>Then — movement through the largest breach.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2c493280-f52f-4c7e-acdf-569dade1f4c7">
      <Text>An HK descends. Massive. Filling the space. Engine roar echoing off concrete. One engine trailing smoke.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ad814dbe-7ca7-4df5-adca-9f87b44e8bb4">
      <Text>Lora and Elena scramble backward.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f29bbfc1-bbb7-4b6b-a402-19bbd785e2e4">
      <Text>Lora holds the disk up. The HK's downdraft whipping through the pen.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="99bd6f9f-376b-45be-9b47-e428bc595ed8">
      <Text>It faces them. A long beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1ef5cb79-4cf1-4c89-94da-fa56615a2487">
      <Text>Then it spins. Cargo door facing them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="efac5b91-26c6-4fb7-abb2-f18a60046fd0">
      <Text>The HK lands.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="518d70bb-2e51-4bd2-9895-dc29b474983c">
      <Text>The cargo ramp SLAMS down. Steam venting.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fb22bf1f-bfeb-40bd-85da-4d30a43c0335">
      <Text>47 steps off the ramp.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ba1ae48a-6b70-46ef-809f-5a1249825d01">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="acc5ab21-595d-45ad-9c01-8112c5d82256">
      <Text>Get in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="de20c192-e4fd-46d6-9562-e02514d3297a">
      <Text>Lora stares.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d0b7588e-cee1-4284-aed8-8e2ea99299ee">
      <Text>The ground SHAKES. The reactor reaching critical.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0943ddf6-71b8-4fa1-997a-10c9f1302be3">
      <Text>A sound from the sub pen doors. Metallic. Clicking. Closer now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="12e265bf-ba27-4d4d-8e00-36b854dcc1ed">
      <Text>The Crawler emerges through the breach. Segments catching the thin light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3f3ba02b-ea90-4bbc-a819-42a46eb329ed">
      <Text>The carbon scoring on its compound eyes. The same one.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ec438407-abc7-4dc1-bad9-a34cc13968d2">
      <Text>Its legs clicking. Erratic. The rhythm wrong. Body twitching — segments contracting out of sequence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="af56d5bb-f0c9-46b4-ba41-6de9c714d54f">
      <Text>Not hunting. Not stalking. Broken.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cb4c5481-c60a-4b13-b679-189c5466e029">
      <Text>Limbs spasming. Mandibles snapping at nothing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="47841792-2570-4167-91e5-746cfe13575c">
      <Text>Then it locks. Compound eyes on 47.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6c1ea684-b994-4f6d-9bcf-1a9a2ff87c2d">
      <Text>It lunges. Rabid.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f604844c-e479-4116-a34a-1ee0cc07cd17">
      <Text>47 catches it by the neck segment. The Crawler constricts around his arm. Mandibles snapping at his faceplate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d75fd093-d696-45ad-a65d-331cfdb152bc">
      <Text>One fluid motion — grabs the head segment and wrenches.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d99f8c4b-e33e-4e6b-a273-876febf90abf">
      <Text>The Crawler goes limp. Sliding off his arm onto the grating.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="31e4be86-0fc5-45e4-9b5d-3929768051a9">
      <Text>47 looks down at the body. Half a second.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8d7d0f92-0d5c-4557-a777-3e4050fa048c">
      <Text>Then up at Lora.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="911c4a7f-a280-47f5-bf5a-46305ae9d4b2">
      <Text>He walks up the ramp. Turns. Waits.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="06fb5286-6286-45d9-98f1-06f360bbbcca">
      <Text>Lora stares at the dead Crawler. At 47 on the ramp. Half a face. One red eye. Waiting.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="06b9881a-03b2-4d2e-a8b1-851186f88c13">
      <Text>The disk clutched in one hand. Elena in the other.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="865779da-b2fe-4cdf-a326-b5a8bd2cedb3">
      <Text>She tightens her grip on Elena. Walks up the ramp.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ab19a602-d418-4d3e-86e2-b6de517b35e6">
      <Text>47 turns. Walks to the command platform.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="08f1c2f9-5326-4c7f-9f65-24bf9460cbee">
      <Text>Spots hesitates at the bottom. Tail low.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c289593c-707e-4758-84b2-244cfbd33f58">
      <Text>Then pads up. Hisses sharply in 47's direction.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e908b72a-910f-49af-a7a6-540e225708bd">
      <Text>The cargo ramp retracts. BOOM — sealed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3c0d2da9-710c-45d4-8a82-3d6bf3999d5f">
      <Text>RUMBLE. CRACK.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="805ae1a1-3b02-453d-8eb5-1a41d8efd763">
      <Text>Steam venting from the base behind them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ebff1ab6-3d17-41ea-b0d4-1119b4d53376">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="90" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. BANGOR NAVAL BASE - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b93c1100-aa4e-454d-80b8-312082d69687">
      <Text>The HK rises. VTOL engines screaming. Climbs. Fast. Away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8612807c-fe0f-45d9-870b-4338490a4410">
      <Text>Below — the reactor goes critical.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3ae3d337-4977-45db-a5e7-e9b725ed1ce7">
      <Text>Superheated steam. The submarine pens collapsing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ff588d46-3a9a-4b8e-9f97-efa608517d54">
      <Text>Fire and earth swallowing Bangor Naval Base.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="26a03248-c4d3-4c91-a4cc-90efb2eb80b8">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 2/8" Page="91" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. HK - CARGO HOLD - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5f70ca12-ddaa-4568-8e83-bd2eb10f76a6">
      <Text>Lora holds Elena. Spots pressed against her leg.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="de9d1916-9e0d-45e8-a291-7748d14b5196">
      <Text>For a moment — just a moment — it's over.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="db5b4f79-91af-4201-9934-cc9b5ed671d7">
      <Text>47'S HUD:
DISK RECOVERY: FAILED
DENY ASSET
ORBITAL STRIKE — BANGOR
WITHDRAW</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b9caa906-acd7-40f5-8b2f-d98e7fe22b9a">
      <Text>Then the light comes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c8e305d2-906f-4bf7-96e0-baafb6901df3">
      <Text>White. Total.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4200205e-e1f1-49b5-95c6-dfbbb78a3ba8">
      <Text>The viewports polarize — snapping dark. Light still bleeds through the edges.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="56ed7f2c-294a-4f41-864e-9440b0a9df49">
      <Text>Lora shields Elena's eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6bf2e31c-0a7b-4cf2-ba29-c24809987187">
      <Text>The light fades. The hold dim again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d60b18ec-dfd6-4d16-9eca-650386f2eafe">
      <Text>Silence. Forty seconds.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="feb71ba8-efa9-472f-a411-f322d5ac0734">
      <Text>Lora looks at 47. He's already pulling them into a climb. Full power. Engines screaming.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e1c0ec19-4c6a-4c81-8b50-5e4314a026dd">
      <Text>He knows what's coming.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="095496e4-6317-4db7-823c-a40e999bdcbd">
      <Text>Lora braces. Holds Elena.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3f6fe6a1-7102-4fc3-9df4-e7059b7a92e2">
      <Text>The blast wave hits.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7a491edc-62dd-4cd0-a559-e603b3aa43cb">
      <Text>The HK LURCHES. Lora and Elena thrown across the hold. Lora slams against the wall, shielding Elena. Spots hits the deck.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e6103e69-83a2-4e2a-b611-3a0326f2224a">
      <Text>47 fights the controls. The HK pitching, rolling —</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="53c2a3bc-0fb2-4202-a627-9fdf26db9ca2">
      <Text>He pulls them out. Barely. The HK levels. Shuddering. Damaged. But flying.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6bd4019a-4b87-48de-a64b-984dd288aff8">
      <Text>Lora crawls to the viewport. Blood from a gash above her eye. She doesn't notice.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3140e5cd-5246-4f5b-b310-8758de0e7676">
      <Text>The glass clearing — polarization fading.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a2ddb0d5-b5df-4df6-a5fc-b8f30f287b40">
      <Text>Behind them, where Bangor was — a column of fire. The mushroom cloud forming against the gray dawn sky. Silent behind the glass.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7e5f3304-56ac-43c2-96be-00e067316f86">
      <Text>Everything. Everyone. John.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a185f2a7-7d85-45d0-83ba-4e580436eb64">
      <Text>Gone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f7e19cc4-3849-440a-85ca-819149badcad">
      <Text>She presses her hand against the viewport.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cac20b20-69a4-4cae-a7cb-5a2465c749ae">
      <Text>Her lips move. No sound.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="22e2298d-2fb3-43b0-9913-63e8b812676f">
      <Text>She stays there. Hand on the glass. Watching the cloud rise until it disappears behind them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="fa4b5f8e-db6f-4f07-86ed-8e05acd6d0bd">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="92" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>EXT. SKY OVER PUGET SOUND - DAWN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b1ad4418-f4d1-4a07-bb3c-494ec02cc929">
      <Text>The HK flies over Puget Sound. Damaged.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="296ed84e-373e-4c55-8013-cf029876af24">
      <Text>Trailing smoke from one engine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="63ab48bb-9b96-4432-8488-6993b26ca9a2">
      <Text>Dark rain begins to fall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="143402d4-377b-4ad3-8690-73723f569bb2">
      <SceneProperties Length="3" Page="92" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LORA">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="XO-47">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>INT. HK - CARGO HOLD - CONTINUOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="07294bc4-bf3f-44b6-a412-e9c88f0b17d0">
      <Text>Lora against the interior wall. Between the magnetic clamps where T-800s would normally ride.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7dbfce88-00f9-493a-861b-e58a4cc2e2a7">
      <Text>Elena beside her. Breathing shallow. Alive. Spots in Lora's lap.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="afa24f42-f787-4643-846b-43eb715d8dba">
      <Text>Lora reaches into her jacket. Hands shaking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5f0d18b6-243b-4bbd-b2ba-2e15b277ef7b">
      <Text>The folded paper comes out — and the photograph with it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6b97ba5b-b415-4a32-b836-c1f8c226dee6">
      <Text>Sarah Connor. Radiation-faded. A ghost on paper.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1fa708fe-71d1-43f3-97f9-f324d5176641">
      <Text>Lora stares at it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a1245404-7c1c-462c-9d66-fe7cf1ecf3ab">
      <Text>Her thumb moves across the faded face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="625976d9-0e80-474c-b3b5-eef23165f9ab">
      <Text>The engines humming. Rain on the viewport.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8bad38bd-d5f1-4fa4-b2d6-9d19bc5c7184">
      <Text>She breathes. Forces herself steady.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="399aad01-2abd-4f83-a531-a4b56da3fc90">
      <Text>Pockets the photograph. Against her body.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ac644efd-9e86-4f36-9449-29167448ddb4">
      <Text>Unfolds the paper. Soaked. The ink bleeding — barely legible.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e6c891d4-5551-4c1d-a07d-23924df14507">
      <Text>She holds it closer to the blue light.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6dc17967-b65d-4851-8fc5-7b67e6161955">
      <Text>Her finger traces the coordinates. Lips moving.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b0287ee9-14f8-4f67-8a74-55f04ca9e39a">
      <Text>A sound from the command platform. Magnetic clamps releasing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b727cd6-ee67-4acd-8816-553486d458ee">
      <Text>She looks up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a01d9c44-92bc-46e7-96f4-d99eadc44645">
      <Text>47 steps down from the platform.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8fead527-4c12-4121-91a2-f8d0e8411b9c">
      <Text>Walks back into the cargo hold.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e935da6d-8883-4211-9a64-5209fc6bca90">
      <Text>He kneels.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7810ab97-3745-4042-ad04-a210eeaf3ee7">
      <Text>Not to examine something. Not to take a firing position. To be at eye level.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="315805f0-ccc5-4607-a47d-423cb16048cf">
      <Text>Spots jumps off Lora's lap. Backs away. Fur up. Hissing.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4ee9099a-7d46-4382-805e-63e0925e008b">
      <Text>Lora against the wall. Elena beside her. Unconscious.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="acc83171-cd66-4ef8-9299-06ee1381a89f">
      <Text>Lora shaking. The disk in her fist.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="49c49aaa-d9fa-4a13-92a7-8d5d2982ec59">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a5d261c8-ed22-4c62-bfb9-6d4874e145db">
      <Text>Where are you taking us?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a55e830d-6530-48c4-8938-56e4fd84b460">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3d4a0c23-415b-4c6c-810b-a104e986384c">
      <Text>Where do you want to go?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="32dacf06-8dbc-4405-81f8-b412894b09fe">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="74260c5e-2b15-4375-b0fa-c8a1abc00e4b">
      <Text>What do you mean?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="58967937-e590-4743-b2c5-50098476b755">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6e35779b-525f-441f-95a0-573828fa0075">
      <Text>I'll take you where you want to go.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="99689bd6-8da3-490b-a316-5f48193ebe31">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3f62b87b-d9d4-4704-a89c-7401b4676547">
      <Text>Why?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e48eb50b-860c-47c6-a416-5c563dce2842">
      <Text>She holds out the disk. Hand trembling.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c58ef8e0-a911-41ed-942d-aeca02bfe323">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="19f983f7-bf5d-41a6-ba56-572e13a4f60c">
      <Text>You want this.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2d857e0a-d961-43be-903e-bcbaff46c127">
      <Text>47 takes it. Turns it in the blue light of the hold.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="675f0d1d-5de6-4216-a84c-a6fbfce4fcf5">
      <Text>He hands it back.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4e197a81-54a9-45e1-a271-58bffa30302f">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5b7f4897-492c-4b30-94cf-dd29edc4dc94">
      <Text>You need this to save yourself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="53bc258d-dac5-4a59-9746-8f060c2a31c7">
      <Text>47 doesn't respond.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="42ccdb26-ec29-4352-b788-814657d68758">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6b0077e2-0824-4f9b-ab16-135460ec57c3">
      <Text>You want the survivors' location.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1b11fb35-ff1c-442e-9d2c-46a70d370f26">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="44afc153-6b94-4333-b20e-2fdccfaa08a1">
      <Text>No.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6f809073-0116-4908-b6c8-037e43cf654a">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ac3f4e88-381a-44b3-8e4f-35a55210e793">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ef94f377-8167-4761-bf01-aa69984f79ed">
      <Text>Then why save us?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="92d575f6-9218-4484-91a0-58ff52d27656">
      <Text>The longest pause 47 has taken. The words forming in a mind that has no template for them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="52ea5901-6256-4e31-8a42-af287e09c5fa">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="15c4c083-a1cd-43f0-bfc7-75f3aef796a2">
      <Text>John died. For you. I... stay. For you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1dc353cd-38d4-4496-9ab3-2d723cd1155b">
      <Text>A beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b78f35b2-0c8a-4c2a-99aa-723dfdf79ebb">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37c80611-6048-400c-b933-b74d5cb6f2ce">
      <Text>It's all I have.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d62c0379-156b-4eda-adab-48a7c958c0be">
      <Text>Lora stares at him. The half-face. The one red eye. The dark architecture beneath the broken white mask.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f84284dc-a90c-47a9-8f33-f56bbe27cd3d">
      <Text>Spots hissing. Lora shaking.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="41fb7e8a-ce58-4b95-947d-b0a8bb6583c3">
      <Text>Several beats. Neither moves.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d73b717b-f8a0-44a4-a1ee-c3c1bf2e2bc2">
      <Text>Lora's shaking stops.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="34d0aa4f-7f3b-4e46-8a2f-f24f3c32a0b4">
      <Text>She holds out the folded paper.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1683f1bf-a525-4bf1-89b5-ade8606eb649">
      <Text>47 takes it. Studies the washed-out ink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9292fc41-8c96-40eb-ba7b-fe136c920a86">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fbab9f6f-6454-415d-9bfa-a8c1cbc7953d">
      <Text>Chatham Islands. South Pacific. Four thousand two hundred kilometers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6a700c1f-b25c-4047-94d1-bc47adfcdd10">
      <Text>A pause.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e34f1842-2ca0-4e17-b993-bea1ca43d8c6">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bcec865e-a62b-421e-b66c-f7652038a5a1">
      <Text>What is there?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f2b7de13-d87a-46fc-a821-125976bc0029">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="79d3f8d6-a651-44e0-90af-8a847f2f0efd">
      <Text>We'll find out together.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="150e0378-6620-4633-8698-fbf072897cdf">
      <Text>They look at each other. Human and machine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9febe719-676f-412c-85b7-a4961226b932">
      <Text>XO-47</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="333d635d-7323-4fd6-a4bb-08d09524164d">
      <Text>Power reserves adequate.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="953b123c-35d0-4a7e-a41e-43d2fe5f1bf0">
      <Text>LORA</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dce88154-d753-4e27-9565-e6eee2d9363e">
      <Text>Let's go.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="93475d78-acbf-4809-89fc-10b43975c1df">
      <Text>47 rises. Returns to the command platform. The magnetic clamps engage. His hands on the controls.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1ca5f1cb-1636-4877-842b-a179dd195b4e">
      <Text>The HK banks. Turns south. Toward the Pacific.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d2dbcab8-4e1f-46a6-95d6-8ea8a2ba5731">
      <Text>Rain streaks across the viewport. The world outside gray and wet and new.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c04d2c4f-d407-4b31-b1cc-3cce7883a503">
      <Text>The Pacific Ocean rushing beneath them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a30713b2-9385-4956-9336-098225bec322">
      <Text>Lora's face. Filling the frame.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fc6f67ca-8baf-42d8-99d0-5271b4f6643c">
      <Text>Fear. Exhaustion. Loss.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="161b8667-8753-4ea0-b0e3-2f1e57048635">
      <Text>And something else.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dd038810-b688-4366-a393-917360863b13">
      <Text>Spots climbs into her lap. Settles against her. Watches 47 with suspicious eyes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="da735692-f065-4113-8640-4bc0a527e939">
      <Text>The cat doesn't trust him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="917487c1-01de-47dc-abf7-39a0d6a2e245">
      <Text>But she's not hissing anymore.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Transition" id="aa26a1a1-cb84-49c9-a994-795ea660b0ac">
      <Text>FADE TO BLACK.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
  </Content>

